,"unit":13,"lesson":"5C","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["bored","/bɔːd/","ADJ","güýmenjesiz, darýan","скучающий","unhappy because nothing is interesting","I am bored at home.","Öýde darýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","feel bored","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":13,"lesson":"5C","page":34,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"ele","unit":2,"lesson":"2C","page":18,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":4,"lesson":"4C","page":34,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["ill","/ɪl/","ADJ","näsag","больной","not well, sick","He is ill today.","Ol bu gün näsag.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","feel ill","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":13,"lesson":"5C","page":34,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"pre","unit":5,"lesson":"5C","page":42,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["doctor","/ˈdɒktə/","N","lukman","врач","a person whose job is to treat sick people","My mother is a doctor.","Enem lukman.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":24,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["nurse","/nɜːs/","N","şepagat uýasy","медсестра","a person who looks after sick people","The nurse helps the doctor.","Şepagat uýasy lukmana kömek edýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":24,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["waiter","/ˈweɪtə/","N","ofisiant","официант","a man who brings food in a restaurant","The waiter brings the menu.","Ofisiant menýuny getirýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE2","page":28,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["waitress","/ˈweɪtrəs/","N","ofisiantka","официантка","a woman who brings food in a restaurant","The waitress is very friendly.","Ofisiantka gaty mähirli.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":24,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["policeman","/pəˈliːsmən/","N","polisiýa işgäri","полицейский","a man whose job is to stop crime","The policeman stops the car.","Polisiýa işgäri maşyny saklaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["policewoman","/pəˈliːswʊmən/","N","polisiýa işgäri (aýal)","полицейская","a woman whose job is to stop crime","She wants to be a policewoman.","Ol polisiýa işgäri bolmak isleýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["shop assistant","/ʃɒp əˈsɪstənt/","N","dükan satyjysy","продавец","a person who serves customers in a shop","The shop assistant helps me.","Satyjy maňa kömek edýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":32,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["receptionist","/rɪˈsepʃənɪst/","N","resepsiýa işgäri","администратор","a person who welcomes guests in a hotel or office","The receptionist gives you the key.","Resepsiýa işgäri açary berýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":24,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["factory worker","/ˈfæktri ˈwɜːkə/","N","zawod işçisi","рабочий завода","a person who works in a factory","He is a factory worker.","Ol zawod işçisi.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":24,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["taxi driver","/ˈtæksi ˈdraɪvə/","N","taksi sürüjisi","таксист","a person who drives a taxi","The taxi driver knows the city.","Taksi sürüji