ʊ ˈdʒɒɡɪŋ/","PHR","haýal ylgamak","бегать трусцой","to run slowly for exercise","She goes jogging in the park.","Parkda haýal ylgamaga gidýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go dancing","/ɡəʊ ˈdɑːnsɪŋ/","PHR","tans etmäge gitmek","ходить танцевать","to go somewhere to dance","We go dancing on Friday.","Anna güni tans etmäge gidýäris.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go fishing","/ɡəʊ ˈfɪʃɪŋ/","PHR","balyk tutmaga gitmek","ходить на рыбалку","to try to catch fish","My father goes fishing.","Kakam balyk tutmaga gidýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go for a walk","/ɡəʊ fɔːr ə wɔːk/","PHR","aýlanmaga gitmek","идти на прогулку","to walk somewhere for pleasure","Let's go for a walk.","Geliň aýlanmaga gideliň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go on a trip","/ɡəʊ ɒn ə trɪp/","PHR","syýahata gitmek","поехать в поездку","to travel somewhere for pleasure","We went on a trip to the mountains.","Daglaryň ýanyna syýahata gitdik.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go to a party","/ɡəʊ tə ə ˈpɑːti/","PHR","toýa/agşamlyk dabara gitmek","идти на вечеринку","to go to a social event","She goes to a party tonight.","Bu agşam toýa gidýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["go to a concert","/ɡəʊ tə ə ˈkɒnsət/","PHR","konserte gitmek","идти на концерт","to go to hear music played live","We went to a concert.","Konserte gitdik.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["like","/laɪk/","V","halamak","нравиться","to enjoy or approve of something","I like cooking.","Nahar bişirmegi halaýaryn.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","like doing","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":22,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["love","/lʌv/","V","gowy görmek, söýmek","любить","to like something very much","She loves music.","Ol sazy gowy görýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","love doing","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["hate","/heɪt/","V","ýigrenmek","ненавидеть","to dislike something very much","He hates getting up early.","Ir turmagy ýigrenýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","hate doing","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["take a train","/teɪk ə treɪn/","PHR","otly bilen gitmek","ехать на поезде","to travel by train","We took a train to Istanbul.","Stambula otly bilen gitdik.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["wait for a flight","/weɪt fɔːr ə flaɪt/","PHR","uçuşa garamak","ждать рейс","to wait at an airport for your plane","We waited for the flight for two hours.","Uçuşa iki sagat garadyk.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["rent a car","/rent ə kɑː/","PHR","maşyn kärendesine almak","взять машину напрокат","to pay to use a car for a time","We rented a car in Italy.","Italiýada maşyn kärendesine aldyk.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["arrive","/əˈraɪv/","V","baryp ýetmek","прибывать","to reach a place","The train arrives at six.","Otly sagat altyda gelýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","arrive at","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":12,"lesson":"12C","page":98,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"pre","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["buy presents","/baɪ ˈpreznts/","PHR","sowgat satyn almak","покупать подарки","to get things to give to people","I need to buy presents.","Sowgat satyn almaly.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["journey","/ˈdʒɜːni/","N","ýolagçylyk, syýahat","путешествие","an act of travelling from one place to another","The journey takes three hours.","Ýol üç sagat dowam edýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","a long journey","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":14,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["airport","/ˈeəpɔːt/","N","howa menzili","аэропорт","a place where planes take off and land","The airport is far from the city.","Howa menzili şäherden uzak.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","at the airport","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["station","/ˈsteɪʃn/","N","beket, stansiýa","вокзал","a place where trains or buses stop","The train leaves from the station.","Otly stansiýadan gidýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","railway station","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","page":78,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ticket","/ˈtɪkɪt/","N","bilet","билет","a piece of paper that allows you to travel or enter","I bought two tickets.","Iki bilet satyn aldym.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","buy a ticket","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":12,"lesson":"12C","page":98,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["luggage","/ˈlʌɡɪdʒ/","N","ýük, bagaj","багаж","the bags you take when you travel","We have two pieces of luggage.","Iki sany bagažymyz bar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","a piece of luggage","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":14,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["holiday","/ˈhɒlədeɪ/","N","dynç alyş","отпуск, каникулы","a time when you do not work or study","We are on holiday.","Dynç alyşda.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","on holiday","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"ele","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["homework","/ˈhəʊmwɜːk/","N","öý işi","домашнее задание","work a teacher gives you to do at home","I do my homework after school.","Öý işimi mekdepden soň edýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","do your homework","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["stay in a hotel","/steɪ ɪn ə həʊˈtel/","PHR","myhmanhanada galmak","остановиться в гостинице","to sleep in a hotel when you are away from home","We stay in a hotel on holiday.","Dynç alyşda myhmanhanada galýarys.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":54,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["cap","/kæp/","N","kepka","кепка","a soft hat with a part that sticks out in front","He wears a blue cap.","Gök kepka geýýär.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","wear a cap","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":56,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hat","/hæt/","N","telpek, şlýapa","шляпа","something you wear on your head","Take off your hat.","Telpegiňi aýyr.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","wear a hat","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":56,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"pre","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["coat","/kəʊt/","N","palto","пальто","a warm piece of clothing you wear outside","Put on your coat.","Paltoňy geý.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","wear a coat","New",[{"book":"beg","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":56,"section":"vocabulary"},{"b