Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["answer the questions","/ˈɑːnsə ðə ˈkwestʃənz/","PHR","soraglara jogap beriň","ответьте на вопросы","what a teacher asks you to do","Answer the questions in pairs.","Soraglara jübüt bolup jogap beriň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stand up","/stænd ʌp/","PHR","turuň","встаньте","to get to your feet","Stand up, please.","Turuň, haýyş.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sit down","/sɪt daʊn/","PHR","oturyň","садитесь","to move onto a seat","Sit down and listen.","Oturyň we diňläň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["turn off your phone","/tɜːn ɒf jɔː fəʊn/","PHR","telefonyňyzy öçüriň","выключите телефон","to stop a phone working","Turn off your phone in class.","Sapakda telefonyňyzy öçüriň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["I don't understand","/aɪ dəʊnt ˌʌndəˈstænd/","PHR","düşünmeýärin","я не понимаю","what you say when something is not clear","Sorry, I don't understand.","Bagyşlaň, düşünmeýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["I don't know","/aɪ dəʊnt nəʊ/","PHR","bilmeýärin","я не знаю","what you say when you have no answer","I'm afraid I don't know.","Gynansam-da bilmeýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["How do you spell...?","/haʊ du ju spel/","PHR","nähili harplaýarys?","как это пишется по буквам?","used to ask for the letters of a word","How do you spell your name?","Adyňyzy nähili harplaýarys?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["How do you say...?","/haʊ du ju seɪ/","PHR","nähili aýdylýar?","как сказать...?","used to ask for a word in another language","How do you say \"kitap\" in English?","\"kitap\" iňlisçe nähili aýdylýar?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["Can you help me?","/kæn ju help miː/","PHR","maňa kömek edip bilersiňizmi?","вы можете мне помочь?","used to ask for help politely","Can you help me with this exercise?","Bu maşka kömek edip bilersiňizmi?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["What page is it?","/wɒt peɪdʒ ɪz ɪt/","PHR","haýsy sahypa?","какая это страница?","used to ask which page to look at","What page is it? Page twelve.","Haýsy sahypa? On ikinji.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1,"lesson":"1C","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["coin","/kɔɪn/","N","teňňe","монета","a flat round piece of metal money","I found a coin on the floor.","Ýerde bir teňňe tapdym.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":14,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["headphones","/ˈhedfəʊnz/","N","gulaklyk","наушники","a device you wear on your head to listen privately","I listen with headphones.","Gulaklyk bilen diňleýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":14,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"int","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["identity card","/aɪˈdentəti kɑːd/","N","şahsyýetnama","удостоверение личности","an official card that shows who you are","Show your identity card.","Şahsyýetnamaňyzy görkeziň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":14,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["magazine","/