ion":"wordbuilding"}]],["difference","/ˈdɪfrəns/","N","tapawut","разница","the way things are not the same","There is a big difference between them.","Olaryň arasynda uly tapawut bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","tell the difference","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["importance","/ɪmˈpɔːtns/","N","ähmiýet","важность","why something matters","She explained the importance of sleep.","Ukynyň ähmiýetini düşündirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","of great importance","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["movement","/ˈmuːvmənt/","N","hereket","движение","the act of changing position","The dancer made slow movements.","Tansçy haýal hereketler etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","a sudden movement","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["pollution","/pəˈluːʃn/","N","hapalanma","загрязнение","damage to air, water or land","Pollution is a serious problem.","Hapalanma çynlakaý mesele.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","air pollution","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["solution","/səˈluːʃn/","N","çözgüt","решение (проблемы)","the answer to a problem","We found a simple solution.","Ýönekeý çözgüt tapdyk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","find a solution","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["success","/səkˈses/","N","üstünlik (netije)","успех","when you achieve what you want","The shop was a great success.","Dükan uly üstünlik gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","a big success","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"int","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"int","unit":10}]],["advice","/ədˈvaɪs/","N","maslahat","совет","helpful words about what to do","She gave me good advice.","Maňa gowy maslahat berdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["competition","/ˌkɒmpəˈtɪʃn/","N","bäsleşik","соревнование","an event where people try to win","He won a photo competition.","Foto bäsleşiginde ýeňdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["invention","/ɪnˈvenʃn/","N","oýlap tapyş","изобретение","a new thing that someone makes for the first time","The internet is a great invention.","Internet beýik oýlap tapyş.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["invitation","/ˌɪnvɪˈteɪʃn/","N","çakylyk","приглашение","a message asking you to come","Thank you for the invitation.","Çakylyk üçin sag boluň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"int","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["advise","/ədˈvaɪz/","V","maslahat bermek","советовать","to tell someone what they should do","I advise you to wait.","Saňa garaşmagy maslahat berýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["compete","/kəmˈpiːt/","V","bäsleşmek","соревноваться","to try to win against others","They compete in swimming.","Ýüzmekde bäsleşýärler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["confuse","/kənˈfjuːz/","V","çaşdyrmak","смущать, путать","to make something difficult to understand","The rules confused me.","Kadalar meni çaşdyrdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["educate","/ˈedʒukeɪt/","V","bilim bermek","обучать","to teach someone at school or university","She was educated in England.","Ol Angliýada bilim aldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["invite","/ɪnˈvaɪt/","V","çagyrmak","приглашать","to ask someone to come somewhere","They invited us to dinner.","Bizi agşamlyk nahara çagyrdylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["pronounce","/prəˈnaʊns/","V","telaffuz etmek","произносить","to say a word","How do you pronounce your name?","Adyňy nähili telaffuz etmeli?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["revise","/rɪˈvaɪz/","V","gaýtalamak","повторять (материал перед экзаменом)","to study again before an exam","I revised all weekend.","Bütin hepde ahyry gaýtaladym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"int","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["succeed","/səkˈsiːd/","V","üstünlik gazanmak","преуспевать","to do what you wanted to do","She succeeded in the end.","Ahyrynda üstünlik gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["hairdryer","/ˈheədraɪə/","N","saç guradyjy","фен","a machine that dries your hair","I use a hairdryer every morning.","Her irden saç guradyjy ulanýaryn.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"int","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["raincoat","/ˈreɪnkəʊt/","N","ýagyş plashy","дождевик","a coat you wear in the rain","Take your raincoat, it is raining.","Ýagyş plashyňy al, ýagyş ýagýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11B","page":88,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["both","/bəʊθ/","DET","ikisi hem","оба","the two together","Both sisters live abroad.","Iki uýa hem daşary ýurtda ýaşaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","both of them","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["neither","/ˈnaɪðə(r)/","DET","hiç haýsysy","ни тот ни другой","not one and not the other","Neither answer was correct.","Hiç haýsy jogap dogry däldi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","neither of us","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["either","/ˈaɪðə(r)/","DET","islendigi","любой из двух","one or the other","You can take either bus.","Islendik awtobusa münüp bilersiň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","either side","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["the same as","/ðə seɪm əz/","PHR","birmeňzeş","такой же, как","exactly like something else","My bag is the same as yours.","Sumkam senkiň bilen birmeňzeş.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","the same as mine","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["different from","/ˈdɪfrənt frɒm/","PHR","tapawutly","отличающийся от","not the same as","Life here is different from the city.","Bu ýerdäki durmuş şäherden tapawutly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","different from mine","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["in common","/ɪn ˈkɒmən/","PHR","meňzeşlik","общее","shared interests or features","The twins have a lot in common.","Ekizleriň köp meňzeşligi bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","have things in common","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["alike","/əˈlaɪk/","ADV","meňzeş","похоже","in the same way","The brothers look alike.","Doganlar meňzeş görünýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","look alike","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":11,"lesson":"11C","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["unlike"