,"discuss a problem","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["argue","/ˈɑːɡjuː/","V","jedelleşmek","спорить","to speak angrily because you disagree","They argued about money.","Pul barada jedelleşdiler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","argue with","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["complain","/kəmˈpleɪn/","V","zeýrenmek","жаловаться","to say you are not happy about something","He complained about the noise.","Goh barada zeýrendi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","complain about","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["inform","/ɪnˈfɔːm/","V","habar bermek","информировать","to tell someone facts officially","Please inform us of any changes.","Üýtgeşmeler barada habar bermegiňizi haýyş edýäris.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","inform us","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["admit","/ədˈmɪt/","V","boýun almak","признавать","to agree something is true","She admitted her mistake.","Ýalňyşyny boýun aldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","admit that","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["deny","/dɪˈnaɪ/","V","inkär etmek","отрицать","to say something is not true","He denied taking the money.","Puly alandygyny inkär etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","deny doing","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["warn","/wɔːn/","V","duýdurmak","предупреждать","to tell someone about a danger","They warned us about the storm.","Tupan barada duýdurdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","warn about","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["announce","/əˈnaʊns/","V","yglan etmek","объявлять","to tell people officially","They announced the winner on stage.","Ýeňijini sahnada yglan etdiler.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","announce the results","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":12,"lesson":"12B","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["how often",