"/wɔːn aʊt/","ADJ","könelen","изношенный","old and unusable from use","These shoes are worn out.","Bu aýakgaplar könelipdir.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE3","page":44,"section":"practical_english"}]],["credit note","/ˈkredɪt nəʊt/","N","kredit kagyzy","кредитный талон","a paper worth money in a shop","The shop gave me a credit note.","Dükan maňa kredit kagyzy berdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","get a credit note","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE3","page":44,"section":"practical_english"}]],["tight","/taɪt/","ADJ","gysyk","тесный","too small; fitting closely","These jeans are too tight.","Bu jinsi gaty gysyk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","too tight","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE3","page":44,"section":"practical_english"}]],["loose","/luːs/","ADJ","giň","свободный, просторный","not tight; bigger than needed","The coat is a bit loose.","Palto birjyk giň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","too loose","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE3","page":44,"section":"practical_english"}]],["customer service","/ˈkʌstəmə ˈsɜːvɪs/","N","müşderi hyzmaty","обслуживание клиентов","the department that helps buyers","Take it to customer service.","Müşderi hyzmatyna alyp bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","contact customer service","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE3","page":44,"section":"practical_english"}]],["painkiller","/ˈpeɪnkɪlə(r)/","N","agyry aýryjy","обезболивающее","medicine that stops pain","Take a painkiller with food.","Nahar bilen agyry aýryjy iç.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take a painkiller","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["medicine","/ˈmedsn/","N","derman","лекарство","something you take when ill","The medicine tastes bitter.","Derman ajy tagamly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take medicine","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["dose","/dəʊs/","N","doza","доза","the amount of medicine to take","Take one dose twice a day.","Günde iki gezek bir doza iç.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a double dose","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["prescription","/prɪˈskrɪpʃn/","N","resept","рецепт","a doctor's paper for medicine","You need a prescription for these.","Bular üçin resept gerek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a doctor's prescription","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ointment","/ˈɔɪntmənt/","N","maz","мазь","a cream for the skin","Put this ointment on the burn.","Şu mazy ýanan ýere çal.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["bandage","/ˈbændɪdʒ/","N","sargy","бинт","cloth wrapped round an injury","He put a bandage on my hand.","Elime sargy sardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","put on a bandage","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["plaster","/ˈplɑːstə(r)/","N","ýelmeýji","пластырь","a small cover for a cut","I need a plaster for my finger.","Barmagym üçin ýelmeýji gerek.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["allergy","/ˈælədʒi/","N","allergiýa","аллергия","a bad reaction to food or plants","She has an allergy to nuts.","Hoza allergiýasy bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","an allergy to","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["symptom","/ˈsɪmptəm/","N","alamat","симптом","a sign of an illness","What are your symptoms?","Alamatlaryňyz nähili?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","flu symptoms","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pharmacist","/ˈfɑːməsɪst/","N","dermançy","фармацевт","a person who prepares medicine","Ask the pharmacist for advice.","Dermançydan maslahat sora.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE4","page":60,"section":"practical_english"}]],["crossroads","/ˈkrɒsrəʊdz/","N","çatryk","перекрёсток","a place where roads meet","Stop at the crossroads.","Çatrykda saklan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","at the crossroads","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"}]],["roundabout","/ˈraʊndəbaʊt/","N","tegelek ýol","кольцевая развязка","a circle where several roads meet","Take the second exit at the roundabout.","Tegelek ýolda ikinji çykalgadan çyk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","at the roundabout","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"}]],["traffic lights","/ˈtræfɪk laɪts/","N","ýol çyralary","светофор","lights that control traffic","Wait at the traffic lights.","Ýol çyralarynda gara.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","at the traffic lights","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"}]],["pavement","/ˈpeɪvmənt/","N","ýanýoda","тротуар","the path beside a road","Walk on the pavement.","Ýanýodada ýöre.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","on the pavement","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"intp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","page":96,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["corner","/ˈkɔːnə(r)/","N","burç","угол","where two streets meet","The shop is on the corner.","Dükan burçda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","on the corner","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE5","page":76,"section":"practical_english"}]],["hang up","/hæŋ ʌp/","PHR","turbany goýmak","класть трубку","to end a phone call","Don't hang up yet.","Entek turbany goýma.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","hang up the phone","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["ring","/rɪŋ/","V","jaň etmek","звонить","to telephone someone","I will ring you tonight.","Şu gije saňa jaň ederin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","ring a friend","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["answer the phone","/ˈɑːnsə ðə fəʊn/","PHR","telefona jogap bermek","отвечать на звонок","to speak when the phone rings","She answered the phone on the second ring.","Ikinji jaňda telefona jogap berdi.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["voicemail","/ˈvɔɪsmeɪl/","N","sesli hat","голосовая почта","a recorded phone message","I left a message on her voicemail.","Sesli poçtasyna habar goýdum.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","leave a voicemail","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["signal","/ˈsɪɡnəl/","N","signal","сигнал (связи)","the connection for a phone","There is no signal here.","Bu ýerde signal ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","a weak signal","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["charge","/tʃɑːdʒ/","V","zarýadlamak","заряжать","to put power into a battery","I need to charge my phone.","Telefonymy zarýadlamaly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","charge a phone","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["text","/tekst/","N","sms","текстовое сообщение","a written phone message","I sent you a text.","Saňa sms iberdim.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","send a text","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["speak up","/spiːk ʌp/","PHR","sesiňi galdyrmak","говорить громче","to speak louder","Sorry, can you speak up?","Bagyşlaň, sesiňizi galdyryp bilersiňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":13,"lesson":"PE6","page":92,"section":"practical_english"}]],["boil","/bɔɪl/","V","gaýnatmak","кипятить; варить","to cook in very hot water","Boil the eggs for eight minutes.","Ýumurtgalary sekiz minut gaýnat.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fry","/fraɪ/","V","gowurmak","жарить","to cook in hot oil","She fried the potatoes.","Ol ýeralmany gowurdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["grill","/ɡrɪl/","V","kabap etmek","жарить на гриле","to cook over fire or hot metal","We grilled the fish outside.","Balygy daşarda kabap etdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["roast","/rəʊst/","V","kabap bişirmek","запекать","to cook meat in the oven","Mum roasted a chicken.","Ejem towuk kabap bişirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","roast chicken","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bake","/beɪk/","V","tamdyrda bişirmek","выпекать","to cook bread or cakes in an oven","She baked a birthday cake.","Doglan güni üçin keks bişirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","bake a cake","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["steam","/stiːm/","V","bugda bişirmek","готовить на пару","to cook over boiling water","Steamed vegetables are healthy.","Bugda bişen gök önümler peýdaly.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["chop","/tʃɒp/","V","dogramak","крошить, рубить","to cut into small pieces","Chop the onions finely.","Sogany ownuk dogra.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","chop the onions","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["slice","/slaɪs/","V","tilimlemek","нарезать ломтиками","to cut into thin flat pieces","Slice the bread, please.","Çöregi tilimle.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","slice the bread","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mix","/mɪks/","V","garyşdyrmak","смешивать","to put things together and stir","Mix the flour and sugar.","Uny we şekeri garyşdyr.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","mix the ingredients","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stir","/stɜː(r)/","V","garmak","мешать","to move a spoon round in a liquid","Stir the soup slowly.","Çorbany haýal garyşdyr.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","stir the sauce","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pour","/pɔː(r)/","V","guýmak","наливать","to make a liquid flow from a container","Pour the tea into the cups.","Çaýy käselere guý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pour the water","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ingredient","/ɪnˈɡriːdiənt/","N","goşundy","ингредиент","one of the things you use to make food","We need five ingredients.","Bize bäş goşundy gerek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","fresh ingredients","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["recipe","/ˈresəpi/","N","tagam ýasalyşy","рецепт","instructions for cooking a dish","This recipe is very easy.","Bu tagam ýasalyşy gaty aňsat.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","follow a recipe","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bitter","/ˈbɪtə(r)/","ADJ","ajy","горький","having a sharp unpleasant taste","The coffee tasted bitter.","Kofe ajy tagamly boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fresh","/freʃ/","ADJ","täze","свежий","recently made or picked; not frozen","Buy fresh fruit at the market.","Bazardan täze miwe al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","fresh bread","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tasty","/ˈteɪsti/","ADJ","tagamly","вкусный","having a good flavour","That was a tasty meal.","Ol tagamly nahardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lobster","/ˈlɒbstə/","N","omar","омар, лобстер","a large sea animal with claws","The lobster was very expensive.","Omar gaty gymmatdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mussels","/ˈmʌslz/","N","midiýa","мидии","small black shellfish you can eat","We had mussels in a creamy sauce.","Midiýany kremli sousda iýdik.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["prawns","/prɔːnz/","N","krewetka","креветки","small sea animals you eat, like very small lobsters","I love prawns in garlic butter.","Sarymsak ýagyndaky krewetkany gowy görýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["squid","/skwɪd/","N","kalmar","кальмар","a sea animal with a long body, used as food","They served fried squid.","Olar gowrulan kalmar berdiler.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tuna","/ˈtjuːnə/","N","tunes balygy","тунец","a large sea fish eaten as food","I had a tuna sandwich.","Tunes balykly buterbrod iýdim.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["beef","/biːf/","N","sygyr eti","говядина","meat from a cow","The beef was very tender.","Sygyr eti gaty ýumşakdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["duck","/dʌk/","N","ördek eti","утка (мясо)","meat from a duck","Duck with orange sauce is a classic dish.","Apelsin sously ördek klassik tagam.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lamb","/læm/","N","goýun eti, guzy eti","баранина","meat from a young sheep","We cooked lamb on the fire.","Odunda guzy eti bişirdik.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pork","/pɔːk/","N","doňuz eti","свинина","meat from a pig","He never eats pork.","Ol doňuz etini hiç iýmeýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["aubergine","/ˈəʊbədʒiːn/","N","badamjan","баклажан","a long purple vegetable","She made a dish with aubergine.","Ol badamjanly tagam bişirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["avocado","/ˌævəˈkɑːdəʊ/","N","awokado","авокадо","a green fruit with a large seed","Avocado on toast is popular.","Tostdaky awokado meşhur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["beetroot","/ˈbiːtruːt/","N","gyzyl çugundyr","свёкла","a round dark red vegetable","Beetroot makes your hands red.","Gyzyl çugundyr elleriňi gyzyl edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cabbage","/ˈkæbɪdʒ/","N","kelem","капуста","a large round green vegetable","She cooked cabbage with meat.","Kelemi et bilen bişirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cherries","/ˈtʃeriz/","N","alça, ülje","вишни, черешни","small soft round red fruits","We picked cherries in the garden.","Bagda alça ýyğdyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["courgette","/kʊəˈʒet/","N","kabak","кабачок","a long green vegetable (British English)","Add the courgette to the pan.","Kabagy çemçe goş.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cucumber","/ˈkjuːkʌmbə/","N","hyýar","огурец","a long green vegetable eaten raw","Put cucumber in the salad.","Hyýary salata sal.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["grapes","/ɡreɪps/","N","üzüm","виноград","small sweet green or purple fruits","She bought a kilo of grapes.","Bir kilo üzüm satyn aldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mango","/ˈmæŋɡəʊ/","N","mango","манго","a sweet yellow tropical fruit","Mango is my favourite fruit.","Mango meniň iň söýýän miwäm.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cut down on","/ˌkʌt daʊn ˈɒn/","PHR","azaltmak","сократить (потребление)","to eat or use less of something","I'm trying to cut down on sugar.","Şekeri azaltmaga çalyşýaryn.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cut out","/ˌkʌt ˈaʊt/","PHR","düýbünden aýyrmak","полностью исключить","to stop eating or using something completely","The doctor told me to cut out cheese.","Lukman peýniri düýbünden aýyrmagy tabşyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["eat out","/ˌiːt ˈaʊt/","PHR","daşarda naharlanmak","есть вне дома","to eat at a restaurant, not at home","We eat out twice a week.","Hepdede iki gezek daşarda naharlanýarys.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["twin","/twɪn/","N","ekiz","близнец","one of two children born at the same time","My cousins are twins.","Doganlarym ekiz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","identical twins","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["engaged","/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒd/","ADJ","ady bagly","помолвленный","having promised to marry someone","They got engaged in spring.","Ýazda atlaryny bagladylar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","get engaged","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","page":90,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["divorced","/dɪˈvɔːst/","ADJ","aýrylyşan","разведённый","no longer married","She is divorced with two kids.","Iki çagaly aýrylyşan aýal.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["ambitious","/æmˈbɪʃəs/","ADJ","öňe saýlanmaga çalyşýan","амбициозный","wanting very much to succeed","He is young and ambitious.","Ol ýaş we öňe saýlanmaga çalyşýan.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["arrogant","/ˈærəɡənt/","ADJ","tekepbir","высокомерный","thinking you are better than others","I find him rather arrogant.","Ony birneme tekepbir görýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bossy","/ˈbɒsi/","ADJ","buýruçyl","любящий командовать","always telling people what to do","My bossy sister organises everything.","Buýruçyl uýam hemme zady gurnaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["confident","/ˈkɒnfɪdənt/","ADJ","ynamly","уверенный","sure of yourself and your abilities","She felt confident before the exam.","Synagdan öň ynamly boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["easy-going","/ˌiːzi ˈɡəʊɪŋ/","ADJ","uşal","покладистый","relaxed and happy to accept things","He is an easy-going teacher.","Ol ushal mugallym.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["honest","/ˈɒnɪst/","ADJ","dogruçyl","честный","always telling the truth","Be honest with me.","Meniň bilen dogruçyl bol.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["impatient","/ɪmˈpeɪʃnt/","ADJ","sabyrsyz","нетерпеливый","not able to wait calmly","The impatient driver started honking.","Sabyrsyz sürüji signal berip başlady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["jealous","/ˈdʒeləs/","ADJ","gabanjaň","ревнивый, завистливый","unhappy because someone has what you want","He was jealous of her success.","Onuň üstünligine gabanýardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","jealous of","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["reliable","/rɪˈlaɪəbl/","ADJ","ynançly","надёжный","able to be trusted","Ask Anna — she is very reliable.","Annadan sora — ol gaty ynançly.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["selfish","/ˈselfɪʃ/","ADJ","hodbin","эгоистичный","caring only about yourself","It was selfish to eat it all.","Hemmesini iýmek hodbin boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["sensible","/ˈsensəbl/","ADJ","paýhasly","благоразумный","showing good judgement","Take a sensible decision.","Paýhasly karar ber.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["sociable","/ˈsəʊʃəbl/","ADJ","jemgyýetçil","общительный","liking to be with people","She is warm and sociable.","Ol mähirli we jemgyýetçil.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["affectionate","/əˈfekʃənət/","ADJ","mähirli","ласковый","showing love for people","She is very affectionate with her children.","Ol çagalary bilen gaty mähirli.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["anxious","/ˈæŋkʃəs/","ADJ","aladaly, biynjalyk","тревожный","worried about something","He felt anxious before the interview.","Söhbetdeşlikden öň aladalandy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["charming","/ˈtʃɑːmɪŋ/","ADJ","sympatik, özüne çekiji","обаятельный","very pleasant and easy to like","Her husband is charming.","Adamsy gaty sympatik.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["competitive","/kəmˈpetətɪv/","ADJ","bäsleşigi söýýän","состязательный, конкурентный","wanting very much to win","He is very competitive at tennis.","Tennisde gaty bäsleşigi söýýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["imaginative","/ɪˈmædʒɪnətɪv/","ADJ","hyýally, oýlap tapyjy","с богатым воображением","good at thinking of new and interesting ideas","She tells imaginative stories.","Hyýaly hekaýalar gürrüň berýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["independent","/ˌɪndɪˈpendənt/","ADJ","özygtyýarly","независимый","doing things yourself, without help from others","She is very independent.","Ol gaty özygtyýarly.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["insecure","/ˌɪnsɪˈkjʊə/","ADJ","özüne ynamy pes","неуверенный в себе","not confident about yourself","He feels insecure about his English.","Iňlis diline ynamy pes.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["mature","/məˈtʃʊə/","ADJ","kämil, ýetişen","зрелый","behaving like an older person","She is very mature for her age.","Ýaşy üçin gaty kämil.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["rebellious","/rɪˈbeljəs/","ADJ","garşylykly, boýun egmeýän","бунтарский, непокорный","refusing to obey rules","He was rebellious as a teenager.","Ýetginjek wagty boýun egmeýärdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sensitive","/ˈsensətɪv/","ADJ","duýgur","чувствительный","easily hurt or offended","She is sensitive to criticism.","Tankyda duýgur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["spoilt","/spɔɪlt/","ADJ","erkeledilen","избалованный","behaving badly because you always get what you want","The spoilt child wanted another toy.","Erkeledilen çaga ýene oýunjak isledi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["stubborn","/ˈstʌbən/","ADJ","inat","упрямый","refusing to change your opinion","He is too stubborn to say sorry.","Ötür soramak üçin gaty inat.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["cost","/kɒst/","V","durmak","стоить","to have a price","The coat cost me a fortune.","Palto maňa köp durdy.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","cost a fortune","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["loan","/ləʊn/","N","karz","заём, ссуда","money you borrow from a bank","They took out a loan for the flat.","Öý üçin karz aldylar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","take out a loan","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["owe","/əʊ/","V","karzdar bolmak","быть должным","to need to pay money back","I still owe you five manat.","Saña entek bäş manat karzym bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","owe money","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["save","/seɪv/","V","tygşytlamak","копить","to keep money for later","She saves a little every month.","Her aý biraz tygşytlaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","save money","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spend","/spend/","V","sarp etmek","тратить","to use money to buy things","He spent all his salary in a week.","Aýlygyny bir hepdede sarp etdi.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","spend money on","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["waste","/weɪst/","V","isrip etmek","тратить впустую","to use money or time badly","Don't waste money on apps you never open.","Hiç wagt açmaýan programmalaryňa pul isrip etme.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","waste money","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["worth","/wɜːθ/","ADJ","degýän","стоящий (чего-л.)","having a value; good enough for","The film is worth seeing.","Film görmäge degýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","worth doing","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["affordable","/əˈfɔːdəbl/","ADJ","elýeterli","доступный по цене","not too expensive","The rent is affordable for students.","Kärende talyplar üçin elýeterli.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["broke","/brəʊk/","ADJ","pulsuz","на мели","having no money (informal)","I was broke until payday.","Aýlyk gününe çenli pulsuz boldum.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","go broke","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["can't afford","/ˌkɑːnt əˈfɔːd/","PHR","güýji ýetmezlik","не мочь себе позволить","to not have enough money for something","We can't afford a new car.","Täze ulaga güýjümiz ýetmeýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["inherit","/ɪnˈherɪt/","V","miras almak","наследовать","to get money or property when someone dies","My uncle is going to leave me money; I will inherit it.","Daýzam maňa pul goýar; men ony miras alaryn.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["invest","/ɪnˈvest/","V","maýa goýmak","инвестировать","to put money into something to make a profit","I want to invest some money.","Biraz maýa goýmak isleýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["budget","/ˈbʌdʒɪt/","N","büjet","бюджет","money that you have and a plan for how to spend it","We planned our holiday budget carefully.","Dynç alyş býujetimizi ünsli meýilleşdirdik.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["contactless payment","/ˌkɒntæktləs ˈpeɪmənt/","N","temassyz töleg","бесконтактная оплата","paying by holding your card or phone near a machine","Contactless payment is very fast.","Temassyz töleg gaty çalt.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["insurance","/ɪnˈʃʊərəns/","N","ätiýaçlandyryş","страхование","money you pay so a company helps if something bad happens","Do you have travel insurance?","Syýahat ätiýaçlandyryşyňyz barmy?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mortgage","/ˈmɔːɡɪdʒ/","N","ipoteka","ипотека","money you borrow from a bank to buy a house","They pay a mortgage every month.","Her aý ipoteka töleýärler.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["salary","/ˈsæləri/","N","aýlyk","зарплата, оклад","the money you get for the work you do","The money you get for your work is your salary.","Işiň üçin alýan puluň aýlykdyr.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["tax","/tæks/","N","salgyt","налог","money that you pay to the government","You pay tax on your salary.","Aýlygyňdan salgyt töleýärsiň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["account","/əˈkaʊnt/","N","hasap","счёт (в банке)","an arrangement with a bank to keep your money","I opened a bank account yesterday.","Düýn bank hasabyny açdym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cash machine","/ˈkæʃ məʃiːn/","N","bankomat","банкомат","a machine where you get cash from your account","Is there a cash machine near here?","Bu ýerde bankomat barmy?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["debt","/det/","N","karz","долг","money that you owe somebody","He has a lot of debt.","Onuň köp karzy bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["live off","/ˌlɪv ˈɒf/","PHR","hasabyna ýaşamak","жить на (что-то)","to use money to pay for everything you need","I can live off 250 euros a week.","Hepdede 250 ýewro hasabyna ýaşap bilýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pay by","/ˌpeɪ ˈbaɪ/","PHR","bilen tölemek","платить (способом)","to use a particular way of paying","You can pay by credit card.","Kredit kart bilen töläp bilersiňiz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["exhausted","/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪd/","ADJ","lapyny gutaran","изнурённый","extremely tired","After the match I was exhausted.","Oýundan soň lapym gutardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["awful","/ˈɔːfl/","ADJ","elhenç","ужасный","very bad","The weather was awful.","Howa elhenç boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["boiling","/ˈbɔɪlɪŋ/","ADJ","gaýnap duran","очень жарко","extremely hot","It's boiling in here — open a window.","Bu ýerde gaty yssy — penjire aç.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["freezing","/ˈfriːzɪŋ/","ADJ","doňduryjy","очень холодно","extremely cold","My hands are freezing.","Ellerim doňýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["furious","/ˈfjʊəriəs/","ADJ","gahary atan","в ярости","extremely angry","Dad was furious about the broken window.","Kakam döwük penjire üçin gahary atdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","furious with","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["starving","/ˈstɑːvɪŋ/","ADJ","garny aç","очень голодный","extremely hungry","When do we eat? I am starving.","Haçan naharlanýarys? Garnym aç.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["tiny","/ˈtaɪni/","ADJ","miniskär","крошечный","extremely small","They live in a tiny flat.","Miniskär öýde ýaşaýarlar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["huge","/hjuːdʒ/","ADJ","ägirt","огромный","extremely big","A huge crowd filled the square.","Ägirt märele meýdançany doldurdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["filthy","/ˈfɪlθi/","ADJ","hapa","отвратительно грязный","extremely dirty","Take off those filthy shoes.","Şol hapa aýakgaplaryňy çykar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["fascinating","/ˈfæsɪneɪtɪŋ/","ADJ","özüne çekiji (gyzykly)","увлекательнейший","extremely interesting","The museum was fascinating.","Muzeý özüne çekiji boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["hilarious","/hɪˈleəriəs/","ADJ","gülkünç","уморительный","extremely funny","The comedy was hilarious.","Komediýa gülkünç boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["brake","/breɪk/","N","tormoz","тормоз","the control that slows a vehicle","He put his foot on the brake.","Tormoz pedalyna aýagyny basdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","put on the brakes","New",[{"book":"int","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fare","/feə(r)/","N","ýol haky","плата за проезд","the money you pay for a journey","The bus fare went up again.","Awtobus ýol haky ýene galdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","bus fare","New",[{"book":"int","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lorry","/ˈlɒri/","N","ýük maşyny","грузовик","a big road vehicle for goods","A lorry blocked the road.","Ýük maşyny ýoly böwetdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":10,