,"New",[{"book":"int","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["interested in","/ˈɪntrəstɪd ɪn/","PHR","gyzyklanýan","интересующийся","wanting to know about something","He is interested in photography.","Surata düşürmek bilen gyzyklanýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","interested in music","New",[{"book":"int","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get through","/ɡet θruː/","PHR","telefon arkaly ýetmek","дозвониться","to succeed in speaking on the phone","I could not get through all morning.","Irdenläp telefon arkaly ýetip bilmedim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get through to","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["hold on","/həʊld ɒn/","PHR","garaşmak","подождать (на линии)","to wait on the phone","Hold on a moment, please.","Bir pursat garaşyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","hold on a second","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["put through","/pʊt θruː/","PHR","birikdirmek","соединять (по телефону)","to connect a phone call","Could you put me through to sales?","Satuw bölümi bilen birikdirip bilersiňizmi?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","put through to","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["take a message","/teɪk ə ˈmesɪdʒ/","PHR","habar ýazmak","записать сообщение","to write down what a caller says","Can I take a message?","Habar ýazyp bilerinmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["leave a message","/liːv ə ˈmesɪdʒ/","PHR","habar goýmak","оставить сообщение","to tell someone something by phone","Please leave a message after the tone.","Signal eşidilenden soň habar goýuň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["cut off","/kʌt ɒf/","PHR","aragatnaşyk kesilmek","обрывать связь","to lose the phone connection suddenly","We were cut off mid-sentence.","Sözlemiň ortasynda 