re sorry about something","What a pity you missed it!","Görmedigiň ýazyk!","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Congratulations","/kənˌɡrætʃuˈleɪʃnz/","INTJ","Gutlaýaryn!","Поздравляю!","used to praise good news","Congratulations on your new job!","Täze işiň bilen gutlaýaryn!","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Good for you","/ɡʊd fə juː/","PHR","Sag bol, afaryn!","Молодец!","used to show you are pleased for someone","You passed? Good for you!","Geçdiňmi? Afaryn!","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Sounds great","/saʊndz ɡreɪt/","PHR","Ajap eşidilýär!","Звучит здорово!","used to show you like an idea","Sounds great — let us do it!","Ajap eşidilýär — edeli!","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Never mind.","/ˈnevə maɪnd/","PHR","Zyýany ýok.","Неважно.","used to say something is not important","Never mind, it was only a cup.","Zyýany ýok, diňe käse boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Oh no","/əʊ nəʊ/","INTJ","Eýwaý!","О нет!","used to show you are unhappy about news","Oh no! I forgot the tickets!","Eýwaý! Bileti ýatdan çykarypdym!","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["That's interesting.","/ðæts ˈɪntrəstɪŋ/","PHR","Gyzykly.","Интересно.","used to show you want to hear more","That's interesting — tell me more.","Gyzykly — köpräk gürrüň ber.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["in my opinion","/ɪn maɪ əˈpɪnjən/","PHR","meniň pikirimçe","по-моему","used to say what you think","In my opinion, the film was slow.","Meniň pikirimçe, film haýal boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in my opinion","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["to be honest","/tuː bi ˈɒnɪst/","PHR","dogrusy","честно говоря","used before a true but awkward opinion","To be honest, I did not like it.","Dogrusy, halamadym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","to be honest","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["personally","/ˈpɜːsənəli/","ADV","şahsan","лично","used to give your own view","Personally, I prefer the first one.","Şahsan, birinjini gowy görýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["I suppose","/aɪ səˈpəʊz/","PHR","çak edýärin","полагаю","used to agree hesitantly","I suppose you are right.","Dogrydyr diýip çak edýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"},{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["as far as I'm concerned","/əz fɑːr əz aɪm kənˈsɜːnd/","PHR","meniň üçin","что касается меня","used to stress your own view","As far as I'm concerned, it works fine.","Meniň üçin gowy işleýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["the thing is","/ðə θɪŋ ɪz/","PHR","mesele şonda","дело в том","used to introduce the real problem","The thing is, we have no time.","Mesele şonda, wagtymyz ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["it depends","/ɪt dɪˈpendz/","PHR","bagly","зависит","used when the answer can change","It depends on the weather.","Howa bagly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","it depends on","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["if you ask me","/ɪf ju ɑːsk miː/","PHR","sorasaň","если честно (по-моему)","used before a strong opinion","If you ask me, he was wrong.","Sorasaň, ol nädogry boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Can I ...?","/kæn aɪ/","PHR","Bolýarmy ...?","Можно ...?","used to ask permission","Can I use your phone?","Telefonyňy ulanyp bolýarmy?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Could you ...?","/kʊd juː/","PHR","... edip bilersiňizmi?","Не могли бы вы ...?","used to ask someone politely to do something","Could you open the window?","Penjiräni açyp bilersiňizmi?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Do you mind ...?","/du ju maɪnd/","PHR","Garşy dälmi ...?","Вы не против ...?","used to ask politely","Do you mind if I sit here?","Şu ýerde otursam garşy dälmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","do you mind if","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Is it OK if ...?","/ɪz ɪt ˌəʊ ˈkeɪ ɪf/","PHR","... bolýarmy?","Можно ли ...?","used to check permission","Is it OK if I leave early?","Ir gitsem bolýarmy?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Would you mind ...?","/wʊd ju maɪnd/","PHR","Siz garşy bolmazmyňyz ...?","Вы бы не возражали ...?","a very polite request","Would you mind helping me?","Kömek etmäge garşy bolmazmyňyz?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","would you mind doing","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Would it be possible ...?","/wʊd ɪt bi ˈpɒsəbl/","PHR","Mümkinmi ...?","Возможно ли ...?","a formal way to ask","Would it be possible to change seats?","Oturgyçlary çalyşmak mümkinmi?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Of course.","/əv kɔːs/","PHR","Elbetde.","Конечно.","used to agree happily","Of course you can borrow it.","Elbetde, karzyna alyp bilersiň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["I'm afraid not.","/aɪm əˈfreɪd nɒt/","PHR","Gynansak-da, ýok.","Боюсь, что нет.","a polite way to say no","I'm afraid not, it is taken.","Gynansak-da ýok, eýelendi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Why don't we ...?","/waɪ dəʊnt wiː/","PHR","... etsek nähili?","Почему бы нам не ...?","used to suggest something","Why don't we take a taxi?","Taksi münsek nähili?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["How about ...?","/haʊ əˈbaʊt/","PHR","... nähili?","Как насчёт ...?","used to suggest something","How about a film tonight?","Şu gije film nähili?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","how about going","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Let's ...","/lets/","PHR","Geliň ...","Давай(те) ...","used to suggest doing something together","Let's start with the easy questions.","Geliň, aňsat soraglardan başlalyň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Shall we ...?","/ʃæl wiː/","PHR","... etmelimi?","Не ... ли нам?","used to suggest politely","Shall we book a table?","Stol bron etmelimi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["We could always ...","/wi kʊd ˈɔːlweɪz/","PHR","Hemişe ... edip bilerdik","Мы всегда можем ...","used to offer another option","We could always order in.","Hemişe sargyt edip bilerdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["That's a good idea.","/ðæts ə ɡʊd aɪˈdɪə/","PHR","Gowy pikir.","Хорошая идея.","used to accept a suggestion","That's a good idea — let us try.","Gowy pikir — synanyşyp göreliň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["I'm not sure.","/aɪm nɒt ʃʊə(r)/","PHR","Ynanamok.","Не уверен.","used to refuse softly","I'm not sure about tonight.","Şu gije barada ynanamok.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Sounds like a plan","/saʊndz laɪk ə plæn/","PHR","Meýilnama ýaly eşidilýär.","Звучит как план.","used to accept a plan happily","Sounds like a plan — see you at six.","Meýilnama ýaly — altyda görüşeris.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Could you tell me ...?","/kʊd ju tel miː/","PHR","Aýdyp bilersiňizmi ...?","Не могли бы вы сказать ...?","a polite way to ask for information","Could you tell me the time?","Wagty aýdyp bilersiňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Do you know if ...?","/du ju nəʊ ɪf/","PHR","... bilýärsiňizmi?","Вы не знаете, ... ли?","used to ask indirectly","Do you know if the bank is open?","Bankyň açykdygyny bilýärsiňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["I was wondering ...","/aɪ wɒz ˈwʌndərɪŋ/","PHR","Pikirlenýärdim ...","Я wondered ...","a very polite question start","I was wondering if you could help.","Kömek edip bilersiňizmi diýip pikirlenýärdim.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Do you have any idea ...?","/du ju hæv ˈeni aɪˈdɪə/","PHR","Hiç pikiriňiz barmy ...?","Вы не имеете понятия ...?","used to ask for information","Do you have any idea where it is?","Nirededigini hiç bilýärsiňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Can you remember ...?","/kæn ju rɪˈmembə(r)/","PHR","Ýadyňyzdami ...?","Вы помните ...?","used to ask about the past","Can you remember his name?","Adyny ýadyňyzdamy?","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["I'm not sure whether ...","/aɪm nɒt ʃʊə(r) ˈweðə(r)/","PHR","Ynanamok ...","Не уверен, ... ли","used to express doubt","I'm not sure whether he is coming.","Gelýändigine ynanamok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Would you know ...?","/wʊd ju nəʊ/","PHR","Bilýän bolsaňyz ...","Не подскажете ...?","used to ask a stranger politely","Would you know the way to the station?","Wokzala ýoly bilýän bolsaňyz?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Could you explain ...?","/kʊd ju ɪkˈspleɪn/","PHR","Düşündirip bilersiňizmi ...?","Не объясните ли ...?","used to ask for a clear answer","Could you explain the rule again?","Düzgüni ýene düşündirip bilersiňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["first name","/ˌfɜːst ˈneɪm/","N","at (öňki at)","имя","the name given to you at birth","Her first name is Aýna.","Onuň ady Aýna.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["surname","/ˈsɜːneɪm/","N","familiýa","фамилия","the name shared by your family","What is your surname?","Familiýaňyz näme?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["middle name","/ˌmɪdl ˈneɪm/","N","orta at","второе имя","a name between first and family name","His middle name is Alan.","Orta ady Alan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["nickname","/ˈnɪkneɪm/","N","lakam","прозвище","an informal name for a person","His nickname is Shorty.","Lakamy Shorty.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["initials","/ɪˈnɪʃlz/","N","baş harplar","инициалы","the first letters of your names","She signed with her initials.","Baş harplary bilen gol çekdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["maiden name","/ˌmeɪdn ˈneɪm/","N","gyzlyk familiýasy","девичья фамилия","a woman's surname before marriage","Her maiden name was Smith.","Gyzlyk familiýasy Smith boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["pet name","/ˈpet neɪm/","N","söýgüli at","ласковое имя","a loving name for someone","Grandma has a pet name for everyone.","Mamanyň hemmäniň söýgüli ady bar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["namesake","/ˈneɪmseɪk/","N","adaş","тёзка","a person with the same name as you","He is my namesake — we are both Merdan.","Ol meniň adaşym — ikimiz hem Merdan.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["pseudonym","/ˈsjuːdənɪm/","N","galam ady","псевдоним","a false name used by a writer","She wrote under a pseudonym.","Galam ady bilen ýazdy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["anonymous","/əˈnɒnɪməs/","ADJ","atsyz (näbelli)","анонимный","with no name shown","The letter was anonymous.","Hat atsyz boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","page":6,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["bright","/braɪt/","ADJ","ýagty (açyk reňk)","яркий","full of light, or a strong colour","She wore a bright red dress.","Ýagty gyzyl köýnek geýdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pale","/peɪl/","ADJ","açyk (solgun)","бледный, светлый","light in colour","The walls are pale blue.","Diwarlar açyk gök.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["vivid","/ˈvɪvɪd/","ADJ","aýdyň (örän ýagty)","живой, яркий","very bright and clear","She has vivid memories of that day.","Şol gün barada aýdyň ýatlamalary bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","vivid colours","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["colourful","/ˈkʌləfl/","ADJ","reňkli","красочный","having many bright colours","The market sells colourful fabrics.","Bazar reňkli matalary satýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cheerful","/ˈtʃɪəfl/","ADJ","şähdaçyk","жизнерадостный","happy and positive","She gave a cheerful wave.","Şähdaçyk el bulady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gloomy","/ˈɡluːmi/","ADJ","garaňky (gamgyn)","мрачный","dark and sad","The weather was cold and gloomy.","Howa sowuk we garaňky boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glorious","/ˈɡlɔːriəs/","ADJ","şanly (ajaýyp)","великолепный","very beautiful or impressive","We had glorious weather.","Ajaýyp howa boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sparkling","/ˈspɑːklɪŋ/","ADJ","ýaldyrawuk","сверкающий","shining with small flashes","The lake was sparkling clean.","Köl ýaldyrap durdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spotless","/ˈspɒtləs/","ADJ","tämiz (lekisiz)","безупречно чистый","completely clean","The kitchen was spotless.","Aşhana tämiz boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["countless","/ˈkaʊntləs/","ADJ","san-sajaksyz","бесчисленный","too many to count","There are countless stars tonight.","Şu gije san-sajaksyz ýyldyz bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["assertive","/əˈsɜːtɪv/","ADJ","özüni ynamly alyp barýan","напористый, уверенный","saying clearly what you want and believe","You need to be more assertive at work.","Işde has ynamly bolmaly.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["envious","/ˈenviəs/","ADJ","görip","завистливый","wanting something that someone else has","I am envious of your new car.","Täze ulagyňa görip.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glamorous","/ˈɡlæmərəs/","ADJ","özüne çekiji, kaşaň","гламурный, блестящий","attractive and exciting","Actors have glamorous lives.","Aktýorlaryň durmuşy kaşaň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["helpful","/ˈhelpfl/","ADJ","peýdaly, kömekçi","отзывчивый, полезный","giving help","The staff were very helpful.","Işgärler gaty kömekçidi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["impressive","/ɪmˈpresɪv/","ADJ","täsirli","впечатляющий","making you admire it","The view from the top was impressive.","Depedäniň görnüşi täsirli boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["impulsive","/ɪmˈpʌlsɪv/","ADJ","hyjuwly, oýlanyşyksyz","импульсивный","doing things suddenly without thinking","He is impulsive and spends too much.","Oýlanyşyksyz we köp sarp edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["powerful","/ˈpaʊəfl/","ADJ","güýçli","могущественный, мощный","very strong","He is a powerful man.","Ol güýçli adam.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["profitable","/ˈprɒfɪtəbl/","ADJ","bähbitli, girdejili","прибыльный","making a lot of money","The business was very profitable.","Biznes gaty girdejilidi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["restful","/ˈrestfl/","ADJ","dynç beriji","успокаивающий","quiet and relaxing","The hotel was calm and restful.","Myhmanhana asuda we dynç berijidi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["risky","/ˈrɪski/","ADJ","howply","рискованный","possibly dangerous","It is risky to drive so fast.","Beýle çalt sürmek howply.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spacious","/ˈspeɪʃəs/","ADJ","giň","просторный","with a lot of space","The flat is bright and spacious.","Öý ýagty we giň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","page":10,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["razor","/ˈreɪzə(r)/","N","pyçak (sakal)","бритва","a tool for cutting hair off the skin","He bought a new razor.","Täze sakgal pyçagyny satyn aldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["swimsuit","/ˈswɪmsuːt/","N","ýüzmek lybasy","купальник","clothes worn for swimming","Do not forget your swimsuit.","Ýüzmek lybasyňy ýatdan çykarma.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sunscreen","/ˈsʌnskriːn/","N","günden goraýjy krem","солнцезащитный крем","cream that protects skin from sun","Put on sunscreen at the beach.","Kenarda günden goraýjy krem çal.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["toothpaste","/ˈtuːθpeɪst/","N","diş pastasy","зубная паста","a paste for cleaning teeth","We need more toothpaste.","Köp diş pastasy gerek.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["toiletries","/ˈtɔɪlətriz/","N","şahsy arassalyk serişdeleri","туалетные принадлежности","things you use to wash yourself","Pack your toiletries in a small bag.","Şahsy arassalyk serişdeleriňi kiçi sumka ýygnap goý.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["backpack","/ˈbækpæk/","N","arkalyk sumka","рюкзак","a bag carried on the back","He travels with one backpack.","Bir arkalyk sumka bilen syýahat edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["adapter","/əˈdæptə(r)/","N","geçiriji (tok)","переходник, адаптер","a plug that fits foreign sockets","Take an adapter for the hotel.","Myhmanhana üçin tok geçirijisi al.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["holdall","/ˈhəʊldɔːl/","N","uly sumka","дорожная сумка","a large soft bag for travel","He carried a black holdall.","Gara uly sumka göterdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["washbag","/ˈwɒʃbæɡ/","N","ýuwunmak sumkasy","несессер","a small bag for washing things","My washbag has a toothbrush.","Ýuwunmak sumkamda diş çotgasy bar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["comb","/kəʊm/","N","darak","расчёска","a tool for tidying hair","She ran a comb through her hair.","Saçyny darak bilen darady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["batteries","/ˈbætriz/","N","batareýler","батарейки","small objects that give power to things","Take spare batteries for the camera.","Fotoapparat üçin ätiýaç batareý al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bathrobe","/ˈbɑːθrəʊb/","N","hamam dony","банный халат","a loose coat you wear after a bath","The hotel provides a bathrobe.","Myhmanhana hamam dony berýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["beach bag","/ˈbiːtʃ bæɡ/","N","kenar torbasy","пляжная сумка","a bag you take to the beach","Put the towel in the beach bag.","Däsmaly kenar torbasyna sal.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["deodorant","/diˈəʊdərənt/","N","dezodorant","дезодорант","a substance you use to stop body smell","Do not forget your deodorant.","Dezodorantyňy unutma.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["earphones","/ˈɪəfəʊnz/","N","gulaklyk","наушники (вкладыши)","small speakers you put in your ears","He listens to music with earphones.","Gulaklyk bilen aýdym diňleýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["make-up","/ˈmeɪkʌp/","N","ýüz boýagy","макияж, косметика","coloured substances women put on their faces","She does not wear much make-up.","Köp makiýaž ulanmaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pack of cards","/ˌpæk əv ˈkɑːdz/","N","kagyz oýun toplumy","колода карт","a set of playing cards","Take a pack of cards for the journey.","Ýol üçin kagyz oýun toplumyny al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["slippers","/ˈslɪpəz/","N","öý köwşi","тапочки","soft light shoes you wear indoors","Put on your slippers.","Öý köwşüňi geý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sponge bag","/ˈspʌndʒ bæɡ/","N","aşgana haltajygy","косметичка (для туалетных принадлежностей)","a small bag for soap, toothbrush, etc.","My toothbrush is in the sponge bag.","Çotgam aşgana haltajygynda.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sun hat","/ˈsʌn hæt/","N","gün telpegi","шляпа от солнца","a hat that protects you from the sun","Wear a sun hat at the beach.","Kenarda gün telpegini geý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["toothbrush","/ˈtuːθbrʌʃ/","N","diş çotgasy","зубная щётка","a brush for cleaning your teeth","Buy a new toothbrush.","Täze diş çotgasy satyn al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["guidebook","/ˈɡaɪdbʊk/","N","syýahat gollanmasy","путеводитель","a book with information about a place","The guidebook lists the best hotels.","Gollanma iň gowy myhmanhanalary görkezýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["visa","/ˈviːzə/","N","wiza","виза","official permission to enter a country","You need a visa for the USA.","ABŞ üçin wiza gerek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["booking confirmation","/ˌbʊkɪŋ ˌkɒnfəˈmeɪʃn/","N","bron tassyklanamasy","подтверждение бронирования","a document that proves you have paid for a room or flight","Print the booking confirmation.","Bron tassyklanamasyny çap et.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["travel insurance","/ˈtrævl ɪnˈʃʊərəns/","N","syýahat ätiýaçlandyryşy","туристическая страховка","insurance for accidents or problems on holiday","Take out travel insurance before you go.","Gitmezden öň syýahat ätiýaçlandyryşyny al.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pack","/pæk/","V","ýygnamak","укладывать вещи","to put things in a bag before a journey","I packed my suitcase last night.","Düýn agşam çemodanymy ýygnadym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["roll up","/ˌrəʊl ˈʌp/","PHR","togalaklamak, dürlemek","скатывать","to fold clothes into a roll to save space","Roll up your T-shirts to save space.","Ýer tygsytlamak üçin köýnekçeleri dürle.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["unpack","/ˌʌnˈpæk/","V","ýygnaýjy açmak, çykarmak","распаковывать","to take things out of a bag after a journey","She unpacked as soon as she arrived.","Gelen badyna zatlaryny çykardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wrap","/ræp/","V","düýrmek, örtmek","заворачивать","to cover something in paper or cloth","Wrap the glasses in clothes.","Aýnalary eşige dür.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","page":16,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bakery","/ˈbeɪkəri/","N","çörekhana","булочная","a shop that sells bread and cakes","The bakery opens at seven.","Çörekhana ýedide açylýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["butcher","/ˈbʊtʃə(r)/","N","et satyjy (gassap)","мясник","a person or shop that sells meat","The butcher cut the lamb.","Gassap goýun etini kesdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["chemist","/ˈkemɪst/","N","dermanhana","аптека","a shop that sells medicine","Buy the pills at the chemist.","Dermanlary dermanhanadan al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["florist","/ˈflɒrɪst/","N","gül satyjy","цветочник","a shop that sells flowers","The florist made a lovely bouquet.","Gül satyjy owadan çemen ýasady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["greengrocer","/ˈɡriːnɡrəʊsə(r)/","N","gök önüm satyjy","овощной магазин","a shop that sells fruit and vegetables","The greengrocer has fresh tomatoes.","Gök önüm satyjyda täze pomidor bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["jeweller","/ˈdʒuːələ(r)/","N","zergär","ювелир","a shop that sells jewellery","The jeweller repaired the ring.","Zergär ýüzügi bejerdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["newsagent","/ˈnjuːzeɪdʒənt/","N","gazet satyjy","газетный киоск","a shop selling papers and magazines","The newsagent is on the corner.","Gazet satyjy burçda.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["optician","/ɒpˈtɪʃn/","N","göz lukmany (optika)","оптик","a person who tests eyes and sells glasses","The optician checked my sight.","Göz lukmany görüşimi barlady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dry cleaner","/ˌdraɪ ˈkliːnə(r)/","N","himiki arassalaýjy","химчистка","a shop that cleans clothes without water","Take the suit to the dry cleaner.","Kostýumy himiki arassalaýja ber.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stationer","/ˈsteɪʃənə(r)/","N","kagyz-kalem satyjy","канцелярский магазин","a shop selling pens and paper","The stationer sells notebooks.","Kagyz-kalem satyjy depder satýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["deli","/ˈdeli/","N","tagam dükany","гастроном","a shop selling cooked food and cheese","We bought cheese at the deli.","Tagam dükanyndan peýnir aldyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["baker's","/ˈbeɪkəz/","N","çörek dükan","булочная","a shop that sells bread and cakes","Buy bread at the baker’s.","Çöregi çörek dükandan al.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["butcher's","/ˈbʊtʃəz/","N","et dükan","мясная лавка","a shop that sells meat","The butcher’s sells fresh lamb.","Et dükandan täze guzy eti satylýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dry-cleaner's","/ˌdraɪ ˈkliːnəz/","N","himiki arassalaýjy","химчистка","a shop that cleans clothes with chemicals","Take the suit to the dry-cleaner’s.","Kostýumy himiki arassalaýja ber.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["estate agent's","/ɪˈsteɪt ˌeɪdʒənts/","N","gozgalmaýan emläk edarasy","агентство недвижимости","a shop that sells and rents houses","They found the flat at the estate agent’s.","Öýi gozgalmaýan emläk edarasyndan tapdylar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fishmonger's","/ˈfɪʃmʌŋɡəz/","N","balyk dükan","рыбный магазин","a shop that sells fish","The fishmonger’s has fresh salmon.","Balyk dükanda täze gyzylbalyk bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["garden centre","/ˈɡɑːdn ˌsentə/","N","bag merkez","садовый центр","a place that sells plants and flowers","We bought roses at the garden centre.","Bag merkezden bägül satyn aldyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["launderette","/ˌlɔːnˈdret/","N","kir ýuwujyhana","прачечная самообслуживания","a shop with washing machines you pay to use","There is a launderette on our street.","Köçämizde kir ýuwujyhana bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["market stall","/ˈmɑːkɪt stɔːl/","N","bazar piştagtas","рыночный прилавок","a table at a market where things are sold","She sells fruit from a market stall.","Bazar piştagtasyndan miwe satýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["off-licence","/ˌɒf ˈlaɪsns/","N","içgi dükan","винный магазин","a shop that sells alcohol","He bought wine at the off-licence.","Içgi dükandan çakyr aldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stationer's","/ˈsteɪʃənəz/","N","kanselýariýa dükan","магазин канцтоваров","a shop that sells paper, pens, etc.","Buy envelopes at the stationer’s.","Bukjalary kanselýariýa dükandan al.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["car showroom","/ˈkɑː ˈʃəʊruːm/","N","awtosalon","автосалон","a large shop where cars are shown and sold","They chose the car at the showroom.","Ulawy awtosalonda saýladylar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","page":20,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["baby","/ˈbeɪbi/","N","çaga (täze doglan)","младенец","a very young child","The baby is sleeping.","Çaga uklaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["toddler","/ˈtɒdlə(r)/","N","ýöräp başlan çaga","малыш (начинающий ходить)","a child just learning to walk","The toddler held her hand.","Ýöräp başlan çaga elini saklady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["infant","/ˈɪnfənt/","N","bäbek","грудной ребёнок","a very young child or baby","The class is for infants.","Synp bäbekler üçin.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["child","/tʃaɪld/","N","çaga","ребёнок","a young person","The child played in the park.","Çaga parkda oýnady.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":10},{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["teenager","/ˈtiːneɪdʒə(r)/","N","ýetginjek","подросток","a person aged 13 to 19","Teenagers love their phones.","Ýetginjekler telefonlaryny gowy görýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["adolescent","/ˌædəˈlesnt/","N","ýetginjek (ösmür)","подросток, юноша","a young person becoming an adult","Adolescents need good sleep.","Ösmürler gowy uky mätäç.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["adult","/ˈædʌlt/","N","uly adam","взрослый","a fully grown person","Adults pay the full price.","Uly adamlar doly baha töleýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["youngster","/ˈjʌŋstə(r)/","N","ýaş oglan-gyz","юнец, youngster","a young person","The youngsters played football.","Ýaşlar futbol oýnady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["middle-aged","/ˌmɪdl ˈeɪdʒd/","ADJ","orta ýaşly","средних лет","neither young nor old","A middle-aged man answered the door.","Orta ýaşly adam gapyny açdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["pensioner","/ˈpenʃənə(r)/","N","pensiýaçy","пенсионер","a person too old to work","Pensioners travel free.","Pensiýaçylar mugt gatnaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["elderly","/ˈeldəli/","ADJ","garry","пожилой","old (polite)","She helps elderly neighbours.","Garry goňşularyna kömek edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["newborn","/ˈnjuːbɔːn/","N","täze doglan çaga","новорождённый","a baby just born","The newborn weighed three kilos.","Täze doglan çaga üç kilo boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","page":26,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["lens","/lenz/","N","linza (obýektiw)","объектив","the glass part of a camera","Clean the lens before shooting.","Surata düşürmezden öň linzany arassala.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["snapshot","/ˈsnæpʃɒt/","N","tiz surat","снимок","a quick informal photo","She took a snapshot of the view.","Görnüşiň tiz surata düşürdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["close-up","/ˌkləʊs ˈʌp/","N","ýakyn plan","крупный план","a photo showing small detail","Take a close-up of her face.","Ýüzüniň ýakyn planyny düşür.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["background","/ˈbækɡraʊnd/","N","arka fon","задний план","the part behind the main subject","The mountains form the background.","Daglar arka fon döredýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in the background","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["focus","/ˈfəʊkəs/","V","fokuslamak","фокусировать","to make a picture sharp","Focus on the front row.","Öňdäki hatara fokusla.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["exposure","/ɪkˈspəʊʒə(r)/","N","ekspozisiýa","экспозиция","the amount of light in a photo","Adjust the exposure for night shots.","Gije suratlary üçin ekspozisiýany sazla.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["develop","/dɪˈveləp/","V","ýüze çykarmak (surat)","проявлять (плёнку)","to make photos from film","They developed the film at home.","Plýonkany öýde ýüze çykardylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"int","unit":3},{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["selfie","/ˈselfi/","N","selfi","селфи","a photo you take of yourself","She posted a selfie online.","Selfini onlaýn ýerleşdirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["zoom","/zuːm/","V","ulaltmak (ýakynlaşdyrmak)","приближать (зум)","to make the subject look nearer","Zoom in on the bird.","Guşa ýakynlaşdyr.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","zoom in","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["shutter","/ˈʃʌtə(r)/","N","zatwor","затвор","the part that opens to take a photo","Press the shutter gently.","Zatwory ýuwaş bas.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["foreground","/ˈfɔːɡraʊnd/","N","öňki plan","передний план","the part of a picture nearest to you","There are flowers in the foreground.","Öňki planda güller bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["on top of","/ˌɒn ˈtɒp əv/","PHR","üstünde","наверху, поверх","in a position above something","The cat is on top of the fridge.","Pişik holodilnigiň üstünde.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["round","/raʊnd/","PREP","daşyndan, aýlanyp","вокруг","going around something","We walked round the lake.","Köliň daşyndan ýöräp geçdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","page":30,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["recycle","/ˌriːˈsaɪkl/","V","gaýtadan işlemek","перерабатывать","to make waste into new things","We recycle paper and glass.","Kagyz we aýnany gaýtadan işleýäris.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rubbish","/ˈrʌbɪʃ/","N","zibil","мусор","waste that you throw away","Take the rubbish outside.","Zibili daşaryk çykar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["litter","/ˈlɪtə(r)/","N","taşlanan zibil","мусор (на улице)","rubbish left in public places","Do not drop litter in the park.","Parkda zibil taşlama.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","drop litter","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bin","/bɪn/","N","zibil bedresi","мусорный бак","a container for rubbish","Put it in the bin.","Ony zibil bedresine at.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","rubbish bin","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["landfill","/ˈlændfɪl/","N","zibil gömülýän ýer","свалка","a place where rubbish is buried","Too much waste goes to landfill.","Köp galyndy zibil gömülýän ýere gidýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["compost","/ˈkɒmpɒst/","N","kompost","компост","decayed plants used to feed soil","We make compost from food scraps.","Iýmit galyndylaryndan kompost ýasaýarys.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["throw away","/θrəʊ əˈweɪ/","PHR","zyňmak","выбрасывать","to get rid of something","Do not throw away that box.","Şol gutyny zyňma.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dump","/dʌmp/","V","taşlamak (zibil)","сваливать, выбрасывать","to leave waste somewhere","They dumped the rubbish illegally.","Zibili bikanun taşladylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["disposable","/dɪˈspəʊzəbl/","ADJ","bir gezeklik","одноразовый","used once then thrown away","Avoid disposable cups.","Bir gezeklik käselerden gaça dur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["packaging","/ˈpækɪdʒɪŋ/","N","gaplama","упаковка","material used to wrap goods","Too much packaging is wasted.","Köp gaplama isrip edilýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["reusable","/ˌriːˈjuːzəbl/","ADJ","gaýtadan ulanylýan","многоразовый","able to be used again","Bring a reusable bag.","Gaýtadan ulanylýan sumka getir.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lid","/lɪd/","N","gapak","крышка","the top part that covers a container","Put the lid back on the jar.","Bankanyň gapagyny ýap.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["plastic bags","/ˈplæstɪk bæɡz/","N","plastik torbalar","пластиковые пакеты","bags made of plastic","Take your own bag, not plastic bags.","Plastik däl, öz torbaňy al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sell-by date","/ˌsel baɪ ˈdeɪt/","N","ýaramlylyk möhleti","срок годности","the date after which food should not be sold","Check the sell-by date on the milk.","Süýdüň ýaramlylyk möhletini barla.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bin bag","/ˈbɪn bæɡ/","N","zibil torbasy","мешок для мусора","a large plastic bag for rubbish","Put the rubbish in a bin bag.","Zibili zibil torbasyna sal.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["refuse collectors","/ˈrefjuːs kəˌlektəz/","N","zibil ýygnaýjylar","мусорщики","people whose job is collecting rubbish","The refuse collectors come on Fridays.","Zibil ýygnaýjylar anna günleri gelýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["waste-paper basket","/ˈweɪstpeɪpə ˌbɑːskɪt/","N","kagyz zibil sebedi","корзина для бумаг","a small container for waste paper","Throw the letter in the waste-paper basket.","Hatyny kagyz zibil sebedine at.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tub","/tʌb/","N","gap, bedreçe","баночка, контейнер","a small round container","I bought a tub of yoghurt.","Bir gap ýogurt satyn aldym.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wrapper","/ˈræpə/","N","örtgi, kagyz","обёртка","paper or plastic around food","Do not drop sweet wrappers.","Konfert örtgüni taşlama.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["give away","/ˌɡɪv əˈweɪ/","PHR","mugt bermek, paýlamak","раздавать","to give something you no longer want","We gave away our old clothes.","Köne eşiklerimizi paýladyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pot","/pɒt/","N","gapy, küýze","горшок, банка","a round container","She opened a pot of jam.","Mürebbäniň gabyny açdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rethink","/ˌriːˈθɪŋk/","V","täzeden oýlanmak","переосмыслить","to think about something again in a different way","We need to rethink our plans.","Meýilnamalarymyzy täzeden oýlanmaly.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["reuse","/ˌriːˈjuːz/","V","gaýtadan ulanmak","использовать повторно","to use something again","Reuse the glass jars.","Aýna bankalary gaýtadan ulan.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","page":36,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dissertation","/ˌdɪsəˈteɪʃn/","N","disseratasiýa","диссертация","a long piece of academic writing","She finished her dissertation.","Disseratasiýasyny gutardy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["internship","/ˈɪntɜːnʃɪp/","N","staj (tecrübe)","стажировка","a period of work experience","He got an internship at a bank.","Bankda staj aldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lecture","/ˈlektʃə(r)/","N","leksiýa","лекция","a formal talk to students","The lecture lasted two hours.","Leksiýa iki sagat dowam etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tutor","/ˈtjuːtə(r)/","N","repetitor (ýolbaşçy)","репетитор, куратор","a private teacher","My tutor helped with the essay.","Repetitor esseýde kömek etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["scholarship","/ˈskɒləʃɪp/","N","talyp haky (stipendiýa)","стипендия, грант","money given to a student","She won a scholarship abroad.","Daşary ýurt talyp hakyny gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["course","/kɔːs/","N","kurs","курс","a series of lessons","He joined an English course.","Iňlis kursuna ýazyldy.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","training course","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["semester","/sɪˈmestə(r)/","N","ýarym ýyl (semestr)","семестр","half of the academic year","The first semester ends in December.","Birinji semestr dekabrda gutarýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["coursework","/ˈkɔːswɜːk/","N","kurs işi","курсовая работа","work done during a course","Coursework counts towards the grade.","Kurs işi baha goşulýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["field trip","/ˈfiːld trɪp/","N","okuw sapary","выездное занятие","a trip students take to learn","The class went on a field trip.","Synp okuw saparyna gitdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["distance learning","/ˌdɪstəns ˈlɜːnɪŋ/","N","aragatnaşykly okuw","дистанционное обучение","studying from home online","She studies by distance learning.","Aragatnaşykly okuw arkaly okaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["faculty","/ˈfæklti/","N","fakultet","факультет","a department of a university","She studies in the History faculty.","Taryh fakultetinde okaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["intern","/ˈɪntɜːn/","N","stajýor","стажёр","a student who works to get experience","He worked as an intern last summer.","Geçen tomus stajýor boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["job offer","/ˈdʒɒb ˌɒfə/","N","iş teklibi","предложение работы","when a company offers you a job","She got two job offers.","Iki iş teklibini aldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["postgraduate","/ˌpəʊstˈɡrædʒuət/","N","aspirant, magistrant","аспирант","a student doing a higher degree after their first","He is a postgraduate in biology.","Biologiýa boýunça magistrant.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["professor","/prəˈfesə/","N","professor","профессор","a senior teacher at a university","The professor gave an interesting lecture.","Professor gyzykly leksiýa berdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["qualification","/ˌkwɒlɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/","N","hünär derejesi","квалификация","an exam or skill that shows you can do a job","What qualifications do you need to teach?","Mugallym bolmak üçin haýsy derejeler gerek?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["reapply","/ˌriːəˈplaɪ/","V","täzeden ýüz tutmak","подавать повторно","to apply again","If you fail, you can reapply next year.","Ýykylysaň, indiki ýyl täzeden ýüz tutup bilersiň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["seminar","/ˈsemɪnɑː/","N","seminar","семинар","a small university class for discussion","The seminar was about modern poetry.","Seminar häzirki zaman poeziýasy baradady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["thesis","/ˈθiːsɪs/","N","dissertasiýa, diplom işi","диссертация, дипломная работа","a long piece of writing for a university degree","She is writing her thesis.","Diplom işini ýazýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tutorial","/tjuːˈtɔːriəl/","N","tutor sapak","индивидуальное занятие","a small class with a teacher at university","The tutorial has six students.","Tutor sapakda alty talyplar bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["undergraduate","/ˌʌndəˈɡrædʒuət/","N","talyp","студент (бакалавриата)","a student doing their first university degree","Undergraduates study for three years.","Talyplar üç ýyl okaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["vacancy","/ˈveɪkənsi/","N","boş iş orny","вакансия","a job that is available","There are no vacancies at the moment.","Häzirki wagt boş iş orny ýok.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","page":40,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["reality show","/riˈæləti ʃəʊ/","N","realiti şou","реалити-шоу","a programme with real people","Reality shows are very popular.","Realiti şou gaty meşhur.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["soap opera","/ˈsəʊp ˌɒpərə/","N","serial","мыльная опера, сериал","a continuing drama on TV","She watches a soap opera every day.","Her gün serial görýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sitcom","/ˈsɪtkɒm/","N","sitkom (gülkünç serial)","ситком","a funny series with the same characters","That sitcom makes me laugh.","Şol sitkom meni güldürýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["quiz show","/ˈkwɪz ʃəʊ/","N","wiktoryna","викторина","a programme where people answer questions","He won money on a quiz show.","Wiktorynada pul gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["chat show","/ˈtʃæt ʃəʊ/","N","söhbetdeşlik gepleşigi","ток-шоу","a programme of talks with guests","The chat show had famous guests.","Söhbetdeşlik gepleşiginde meşhur myhmanlar bardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["presenter","/prɪˈzentə(r)/","N","alyp baryjy","ведущий","a person who hosts a programme","The presenter introduced the band.","Alyp baryjy topary tanyşdyrdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["viewer","/ˈvjuːə(r)/","N","tomaşaçy","зритель","a person who watches TV","Millions of viewers watched the final.","Millionlarça tomaşaçy finaly gördi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["series","/ˈsɪəriːz/","N","serial (yzygiderli)","сериал, серия","a set of related programmes","The second series starts tonight.","Ikinji serial şu gije başlaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["episode","/ˈepɪsəʊd/","N","bölüm (seriýa)","эпизод, серия","one part of a series","Did you see the last episode?","Soňky bölümi gördüňmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["box set","/ˈbɒks set/","N","tutuş seriýa toplumy","бокс-сет (все серии)","a complete set of a series","I bought the box set of the show.","Gepleşigiň tutuş toplumyny satyn aldym.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["advert","/ˈædvɜːt/","N","mahabat","реклама (ролик)","a short film on TV that sells something","The adverts are very long.","Mahabatlar gaty uzyn.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cartoon","/kɑːˈtuːn/","N","multfilm","мультфильм","a short animated film, often funny","He likes watching cartoons.","Multfilm görmegi gowy görýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cookery programme","/ˈkʊkəri ˌprəʊɡræm/","N","nahar bişiriş gepleşigi","кулинарная программа","a TV programme about cooking","My favourite cookery programme is on at six.","Söýgüli nahar gepleşigim sagat altyda.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["current affairs programme","/ˌkʌrənt əˈfeəz ˌprəʊɡræm/","N","habar-seljeriş gepleşigi","общественно-политическая программа","a TV programme about news and politics","He watches a current affairs programme every week.","Her hepde habar-seljeriş gepleşigini görýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["documentary","/ˌdɒkjuˈmentri/","N","dokumental film","документальный фильм","a programme about real facts","We saw a documentary about whales.","Kitler barada dokumental film gördük.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["live sport","/ˌlaɪv ˈspɔːt/","N","göni sport ýaýlymy","прямая спортивная трансляция","sport shown on TV as it happens","He never misses live sport.","Göni sport ýaýlymyny hiç sypdyrmaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["period drama","/ˌpɪəriəd ˈdrɑːmə/","N","taryhy drama","историческая драма","a film or series set in the past","The period drama was filmed in Bath.","Taryhy drama Batda surata düşürildi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["weather forecast","/ˈweðə fɔːkɑːst/","N","howa maglumaty","прогноз погоды","a report on TV about the weather","The weather forecast says rain.","Howa maglumaty ýagyş diýýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["streaming service","/ˈstriːmɪŋ ˌsɜːvɪs/","N","striming hyzmaty","стриминговый сервис","a service that shows films and series online","Which streaming service do you use?","Haýsy striming hyzmatyny ulanýarsyň?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["turn over","/ˌtɜːn ˈəʊvə/","PHR","kanal çalyşmak","переключать (канал)","to change to a different channel","Turn over, this programme is boring.","Kanal çalyş, bu gepleşik göwünsüz.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["turn down","/ˌtɜːn daʊn/","PHR","peseltmek","убавить (звук)","to make the sound quieter","Turn down the TV, please.","Telewizory peselt, haýyş.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["be on","/ˌbiː ˈɒn/","PHR","(efirde) bolmak","идти (о передаче)","when a programme is being shown","My favourite series is on tonight.","Söýgüli serialym şu agşam efirde.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","page":46,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["countryside","/ˈkʌntrisaɪd/","N","oba ýerleri","сельская местность","land away from towns","They moved to the countryside.","Oba ýerlerine göçdüler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["field","/fiːld/","N","meýdan (öri)","поле","an open area of land","Cows grazed in the field.","Meýdanda sygyrlar otlady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hedge","/hedʒ/","N","haýal çit (agaç)","живая изгородь","a row of bushes as a border","Birds nested in the hedge.","Guşlar haýal çitde höwürtge gurdu.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lane","/leɪn/","N","inçe ýol","узкая дорога","a narrow country road","We walked down a quiet lane.","Asuda inçe ýoldan ýöräp gitdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["meadow","/ˈmedəʊ/","N","ýaýla (otlak)","луг","a field of grass and flowers","Wildflowers filled the meadow.","Ýaýlany ýabany güller doldurdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["valley","/ˈvæli/","N","jülge","долина","low land between hills","The village sits in a valley.","Oba jülgäniň içinde ýerleşýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stream","/striːm/","N","çaýjagaz (kiçi derýa)","ручей","a small river","A stream runs behind the house.","Öýüň arkasyndan çaýjagaz akýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["woods","/wʊdz/","N","tokaýjyk","роща, лес","an area of trees","We walked in the woods.","Tokaýjykda ýöräp gezdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in the woods","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["farm","/fɑːm/","N","ferma","ферма","land where animals and crops are kept","The farm has twenty sheep.","Fermada ýigrimi goýun bar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["barn","/bɑːn/","N","ambar","амбар, сарай","a farm building for storage","They store hay in the barn.","Ambarda iým saklaýarlar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["branch","/brɑːntʃ/","N","şaha","ветка","a part of a tree that grows out from it","The bird sat on a branch.","Guş şahada otyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bush","/bʊʃ/","N","agymsy, kol","куст","a low plant like a small tree","There are roses behind the bush.","Koluň arkasynda bägül bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cliff","/klɪf/","N","gaýa","скала, утёс","a high steep wall of rock by the sea","We stood on top of the cliff.","Gaýanyň depesinde durduk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["donkey","/ˈdɒŋki/","N","eşek","осёл","an animal like a small horse","The donkey carried the bags.","Eşek torbalary göterdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hen","/hen/","N","towuk","курица","a female chicken","The hens are in the yard.","Towuklar howluda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["leaf","/liːf/","N","ýaprak","лист (растения)","a flat green part of a plant","The leaves turn red in autumn.","Ýapraklar güýzde gyzarýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rock","/rɒk/","N","gaýa, daş","камень, скала","a large stone","Climb over the rocks carefully.","Gaýalardan seresaply geç.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stick","/stɪk/","N","çybyk","палка, ветка","a thin piece of wood from a tree","The dog brought back a stick.","It çybygy yzyna getirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stone","/stəʊn/","N","daş","камень","a small piece of rock","He threw a stone into the water.","Suwa daş zyňdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tractor","/ˈtræktə/","N","traktor","трактор","a strong vehicle used on farms","The farmer drove the tractor.","Daýhan traktor sürdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["farmhouse","/ˈfɑːmhaʊs/","N","ferma öýi","фермерский дом","the main house on a farm","They stayed in an old farmhouse.","Köne ferma öýünde galdylar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","page":50,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cuisine","/kwɪˈziːn/","N","aşhana (tagam stili)","кухня (национальная)","a style of cooking","I love Italian cuisine.","Italiýan aşhanasyny gowy görýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","French cuisine","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["booking","/ˈbʊkɪŋ/","N","bron (ýazgy)","бронирование","an arrangement to reserve a table","We have a booking at eight.","Sagat sekizde bronumuz bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","table booking","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bowl","/bəʊl/","N","käse","миска, пиала","a deep round dish","I had a bowl of soup.","Bir käse çorba iýdim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["candle","/ˈkændl/","N","şem","свеча","a stick of wax that gives light","There were candles on the table.","Stoluň üstünde şem bardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cup","/kʌp/","N","piýala","чашка","a round container with a handle for drinking","I drank a cup of coffee.","Bir piýala kofe içdim.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fork","/fɔːk/","N","çemçe (dirsekli)","вилка","a tool with points for eating with","Eat the pasta with a fork.","Makaronyny çemçe bilen iý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glass","/ɡlɑːs/","N","stakan","стакан, бокал","a container for drinks made of glass","She poured a glass of water.","Bir stakan suw guýdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["knife","/naɪf/","N","pyçak","нож","a tool for cutting food","Cut the meat with a knife.","Eti pyçak bilen kes.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["napkin","/ˈnæpkɪn/","N","salfetka","салфетка","paper or cloth for cleaning your mouth","Put the napkin on your knees.","Salfetkany dyzyňyza goýuň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["serving dish","/ˈsɜːvɪŋ dɪʃ/","N","uly tabak","блюдо для подачи","a large dish food is served from","The vegetables came in a serving dish.","Gök önümler uly tabakda geldi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spoon","/spuːn/","N","çemçe","ложка","a tool with a round end for eating","Eat the soup with a spoon.","Çorbany çemçe bilen iý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wine glass","/ˈwaɪn ɡlɑːs/","N","çakyr bokaly","бокал для вина","a glass for drinking wine","She raised her wine glass.","Çakyr bokalyny galdyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["clear","/klɪə/","V","ýygnamak (stol)","убирать (со стола)","to take away dishes after a meal","The waiter cleared the table.","Ofisiant stoly ýygnady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lay the table","/ˌleɪ ðə ˈteɪbl/","PHR","stol ýazmak","накрывать на стол","to put plates, glasses, etc. on the table","Please lay the table for four.","Dört adam üçin stol ýaz, haýyş.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["send it back","/ˌsend ɪt ˈbæk/","PHR","yzyna gaýtarmak","отослать обратно (блюдо)","to ask the kitchen to replace a dish you do not like","The soup was cold, so I sent it back.","Çorba sowukdy, şonuň üçin yzyna gaýtardym.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["leave a tip","/ˌliːv ə ˈtɪp/","PHR","çaýpuly goýmak","оставить чаевые","to give extra money to a waiter","We left a tip of ten percent.","On göterim çaýpuly goýduk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ask for the bill","/ˌɑːsk fə ðə ˈbɪl/","PHR","hasap soramak","попросить счёт","to ask to pay in a restaurant","After dessert we asked for the bill.","Desertden soň hasap soradyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["meal","/miːl/","N","nahar, tagam","еда, приём пищи","food eaten at one time","We had a lovely meal.","Ajap nahar iýdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","page":56,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hammer","/ˈhæmə(r)/","N","çekiç","молоток","a tool for hitting nails","He hit the nail with a hammer.","Çüýi çekiç bilen kakdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["screw","/skruː/","N","nurbat (wint)","винт, шуруп","a metal pin you twist in","Tighten the screw.","Nurbaty berk berkit.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["screwdriver","/ˈskruːdraɪvə(r)/","N","otwýortka","отвёртка","a tool for turning screws","Pass me the screwdriver.","Otwýortkany maňa ber.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["drill","/drɪl/","N","burgy (elektrik)","дрель","a tool for making holes","He used a drill on the wall.","Diwarda burgy ulandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["brush","/brʌʃ/","N","çotga (reňk)","кисть","a tool for painting","Clean the brush after use.","Ulanylandan soň çotgany arassala.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ladder","/ˈlædə(r)/","N","merdiwan","лестница (приставная)","a set of steps you can move","He climbed the ladder.","Merdiwana dyrmaşdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tool","/tuːl/","N","gural","инструмент","an object used to make or fix things","Keep your tools in a box.","Gurallaryňy gutuda sakla.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["plumber","/ˈplʌmə(r)/","N","santehnik","сантехник","a person who fixes water pipes","Call a plumber for the leak.","Syzynty üçin santehnik çagyr.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fix","/fɪks/","V","bejermek","чинить","to repair something","He fixed the broken chair.","Döwülen stuly bejerdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["brick","/brɪk/","N","kerpiç","кирпич","a hard block used for building walls","The house is made of red brick.","Öý gyzyl kerpiçden ýasalan.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bucket","/ˈbʌkɪt/","N","bedre","ведро","a round open container with a handle","Fill the bucket with water.","Bedräni suw bilen doldur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["drawing pin","/ˈdrɔːɪŋ pɪn/","N","düýbüşli iňňe","канцелярская кнопка","a short pin for fixing paper to a wall","He fixed the poster with drawing pins.","Plakaty düýbüşli iňňe bilen berkitdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glue","/ɡluː/","N","ýelim","клей","a substance used to stick things together","Use glue to fix the broken cup.","Döwülen käsäni ýelimle.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["handle","/ˈhændl/","N","tutawaç, gulp","ручка, рукоятка","the part of a door or tool you hold","The door handle is broken.","Gapy gulpy döwük.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["paintbrush","/ˈpeɪntbrʌʃ/","N","çotga (reňk)","малярная кисть","a brush used for painting","Wash the paintbrush after use.","Ulanylandan soň çotgany ýuw.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["penknife","/ˈpennaɪf/","N","büklenýän pyçak","складной нож","a small knife that folds","He cut the string with a penknife.","Ýüpi büklenýän pyçak bilen kesdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spanner","/ˈspænə/","N","açar (tehnik)","гаечный ключ","a tool for turning nuts","Use a spanner to tighten the bolt.","Bolti berkitmek üçin açar ulan.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["string","/strɪŋ/","N","ýüp, sapak","верёвка, бечёвка","thin strong rope","Tie the parcel with string.","Bohçany ýüp bilen daň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tile","/taɪl/","N","kafel, plitka","плитка (кафель)","a flat piece used to cover floors or walls","The kitchen has white tiles.","Aşhanada ak kafel bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["light bulb","/ˈlaɪt bʌlb/","N","lampoçka","лампочка","the glass part of a lamp that gives light","Change the light bulb, please.","Lampoçkany çalyş, haýyş.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["put together","/ˌpʊt təˈɡeðə/","PHR","ýygnamak, gurmak","собирать (мебель)","to make something by joining parts","We put together the new shelf.","Täze tekjäni gurdyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","page":60,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["withdraw","/wɪðˈdrɔː/","V","pul çykarmak","снимать (деньги)","to take money from an account","I withdrew fifty manat.","Elli manat çykardym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","withdraw cash","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["deposit","/dɪˈpɒzɪt/","V","goýmak (puly)","вносить (деньги)","to put money into an account","She deposited her salary.","Aýlygyny goýdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","deposit money","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["PIN","/pɪn/","N","pin-kod","пин-код","a secret number for a card","Never share your PIN.","Pin-koduňy hiç wagt paýlaşma.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["balance","/ˈbæləns/","N","galyndy (hasapdaky)","баланс, остаток","the money left in an account","Check your balance online.","Galyndyňy onlaýn barla.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","account balance","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["banknote","/ˈbæŋknəʊt/","N","kagyz pul","банкнота","a piece of paper money","He paid with a large banknote.","Uly kagyz pul bilen töledi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pay in","/peɪ ɪn/","PHR","goýmak (hasaba)","вносить (на счёт)","to put money into an account","I paid in the cheque.","Çeki hasaba goýdum.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["put aside","/pʊt əˈsaɪd/","PHR","ýygnaýyş etmek (aýyrmak)","откладывать (деньги)","to save money for later","We put aside a little each month.","Her aý biraz aýyrýarys.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pay off","/ˌpeɪ ˈɒf/","PHR","doly tölemek","выплатить (долг)","to finish paying money you owe","I am paying off my student loan until I am 45.","Talyp karzyny 45 ýaşyma çenli töleýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["live on","/ˌlɪv ˈɒn/","PHR","hasabyna ýaşamak","жить на (средства)","to use an amount of money to live","It is difficult to live on one salary.","Bir aýlyk hasabyna ýaşamak kyn.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get by","/ˌɡet ˈbaɪ/","PHR","güzeranyny görmek","сводить концы с концами","to have just enough money to live","We get by on very little money.","Gaty az pul bilen güzeranymyzy görýäris.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["run away","/ˌrʌn əˈweɪ/","PHR","gaçmak","убегать","to leave quickly to escape","Don't run away! I won't hurt you.","Gaçma! Saňa zyýan bermerin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["be away","/ˌbiː əˈweɪ/","PHR","ýokda bolmak","отсутствовать","to not be in a place","The boss will be away until next week.","Boss indiki hepde çenli ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take after","/ˌteɪk ˈɑːftə/","PHR","meňzemek","быть похожим на (родственника)","to be similar to an older family member","I take after my mother.","Eneme meňzeýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take on","/ˌteɪk ˈɒn/","PHR","işe almak","нанимать","to employ someone","They are taking on ten new interns.","On täze stajýor işe alýarlar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take over","/ˌteɪk ˈəʊvə/","PHR","öz üstüne almak","брать на себя; поглощать","to take control of something","My company was taken over by a big firm.","Kompaniýamy uly firma satyn aldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take apart","/ˌteɪk əˈpɑːt/","PHR","böleklere bölmek","разбирать на части","to separate something into its parts","Take the keyboard apart to clean it.","Arassalamak üçin klawiaturany böleklere böl.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["settle down","/ˌsetl ˈdaʊn/","PHR","ornuşmak, maşgula gurmaka girişmek","остепениться, обустроиться","to start living a quiet life in one place","He moved back to the city to settle down and start a family.","Maşgula gurmak üçin şähere dolandy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["back up","/ˌbæk ˈʌp/","PHR","ätiýaçlyk nusgasyny etmek","делать резервную копию","to copy a file so you do not lose it","Back up your files every week.","Her hepde faýllaryňyň nusgasyny et.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["close down","/ˌkləʊz ˈdaʊn/","PHR","ýapylmak","закрываться (о предприятии)","to stop being open permanently","The shop closed down last month.","Dükan geçen aý ýapyldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["put up","/ˌpʊt ˈʌp/","PHR","asmak, berkitmek","вешать, устанавливать","to fix something on a wall","We put up new shelves.","Täze tekçeleri asdyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["switch off","/ˌswɪtʃ ˈɒf/","PHR","öçürmek","выключать","to stop a machine with a switch","Switch off the computer.","Kompýuteri öçür.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["keep away","/ˌkiːp əˈweɪ/","PHR","daşda saklamak","отпугивать, держать подальше","to stop something coming near","The spray keeps away insects.","Spreý mör-möjekleri daşda saklaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ask for","/ˌɑːsk ˈfɔː/","PHR","soramak","просить","to say you want something","Ask for the bill when you are ready.","Taýýar bolsaň hasap sora.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["be out of","/ˌbiː aʊt əv/","PHR","gutarmak, ýok bolmak","закончиться (о товаре)","to have none left","We are out of milk.","Süýt gutardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sell out","/ˌsel ˈaʊt/","PHR","gutarmak (satuwda)","распродаваться","when all of something is sold","The concert tickets sold out in an hour.","Konsert biletleri bir sagatda gutardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["zoom in","/ˌzuːm ˈɪn/","PHR","ulaltmak (surat)","приближать (изображение)","to make something look closer or bigger","Zoom in on the person you want to photograph.","Surata düşürjek adamyňy ulalt.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","page":66,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["concert","/ˈkɒnsət/","N","konsert","концерт","a live music performance","We went to a rock concert.","Rok konsertine gitdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["stage","/steɪdʒ/","N","sahna","сцена","the platform where performers stand","The band walked onto the stage.","Topar sahna çykdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","on stage","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["front row","/ˌfrʌnt ˈrəʊ/","N","öňdäki hatar","первый ряд","the seats nearest the stage","We sat in the front row.","Öňdäki hatarda oturduk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in the front row","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["encore","/ˈɑːnkɔː(r)/","N","gaýtadan çykyş","выступление на бис","an extra song after the show","The crowd shouted for an encore.","Märele gaýtadan çykyş sorap gygyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["sold out","/ˌsəʊld ˈaʊt/","ADJ","biletler gutaran","распроданный","with all tickets sold","The show was sold out.","Tomaşanyň biletleri gutardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["interval","/ˈɪntəvl/","N","arakesme","антракт","a break in the middle of a show","We bought drinks at the interval.","Arakesmede içgi aldyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["orchestra","/ˈɔːkɪstrə/","N","orkestr","оркестр","a large group of musicians","The orchestra played beautifully.","Orkestr owadan çaldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["applause","/əˈplɔːz/","N","el çarpyşma","аплодисменты","clapping to show you liked it","The room burst into applause.","Otag el çarpyşma gaplandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","round of applause","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["show","/ʃəʊ/","N","tomaşa","шоу, представление","a performance for an audience","The show starts at eight.","Tomaşa sekizde başlaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","page":70,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["treat","/triːt/","V","hezzetlemek (höwes)","баловать, побаловать","to do something nice for yourself","Treat yourself to a massage.","Özüňi massaj bilen hezzetle.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","treat yourself","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spa","/spɑː/","N","spa (suw bejergisi)","спа","a place for relaxing treatments","They spent the day at a spa.","Güni spa-da geçirdiler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["massage","/ˈmæsɑːʒ/","N","massaj","массаж","rubbing the body to relax it","A back massage helped her relax.","Arka massajy köşeşmäge kömek etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","have a massage","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pamper","/ˈpæmpə(r)/","V","erjelletmek (hezzet)","баловать, нежить","to look after someone with treats","She pampered herself all weekend.","Hepde ahyry özini erjelletdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["unwind","/ˌʌnˈwaɪnd/","V","dynç almak (köşeşmek)","расслабляться, развеяться","to relax after stress","I unwind with a long bath.","Uzyn wanna bilen dynç alýaryn.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sauna","/ˈsaʊnə/","N","sauna","сауна","a hot room for sweating and relaxing","They cooled off after the sauna.","Saunadan soň sowyndylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["manicure","/ˈmænɪkjʊə(r)/","N","manikýur","маникюр","care for the hands and nails","She had a manicure yesterday.","Düýn manikýur etdirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wellbeing","/ˌwelˈbiːɪŋ/","N","sagdynlyk (abadaňlyk)","благополучие","the state of being healthy and happy","Exercise improves your wellbeing.","Maşk sagdynlygyňy gowulandyrýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["beauty salon","/ˈbjuːti ˈsælɒn/","N","gözellik salony","салон красоты","a place for beauty treatments","The beauty salon is on Main Street.","Gözellik salony Baş köçede.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["facial","/ˈfeɪʃl/","N","ýüz bejergisi","процедура для лица","a beauty treatment for the face","She had a facial at the spa.","Spada ýüz bejergisini aldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["yoga","/ˈjəʊɡə/","N","ýoga","йога","exercises for the body and breathing","She does yoga every morning.","Her irden ýoga edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pilates","/pɪˈlɑːtiːz/","N","pilates","пилатес","exercises that develop the body muscles","Pilates is good for your back.","Pilates arkaň üçin peýdaly.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pedicure","/ˈpedɪkjʊə/","N","pedikýur","педикюр","a beauty treatment for your feet","I had a manicure and a pedicure.","Manikýur we pedikýur etdirdim.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fringe","/frɪndʒ/","N","maňlaý saç","чёлка","short hair that hangs over your forehead","She cut her fringe herself.","Maňlaý saçyny özi kesdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["parting","/ˈpɑːtɪŋ/","N","saç aýryşy","пробор","the line where hair is divided","He has a parting on the left.","Çep tarapda saç aýryşy bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["highlights","/ˈhaɪlaɪts/","N","açyk reňkli saç tutamlary","мелирование","parts of hair made lighter than the rest","She had blonde highlights.","Saryşyn tutamlar etdirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["buzz cut","/ˈbʌz kʌt/","N","gaty gysga saç kesimi","очень короткая стрижка","a very short haircut","He had a buzz cut in the army.","Goşunda gaty gysga saç kesdirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ponytail","/ˈpəʊniteɪl/","N","guýruk saç","хвост (причёска)","hair tied at the back of the head","She wore her hair in a ponytail.","Saçyny guýruk edip daňdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["plaits","/plæts/","N","örgüli saç","косы","hair made by twisting three parts together","The girl had two plaits.","Gyzjagazyň iki örgüli saçy bardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cross-trainer","/ˈkrɒs treɪnə/","N","kross türgenleşik enjamy","кросс-тренажёр","an exercise machine for arms and legs","He uses the cross-trainer for twenty minutes.","Ýigrimi minut kross-trenažýory ulanýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rowing machine","/ˈrəʊɪŋ məʃiːn/","N","greb türgenleşik enjamy","гребной тренажёр","an exercise machine you pull like rowing","The rowing machine is very hard work.","Grebleý trenažýory gaty kyn iş.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["running machine","/ˈrʌnɪŋ məʃiːn/","N","ylgaw türgenleşik enjamy","беговая дорожка","a machine with a moving surface you run on","She runs on the running machine.","Ylgaw trenažýorynda ylgaw edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["exercise bike","/ˈeksəsaɪz baɪk/","N","türgenleşik welosipedi","велотренажёр","a bicycle that stays in one place for exercise","I ride the exercise bike while watching TV.","Telewizor görüp türgenleşik welosipedini münýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sit-ups","/ˈsɪtʌps/","N","oturyp-turmak maşky","упражнение на пресс","an exercise where you sit up from lying down","He does fifty sit-ups every day.","Her gün elli oturyp-turmak maşky edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["press-ups","/ˈpresʌps/","N","otjimaniýe","отжимания","an exercise lifting your body on your hands","Can you do twenty press-ups?","Ýigrimi otžimaniýe edip bilýäňmi?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["aerobics","/eəˈrəʊbɪks/","N","aerobika","аэробика","active exercises done to music","She goes to aerobics on Tuesdays.","Sişenbe günleri aerobika gatnaşýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spinning","/ˈspɪnɪŋ/","N","spinning","спиннинг (велотренировка)","aerobic exercises on an exercise bike with music","Spinning classes are very popular.","Spinning sapaklary gaty meşhur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["trim","/trɪm/","N","saç ujyny almak","подравнивание (кончиков)","a small haircut to make hair tidy","Just a trim, please.","Diňe ujyny alyň, haýyş.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["blow dry","/ˈbləʊ draɪ/","N","fen bilen guramak","укладка феном","drying hair with warm air","She had a wash and blow dry.","Saçyny ýuwdurdy we fen etdirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","page":76,"section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fortress","/ˈfɔːtrəs/","N","gala (berkitme)","крепость","a strong place built for defence","The fortress was never captured.","Gala hiç wagt alynmady.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["monument","/ˈmɒnjumənt/","N","ýadygärlik","памятник, монумент","a statue built to remember","They laid flowers at the monument.","Ýadygärlige gül goýdular.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["memorial","/məˈmɔːriəl/","N","hatyra ýadygärligi","мемориал","something built to remember people","The memorial honours the fallen.","Hatyra ýadygärligi pidalary hatyralaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["tomb","/tuːm/","N","mazar (gübbez)","гробница","a place where a dead person lies","The king was buried in a tomb.","Patyşa mazarda jaýlanypdyr.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["archer","/ˈɑːtʃə/","N","ýaý atyjy","лучник","a person who shoots with a bow and arrow","The archers stood on the wall.","Ýaý atyjylar diwaryň üstünde durdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["arrow","/ˈærəʊ/","N","ok","стрела","a thin stick shot from a bow","The arrow hit the target.","Ok nyşana degdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["bow","/bəʊ/","N","ýaý","лук (оружие)","a weapon for shooting arrows","He shot the bow with skill.","Ýaýy ussatlyk bilen atdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["helmet","/ˈhelmɪt/","N","duýga, kaska","шлем","a hard hat that protects your head","The soldiers wore metal helmets.","Esgeler demir duýga geýdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["shield","/ʃiːld/","N","galkan","щит","a cover you hold to protect yourself in a fight","He carried a wooden shield.","Agaç galkan göterdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["battle","/ˈbætl/","N","söweş","битва, сражение","a fight between armies","The Battle of Hastings was in 1066.","Gastings söweşi 1066-njy ýylda boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","page":80,"section":"vocabulary"}]],["unbelievable","/ˌʌnbɪˈliːvəbl/","ADJ","ynanyp bolmajak","невероятный","impossible to believe","The news was unbelievable.","Habar ynanyp bolmajak boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["unbreakable","/ˌʌnˈbreɪkəbl/","ADJ","döwülmeýän","небьющийся","impossible to break","The phone has an unbreakable screen.","Telefonyň döwülmeýän ekrany bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["misunderstanding","/ˌmɪsʌndəˈstændɪŋ/","N","nädogry düşünme","недоразумение","a failure to understand correctly","It was just a misunderstanding.","Diňe nädogry düşünme boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["rewrite","/ˌriːˈraɪt/","V","täzeden ýazmak","переписывать","to write something again","I had to rewrite the essay.","Esseýi täzeden ýazmaly boldum.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["retell","/ˌriːˈtel/","V","gaýtadan gürrüň bermek","пересказывать","to tell a story again","Retell the story in your own words.","Hekaýany öz sözüň bilen gaýtadan gürrüň ber.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["rediscover","/ˌriːdɪˈskʌvə(r)/","V","täzeden açmak","заново открыть","to find something again","She rediscovered her love of painting.","Suratkeşlige bolan söýgüsini täzeden açdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["reconnect","/ˌriːkəˈnekt/","V","täzeden birikmek","воссоединиться","to join or meet again","He reconnected with old friends.","Köne dostlary bilen täzeden birikdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["reappear","/ˌriːəˈpɪə(r)/","V","täzeden peýda bolmak","снова появиться","to appear again","The sun reappeared after the rain.","Ýagyşdan soň Gün täzeden peýda boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["unstoppable","/ʌnˈstɒpəbl/","ADJ","saklanyp bolmajak","неудержимый","impossible to stop","The team was unstoppable.","Topar saklanyp bolmajak boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["fearless","/ˈfɪələs/","ADJ","gorkusyz","бесстрашный","not afraid of anything","The fearless climber reached the top.","Gorkusyz alpinist depä ýetdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["hopeless","/ˈhəʊpləs/","ADJ","umytsyz (başarnyksyz)","безнадёжный","with no hope, or very bad at something","He is hopeless at maths.","Matematikada başarnyksyz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["ability","/əˈbɪləti/","N","ukyptylyk","способность","the skill to do something","She has the ability to learn languages.","Dil öwrenmek ukyby bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["accurate","/ˈækjərət/","ADJ","takyk","точный","correct and without mistakes","The weather report was not accurate.","Howa maglumaty takyk däldi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["atomic","/əˈtɒmɪk/","ADJ","atom","атомный","using the energy of atoms","Atomic energy is controversial.","Atom energiýasy jedelli mesele.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["autobiographical","/ˌɔːtəbaɪəˈɡræfɪkl/","ADJ","awtobiografik","автобиографический","about the writer’s own life","The novel has autobiographical elements.","Romanda awtobiografik elementler bar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["connection","/kəˈnekʃn/","N","aragatnaşyk, baglanyşyk","связь","a link between things","There is a connection between the two events.","Iki wakanyň arasynda baglanyşyk bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wordbuilding"}]],["emotional","/ɪˈməʊʃənl/","ADJ","duýguly","эмоциональный","about feelings","It was an emotional moment.","Duýguly pursatdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","page":86,"section":"wo