ct your bags","Your case is at baggage claim.","Çemodanyň ýük alýan ýerde.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["It did not arrive.","/ɪt ˈdɪd nɒt əˈraɪv/","PHR","Gelmedi.","Он не прибыл.","used to say your bag is missing","My suitcase did not arrive.","Çemodanym gelmedi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["fill in this form","/fɪl ɪn ðɪs fɔːm/","PHR","Şu formany dolduryň.","Заполните эту форму.","used to ask for written details","Please fill in this form.","Şu formany dolduryň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["reference number","/ˈrefrəns ˈnʌmbə(r)/","N","salgylanma belgisi","номер дела","a code for your case","Write down the reference number.","Salgylanma belgisini ýazyp al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["It is a black suitcase.","/ɪt ɪz ə blæk ˈsuːtkeɪs/","PHR","Gara çemodan.","Это чёрный чемодан.","used to describe your bag","It is a black suitcase with wheels.","Tekerli gara çemodan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["contact details","/ˈkɒntækt ˈdiːteɪlz/","N","aragatnaşyk maglumatlary","контактные данные","your phone and address","Leave your contact details.","Aragatnaşyk maglumatlaryňyzy goýuň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["address","/əˈdres/","N","salgy","адрес","where someone lives or a building is","Please write your address on the form.","Salgyňyzy formanyň üstüne ýazyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE1","page":14,"section":"practical_english"}]],["details","/ˈdiːteɪlz/","N","maglumatlar","данные, детали","