it (öňünden)","залог","money paid first as security","There is a 500 manat deposit.","500 manat depozit bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["How long for?","/haʊ lɒŋ fə(r)/","PHR","Näçe wagtlyk?","На какой срок?","used to ask the rental period","How long for? — Three days.","Näçe wagtlyk? — Üç gün.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Can I see your licence?","/kæn aɪ siː jɔː(r) ˈlaɪsns/","PHR","Prawaňyzy görüp bilerinmi?","Можно ваши права?","used to check driving papers","Can I see your licence, please?","Prawaňyzy görüp bilerinmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE2","page":34,"section":"practical_english"}]],["report a crime","/rɪˈpɔːt ə kraɪm/","PHR","jenaýat barada habar bermek","сообщить о преступлении","to tell the police about a crime","I want to report a crime.","Jenaýat barada habar bermek isleýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["break into","/breɪk ˈɪntə/","PHR","ogrulyk bilen girmek","вломиться","to enter a place by force","Someone broke into my flat.","Biri öýüme ogrulyk bilen giripdir.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["What was stolen?","/wɒt wɒz ˈstəʊlən/","PHR","Näme ogurlandy?","Что было украдено?","used to ask what was taken","What was stolen from the house?","Öýden näme ogurlandy?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["Did you see anyone?","/dɪd ju siː ˈeniwʌn/","PHR","Birini gördüňizmi?","Вы кого-нибудь видели?","used to ask about witnesses","Did you see anyone near the door?","Gapynyň ýanynda birini gördüňizmi?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["file a report","/faɪl ə rɪˈpɔːt/","PHR","arz ýazmak","подать заявление","to make an official statement","You need to file a report.","Arz ýazmaly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["It happened last night.","/ɪt ˈhæpnd lɑːst naɪt/","PHR","Düýn gije boldy.","Это случилось прошлой ночью.","used to say when it happened","It happened last night at ten.","Düýn gije sagat onda boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["case number","/keɪs ˈnʌmbə(r)/","N","iş belgisi","номер дела","the code for your case","Note down the case number.","Iş belgisini ýazyp al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["contact the police","/ˈkɒntækt ðə pəˈliːs/","PHR","polisiýa bilen habarlaşmak","связаться с полицией","to get in touch with police","Contact the police if you see him.","Ony görseň polisiýa bilen habarlaş.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE3","page":54,"section":"practical_english"}]],["house rules","/ˈhaʊs ruːlz/","N","öý düzgünleri","правила дома","the rules in a home","Please follow the house rules.","Öý düzgünlerine eýeriň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["You have to...","/ju hæv tuː/","PHR","Sen ... etmeli.","Ты должен...","used to say something is necessary","You have to take your shoes off.","Aýakgabyňy çykarmaly.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["You are not allowed to...","/ju ər nɒt əˈlaʊd tuː/","PHR","Saňa ... rugsat berilmeýär.","Тебе не разрешается...","used to say something is forbidden","You are not allowed to smoke here.","Bu ýerde çilim çekmäge rugsat berilmeýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["take your shoes off","/teɪk jɔː(r) ʃuːz ɒf/","PHR","aýakgabyňy çykar","сними обувь","used to ask someone to remove shoes","Please take your shoes off inside.","Içeride aýakgabyňy çykar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["keep it down","/kiːp ɪt daʊn/","PHR","sesiňi peselt","потише, не шуми","used to ask for quiet","Keep it down, people are sleeping.","Sesiňi peselt, adamlar uklaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["no smoking","/nəʊ ˈsməʊkɪŋ/","PHR","çilim çekmek gadagan","курение запрещено","used to forbid smoking","There is no smoking indoors.","Içeride çilim çekmek gadagan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["clean up after yourself","/kliːn ʌp ˈɑːftə(r) jɔːˈself/","PHR","yzyňy ýygna","убери за собой","used to ask someone to tidy","Clean up after yourself in the kitchen.","Aşhanada yzyňy ýygna.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["help yourself","/help jɔːˈself/","PHR","özüň al (hoş geldiň)","угощайтесь","used to invite someone to take things","Help yourself to any food.","Islän naharyňy özüň al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE4","page":74,"section":"practical_english"}]],["It is on the first floor.","/ɪt ɪz ɒn ðə ˌfɜːst ˈflɔː(r)/","PHR","Birinji gatda.","Это на первом этаже.","used to say where something is","The office is on the first floor.","Edara birinji gatda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["take the lift","/teɪk ðə lɪft/","PHR","liftde çyk","воспользуйтесь лифтом","used to tell someone to use the lift","Take the lift to the top floor.","Iň ýokarky gata liftde çyk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["turn left at the...","/tɜːn left ət ðə/","PHR","...-da çepe öwrül","поверните налево у...","used to give a direction","Turn left at the corner.","Burçda çepe öwrül.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["go straight ahead","/ɡəʊ streɪt əˈhed/","PHR","göni öňe git","идите прямо","used to say continue forward","Go straight ahead to the door.","Gapa çenli göni öňe git.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["It is opposite the...","/ɪt ɪz ˈɒpəzɪt ðə/","PHR","...-yň garşysynda.","Это напротив...","used to say across from something","It is opposite the café.","Kafeniň garşysynda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["next to the...","/nekst tuː ðə/","PHR","...-yň ýanynda.","Рядом с...","used to say beside something","The bank is next to the shop.","Bank dükanyň ýanynda.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["at the end of the corridor","/ət ði end əv ðə ˈkɒrɪdɔː(r)/","PHR","koridoryň ahyrynda.","В конце коридора.","used to give a location","The toilets are at the end of the corridor.","Hajathanalar koridoryň ahyrynda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["you cannot miss it","/ju ˈkænɒt mɪs ɪt/","PHR","sypdyrmarsyň.","вы не пропустите.","used to say it is easy to find","It has a big sign — you cannot miss it.","Uly belgisi bar — sypdyrmarsyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"intp","unit":11,"lesson":"PE5","page":94,"section":"practical_english"}]],["application","/