кадры)","to find new people for a job","The company recruited ten engineers.","Kompaniýa on hünärmeni işe aldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","recruit staff","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["open-minded","/ˌəʊpən ˈmaɪndɪd/","ADJ","açyk pikirli","непредвзятый","willing to consider new ideas","She is open-minded about new ideas.","Täze pikirlere açyk pikirli.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["narrow-minded","/ˌnærəʊ ˈmaɪndɪd/","ADJ","çäklendirilen pikirli","ограниченный (о взглядах)","not willing to accept different ideas","His narrow-minded views upset people.","Çäklendirilen pikirleri adamlary biynjalyk edýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["old-fashioned","/ˌəʊld ˈfæʃnd/","ADJ","köne düşünjeli","старомодный","not modern","He has some old-fashioned opinions.","Käbir köne düşünjeli pikiri bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["well-known","/ˌwel ˈnəʊn/","ADJ","meşhur","известный","known by many people","He is a well-known TV presenter.","Meşhur telewizion alyp baryjy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["well-paid","/ˌwel ˈpeɪd/","ADJ","gowy tölenýän","хорошо оплачиваемый","earning a lot of money","She has a well-paid job in finance.","Maliýede gowy tölenýän işi bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a well-paid job","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["short-term","/ˌʃɔːt ˈtɜːm/","ADJ","gysga möhletli","краткосрочный","lasting a short time","This is only a short-term solution.","Bu diňe gysga möhletli çözgüt.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","short-term plan","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["long-term","/ˌlɒŋ ˈtɜːm/","ADJ","uzak möhletli","долгосрочный","lasting a long time","They need a long-term strategy.","Uzak möhletli strategiýa gerek.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","long-term effect","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["high-quality","/ˌhaɪ ˈkwɒləti/","ADJ","ýokary hilli","высококачественный","very good in quality","They sell high-quality shoes.","Ýokary hilli aýakgap satýarlar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","high-quality products","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["good-tempered","/ˌɡʊd ˈtempəd/","ADJ","gowy häsiýetli","добродушный","rarely angry","Our good-tempered dog loves children.","Gowy häsiýetli itimiz çagalary söýýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bad-tempered","/ˌbæd ˈtempəd/","ADJ","erbet häsiýetli","раздражительный","often angry","The bad-tempered neighbour shouted again.","Erbet häsiýetli goňşy ýene gygyrdy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["world-famous","/ˌwɜːld ˈfeɪməs/","ADJ","dünýä belli","всемирно известный","known everywhere in the world","They visited the world-famous museum.","Dünýä belli muzeýe baryp gördüler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ache","/eɪk/","N","agyry","боль (ноющая)","a continuous pain","I have an ache in my back.","Arkamda agyry bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","back ache","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stomachache","/ˈstʌməkeɪk/","N","garyn agyry","боль в животе","a pain in the stomach","The child has a stomachache.","Çaganyň garyny agyrýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["toothache","/ˈtuːθeɪk/","N","diş agyry","зубная боль","a pain in a tooth","Toothache kept him awake.","Diş agyry ony ukusyz goýdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bruise","/bruːz/","N","gökerti","синяк","a dark mark on the skin after a hit","She has a bruise on her arm.","Golunda gökerti bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a black bruise","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rash","/ræʃ/","N","gijilewük","сыпь","red spots on the skin","The baby has a rash on her neck.","Çaganyň boýnunda gijilewük bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sprain","/spreɪn/","V","burmak (bilegi)","растянуть (связки)","to injure a joint by twisting it","I sprained my ankle playing football.","Futbol oýnap ýanjygymy burdum.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","sprain your ankle","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["swelling","/ˈswelɪŋ/","N","çiş","отёк","an area that becomes bigger after injury","Put ice on the swelling.","Çişe buz goý.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["unconscious","/ʌnˈkɒnʃəs/","ADJ","huşsuz","без сознания","not awake or aware","The driver was unconscious after the crash.","Sürüji çaknyşykdan soň huşsuz boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["surgery","/ˈsɜːdʒəri/","N"," operasiýa; lukman otagy","операция; приёмная врача","a medical operation, or the place a doctor works","He needs surgery on his knee.","Dyzine operasiýa gerek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","have surgery","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["casual","/ˈkæʒuəl/","ADJ","ýönekeý (geýim)","повседневный","comfortable and not formal","The office dress code is casual.","Edaranyň geýim düzgüni ýönekeý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","casual clothes","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["checked","/tʃekt/","ADJ","öýjükli","в клетку","with a pattern of squares","He wore a checked shirt.","Öýjükli köýnek geýdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a checked shirt","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cotton","/ˈkɒtn/","N","pagta (mata)","хлопок","cloth made from a soft white plant","This T-shirt is 100% cotton.","Bu futbolka 100% pagta.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","made of cotton","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["label","/ˈleɪbl/","N","ýarlyk","этикетка, ярлык","a piece of material with information","Check the label for washing advice.","Ýuwmak maslahaty üçin ýarlygy barla.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","designer label","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["leather","/ˈleðə(r)/","N","deri (material)","кожа (материал)","skin of an animal used to make clothes","She bought a leather jacket.","Deri kurtka satyn aldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","leather shoes","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["plain","/pleɪn/","ADJ","ýönekeý (nagşysyz)","однотонный, гладкий","with no pattern or decoration","He prefers plain white shirts.","Ýönekeý ak köýnekleri gowy görýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a plain T-shirt","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["silk","/sɪlk/","N","ýüpek","шёлк","soft shiny cloth made by insects","Her silk dress cost a fortune.","Ýüpek köýnegi köp durdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","silk scarf","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["smart","/smɑːt/","ADJ","oňat geýnen","нарядный, элегантный","looking clean and formal","You look smart in that suit.","Şol kostýumda oňat geýnen görünýärsiň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","smart clothes","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["striped","/straɪpt/","ADJ","çyzykly","полосатый","with lines of colour","She wore a striped jumper.","Çyzykly switer geýdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a striped shirt","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["suede","/sweɪd/","N","zamşa","замша","soft leather with a furry surface","Her suede boots are expensive.","Zamşa ädikleri gymmat.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wool","/wʊl/","N","ýüň","шерсть","cloth made from sheep hair","Wool socks keep your feet warm.","Ýüň joraplar aýaklaryňy ýyly saklaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","wool jumper","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["overhead locker","/ˈəʊvəhed ˈlɒkə(r)/","N","ýokarky ýük şkafy","багажная полка","the space above the seats for bags","Put your bag in the overhead locker.","Sumkaňyzy ýokarky ýük şkafyna goýuň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["runway","/ˈrʌnweɪ/","N","uçuş zolagy","взлётно-посадочная полоса","the strip where planes take off","The plane taxied to the runway.","Uçar uçuş zolagyna tarap hereket etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take-off","/ˈteɪk ɒf/","N","uçma (howa gämisi)","взлёт","the moment a plane leaves the ground","Take-off was delayed by fog.","Uçma tuman sebäpli giçikdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","during take-off","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["airline","/ˈeəlaɪn/","N","howa ýollary","авиакомпания","a company that flies planes","Which airline do you fly with?","Haýsy howa ýollary bilen uçýarsyňyz?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","airline ticket","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["landing","/ˈlændɪŋ/","N","gonma","посадка (самолёта)","the moment a plane comes down","The landing was very smooth.","Gonma gaty ýumşak boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","a smooth landing","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["almost","/ˈɔːlməʊst/","ADV","diýen ýaly","почти","very nearly","Almost everyone passed the exam.","Diýen ýaly hemme synagdan geçdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["by far","/baɪ fɑː(r)/","PHR","has aýdyň","намного, безусловно","used to say something is much the best","She is by far the best player.","Ol has aýdyň iň gowy oýunçy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["definitely","/ˈdefɪnətli/","ADV","elbetde","определённо","without any doubt","This is definitely the best film this year.","Bu elbetde şu ýylyň iň gowy filmi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["especially","/ɪˈspeʃəli/","ADV","aýratyn","особенно","more than usual","I love fruit, especially melons.","Miwe gowy görýärin, aýratyn gawunlary.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["nearly","/ˈnɪəli/","ADV","diýen ýaly (ýakyn)","почти","almost; very nearly","It is nearly midnight.","Diýen ýaly gije ýary.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["climate","/ˈklaɪmət/","N","howa şertleri","климат","the general weather of a place","Turkmenistan has a dry climate.","Türkmenistanyň howa şertleri gurak.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","dry climate","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["drought","/draʊt/","N","gurakçylyk","засуха","a long time without rain","The drought ruined the harvest.","Gurakçylyk hasyly ýok etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["flood","/flʌd/","N","suw joşmasy","наводнение","water covering dry land","The flood closed the road.","Suw joşmasy ýoly ýapdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hurricane","/ˈhʌrɪkən/","N","harasat","ураган","a violent tropical storm","The hurricane destroyed the village.","Harasat obany weýran etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["thunderstorm","/ˈθʌndəstɔːm/","N","gök gürrüldili ýagyş","гроза","a storm with thunder and lightning","The thunderstorm lasted an hour.","Gök gürrüldili ýagyş bir sagat dowam etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["forecast","/ˈfɔːkɑːst/","N","howa maglumaty","прогноз погоды","a report about coming weather","The forecast says snow tomorrow.","Howa maglumaty ertir gar diýýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","weather forecast","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["humid","/ˈhjuːmɪd/","ADJ","ygally (howa)","влажный","with a lot of water in the air","Summers here are hot and humid.","Bu ýerde tomus yssy we ygally.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["global warming","/ˌɡləʊbl ˈwɔːmɪŋ/","N","global ýylylyk","глобальное потепление","the rise in the Earth's temperature","Global warming is melting the ice.","Global ýylylyk buzlary eredýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["climate change","/ˈklaɪmət tʃeɪndʒ/","N","howanyň üýtgemegi","изменение климата","long-term changes in the weather","We must fight climate change.","Howanyň üýtgemegine garşy göreşmeli.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["endangered species","/ɪnˈdeɪndʒəd ˈspiːʃiːz/","N","howp astyndaky görnüşler","вымирающие виды","animals or plants that may die out","The snow leopard is an endangered species.","Garyň barsy howp astyndaky görnüş.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["emissions","/ɪˈmɪʃnz/","N","zyňyndylar","выбросы","gases sent into the air","Cars produce harmful emissions.","Maşynlar zyýanly zyňyndylar çykarýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","carbon emissions","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["deforestation","/ˌdiːˌfɒrɪˈsteɪʃn/","N","tokaýlaryň gyrylmagy","вырубка лесов","cutting down all the trees in an area","Deforestation threatens many animals.","Tokaýlaryň gyrylmagy köp haýwanlara howp salýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["take advantage of","/teɪk ədˈvɑːntɪdʒ əv/","PHR","peýdalanmak","воспользоваться; обмануть","to use an opportunity, or to treat someone unfairly","Take advantage of the free trial.","Mugt synagdan peýdalanyň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take part in","/teɪk pɑːt ɪn/","PHR","gatnaşmak","участвовать в","to join an activity","Did you take part in the competition?","Bäsleşige gatnaşdyňmy?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take place","/teɪk pleɪs/","PHR","bolup geçmek","происходить","to happen","The concert takes place on Friday.","Konsert anna güni bolup geçýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take turns","/teɪk tɜːnz/","PHR","nobatma-nobat","по очереди","to do something one after another","We take turns to drive.","Nobatma-nobat ulag sürýäris.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take turns to do","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take care of","/teɪk keər əv/","PHR","ideg etmek","заботиться о","to look after someone or something","She takes care of her little brother.","Kiçi doganyna ideg edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take your time","/teɪk jɔː(r) taɪm/","PHR","howlukma","не торопись","to do something without hurrying","Take your time — there is no rush.","Howlukma — howlukmaçlyk ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take it easy","/teɪk ɪt ˈiːzi/","PHR","dynç al","не волнуйся, спокойнее","to relax and not worry","Take it easy — everything will be fine.","Dynç al — hemme zat gowy bolar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take a break","/teɪk ə breɪk/","PHR","arakesme etmek","сделать перерыв","to rest for a while","Let us take a break for ten minutes.","Geliň, on minut arakesme edeliň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["take something seriously","/teɪk ˈsʌmθɪŋ ˈsɪəriəsli/","PHR","çynlakaý kabul etmek","принимать всерьёз","to treat something as important","You should take his warning seriously.","Onuň duýduryşyny çynlakaý kabul etmeli.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ashamed","/əˈʃeɪmd/","ADJ","utanýan","пристыженный","feeling bad about something you did","He was ashamed of his mistake.","Ýalňyşy üçin utanýardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","ashamed of","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["delighted","/dɪˈlaɪtɪd/","ADJ","şaý-sevinçli (şat)","в восторге","very pleased","We were delighted with the news.","Habara şaý-sevinçli bolduk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","delighted with","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["grateful","/ˈɡreɪtfl/","ADJ","minnetdar","благодарный","feeling thankful","I am grateful for your help.","Kömegiňiz üçin minnetdar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","grateful for","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["homesick","/ˈhəʊmsɪk/","ADJ","watana küýseli","тоскующий по дому","missing your home","He got homesick in his first month.","Birinji aýynda watana küýsedi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["miserable","/ˈmɪzrəbl/","ADJ","bagtyýar däl (örän betbagt)","несчастный","very unhappy","The cold rain made us miserable.","Sowuk ýagyş bizi betbagt etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["proud","/praʊd/","ADJ","buýsançly","гордый","pleased about something you did","Her parents are proud of her.","Ene-atasy oňa buýsanýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","proud of","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["relieved","/rɪˈliːvd/","ADJ","ýeňillik duýýan","чувствующий облегчение","happy that a problem ended","I was relieved when he called.","Ol jaň edende ýeňillik duýdum.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","relieved to hear","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["upset","/ʌpˈset/","ADJ","ynjylan","расстроенный","unhappy because of something bad","She was upset by the news.","Habardan ynjyldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","feel upset","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["frustrated","/frʌˈstreɪtɪd/","ADJ","lapykeç (gaharly)","разочарованный (раздражённый)","angry because you cannot do something","She got frustrated with the slow internet.","Haýal internetden lapykeç boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","frustrated with","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["amuse","/əˈmjuːz/","V","güldürmek","забавлять","to make someone smile or laugh","His jokes amused the children.","Degişmeleri çagalary güldürdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["annoy","/əˈnɔɪ/","V","gaharyňy getirmek","раздражать","to make someone a little angry","The noise annoyed the neighbours.","Goh goňşularyň gaharyny getirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bore","/bɔː(r)/","V","bikar etmek","наскучивать","to make someone lose interest","The long speech bored everyone.","Uzyn çykyş hemmäni bikar etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["depress","/dɪˈpres/","V","ruhdan düşürmek","удручать","to make someone very unhappy","The grey weather depressed him.","Çal howa ony ruhdan düşürdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["embarrass","/ɪmˈbærəs/","V","utandyrmak","смущать","to make someone feel awkward","His questions embarrassed the speaker.","Soraglary çykyş edijini utandyrdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["excite","/ɪkˈsaɪt/","V","täsirlendirmek (joşdurmaga)","волновать","to make someone feel eager","The trip excited the students.","Syýahat talyplary joşdurdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["frighten","/ˈfraɪtn/","V","gorkuzmak","пугать","to make someone afraid","The thunder frightened the baby.","Gök gürrüldisi çagany gorkuzdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","frighten someone","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["irritate","/ˈɪrɪteɪt/","V","jynjygaltmak","раздражать (слегка)","to annoy someone slightly","His habit of humming irritated me.","Onuň hümmürdeme endigi meni jynjygaltdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["shock","/ʃɒk/","V","şok etmek","шокировать","to surprise someone very much","The result shocked everyone.","Netije hemmäni şok etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["fall asleep","/fɔːl əˈsliːp/","PHR","uklamak (ukusyna gitmek)","засыпать","to start sleeping","I fell asleep during the film.","Filmiň dowamynda ukusyna gitdim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["doze off","/dəʊz ɒf/","PHR","mürgülemek","задремать","to fall asleep lightly","He dozed off on the bus.","Awtobusda mürgüledi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["oversleep","/ˌəʊvəˈsliːp/","V","ukuda galmak","проспать","to wake up later than planned","I overslept and missed the train.","Ukuda galyp, otludyr sypdyrdym.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["nap","/næp/","N","gündizki uky","дневной сон","a short sleep in the day","A 20-minute nap helps you focus.","20 minutlyk gündizki uky ünsüňi jemlemäge kömek edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take a nap","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["insomnia","/ɪnˈsɒmniə/","N","ukusyzlyk","бессонница","when you cannot sleep","Stress can cause insomnia.","Dartgynlylyk ukusyzlyga sebäp bolup biler.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["yawn","/jɔːn/","V","äsnemek","зевать","to open the mouth wide when tired","She yawned at the meeting.","Duşuşykda äsnedi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bedtime","/ˈbedtaɪm/","N","ýatyş wagty","время сна","the time you usually go to bed","Bedtime for the children is nine.","Çagalaryň ýatyş wagty dokuz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["light sleeper","/laɪt ˈsliːpə(r)/","N","ýeňil ukyly","чутко спящий","a person who wakes easily","I am a light sleeper — any noise wakes me.","Ýeňil ukyly — islendik ses meni oýarýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["sleeping pill","/ˈsliːpɪŋ pɪl/","N","uky dermany","снотворное","medicine that helps you sleep","The doctor gave him a sleeping pill.","Lukman oňa uky dermanyny berdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","take a sleeping pill","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["wide awake","/ˌwaɪd əˈweɪk/","PHR","düýbünden oýak","бодрствующий","completely awake","The noise left me wide awake at 3 a.m.","Goh gije 3-de meni düýbünden oýak goýdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["album","/ˈælbəm/","N","albom (saz)","альбом","a collection of songs","Their new album came out in May.","Täze albomlary maýda çykdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","debut album","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["band","/bænd/","N","saz topary","группа (музыкальная)","a group of musicians","The band plays every Saturday.","Saz topary her şenbe oýnaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","rock band","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["chorus","/ˈkɔːrəs/","N","gaýtalama bent","припев","the part of a song that repeats","Everyone sings the chorus.","Hemme kişi gaýtalama bendi aýdýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","sing the chorus","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["composer","/kəmˈpəʊzə(r)/","N","kompozitor","композитор","a person who writes music","The composer wrote the music at twenty.","Kompozitor sazy ýigrimi ýaşynda ýazdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["conductor","/kənˈdʌktə(r)/","N","dirijor","дирижёр","the person who leads an orchestra","The conductor raised his baton.","Dirijor taýajygyny galdyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["gig","/ɡɪɡ/","N","konsert (kiçi)","концерт (группы)","a live music performance","We went to a gig last night.","Düýn agşam konserte gitdik.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","play a gig","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["lyrics","/ˈlɪrɪks/","N","sözler (aýdymyň)","слова песни","the words of a song","I love the lyrics of this song.","Bu aýdymyň sözlerini gowy görýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","song lyrics","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["venue","/ˈvenjuː/","N","konsert meýdançasy","место проведения","the place where an event happens","The venue holds 2,000 people.","Meýdança 2,000 adam sygdyrýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","concert venue","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["volume","/ˈvɒljuːm/","N","ses derejesi","громкость","how loud the sound is","Turn the volume down, please.","Ses derejesini peselt.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","turn up the volume","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["catchy","/ˈkætʃi/","ADJ","ýatda galýan","запоминающийся (о мелодии)","easy to remember and sing","The song has a catchy tune.","Aýdymyň ýatda galýan ahengi bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","catchy tune","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["tune","/tjuːn/","N","ahenk","мелодия","a series of musical notes","She hummed a familiar tune.","Tanyş ahengi hümmürdedi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","hum a tune","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["rob","/rɒb/","V","talamak","грабить","to steal from a place or person","Thieves robbed the bank.","Ogrular banky talady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","rob a bank","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["brain","/breɪn/","N","beýni","мозг","the organ inside the head that thinks","The brain controls everything.","Beýni hemme zady dolandyrýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","use your brain","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["eyebrow","/ˈaɪbraʊ/","N","gaş","бровь","the line of hair above the eye","She raised one eyebrow.","Bir gaşyny galdyrdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","raise an eyebrow","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["jaw","/dʒɔː/","N","äň","челюсть","the bone that holds the teeth","He broke his jaw in the match.","Oýunda äňini döwdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["lung","/lʌŋ/","N","öýken","лёгкое","the organ used for breathing","Smoking damages the lungs.","Çilim öýkenlere zyýan ýetirýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","lung disease","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["nail","/neɪl/","N","dyrnak","ноготь","the hard part on a finger","She cut her nails.","Dyrnaklaryny kesdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","bite your nails","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rib","/rɪb/","N","gapyrga","ребро","a bone around the chest","He broke two ribs.","Iki gapyrgasyny döwdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["skull","/skʌl/","N","kelle çanagy","череп","the bone structure of the head","The skull protects the brain.","Kelle çanagy beýnini goraýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["spine","/spaɪn/","N","oňurga","позвоночник","the row of bones down the back","Good posture protects your spine.","Gowy duruş oňurgaňy goraýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["break in","/breɪk ɪn/","PHR","ogrulyk bilen girmek","врываться (для кражи)","to enter a building by force to steal","Thieves broke in through the window.","Ogrular penjireden ogrulyk bilen girdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["convict","/kənˈvɪkt/","V","günäli tapmak","осудить","to decide in court that someone is guilty","The court convicted him of fraud.","Kazyýet ony aldawda günäli tapdy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","convict someone of","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fine","/faɪn/","N","jerime","штраф","money paid as a punishment","He paid a 200 manat fine.","200 manat jerime töledi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pay a fine","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pickpocket","/ˈpɪkpɒkɪt/","N","jübi ogrysy","карманник","a thief who steals from pockets","Pickpockets work in busy markets.","Jübi ogrulary köpçülikli bazarlarda işleýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["robbery","/ˈrɒbəri/","N","talaň","ограбление","the crime of stealing from a place","The robbery happened at midnight.","Talaň gije ýarymda boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","armed robbery","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["shoplifter","/ˈʃɒplɪftə(r)/","N","dükan ogrysy","магазинный вор","a person who steals from shops","The shoplifter hid the goods in her coat.","Dükan ogrysy harytlary paltoşynda gizledi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["thief","/θiːf/","N","ogry","вор","a person who steals","The thief ran away with the phone.","Ogry telefon bilen gaçdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["vandal","/ˈvændl/","N","wandal","вандал","a person who damages things on purpose","Vandals broke the bus stop glass.","Wandallar duralganyň aýnasyny döwdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fraud","/frɔːd/","N","aldaw (jenaýat)","мошенничество","the crime of cheating for money","He was jailed for fraud.","Aldaw üçin türmä basyldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["blackmail","/ˈblækmeɪl/","N","gorkuzyp pul almak","шантаж","demanding money by threatening someone","The police stopped the blackmail.","Polisiýa gorkuzyp pul almanyň öňüni aldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["article","/ˈɑːtɪkl/","N","makala","статья","a piece of writing in a newspaper","I read an interesting article.","Gyzykly makala okadym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","front-page article","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["broadcast","/ˈbrɔːdkɑːst/","V","ýaýlyma bermek","транслировать","to send a programme on TV or radio","The match was broadcast live.","Oýun göni ýaýlyma berildi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","broadcast live","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["channel","/ˈtʃænl/","N","teleýaýlym","телеканал","a TV station","Which channel is the news on?","Habar haýsy teleýaýlymda?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","TV channel","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["coverage","/ˈkʌvərɪdʒ/","N","beýan (habarlarda)","освещение (в СМИ)","the reporting of an event","The election got wide coverage.","Saýlaw giň beýan aldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","media coverage","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["current affairs","/ˌkʌrənt əˈfeəz/","N","häzirki wakalar","текущие события","programmes about news and politics","He watches current affairs every night.","Her agşam häzirki wakalar gepleşiklerini görýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["editor","/ˈedɪtə(r)/","N","redaktor","редактор","the person who prepares texts for printing","The editor cut the last paragraph.","Redaktor soňky abzasy aýyrdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["headline","/ˈhedlaɪn/","N","sözbaşy","заголовок","the title of a newspaper story","The headline shocked the readers.","Sözbaşy okyjylary şok etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","front-page headline","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["press","/pres/","N","metbugat","пресса","newspapers and magazines","The story appeared in the press.","Waka metbugatda çykdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","the local press","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["prime time","/ˌpraɪm ˈtaɪm/","N","iň köp tomaşa edilýän wagt","прайм-тайм","the evening hours with most viewers","The show airs at prime time.","Gepleşik iň köp tomaşa edilýän wagtda çykýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","in prime time","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tabloid","/ˈtæblɔɪd/","N","tabloid gazet","газета-таблоид","a newspaper with short sensational stories","The tabloid printed the rumour.","Tabloid gazet gürrüňi çap etdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["newsreader","/ˈnjuːzriːdə(r)/","N","habar alyp baryjy","диктор новостей","the person who reads the news on TV","The newsreader announced the results.","Habar alyp baryjy netijeleri yglan etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["advertisement","/ədˈvɜːtɪsmənt/","N","mahabat","рекламное объявление","a notice that sells a product","I saw the advertisement online.","Mahabady onlaýn gördüm.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","online advertisement","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["brand","/brænd/","N","marka","бренд, марка","a type of product with a name","Which brand of phone do you have?","Haýsy marka telefonyňyz bar?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","famous brand","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["campaign","/kæmˈpeɪn/","N","kampaniýa","кампания","an organised effort to achieve something","The ad campaign lasted three months.","Mahabat kampaniýasy üç aý dowam etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","advertising campaign","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["commercial","/kəˈmɜːʃl/","N","mahabat roligi","рекламный ролик","an advertisement on TV or radio","The commercial was very funny.","Mahabat roligi gaty güldüriji boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","TV commercial","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["competitor","/kəmˈpetɪtə(r)/","N","bäsdeş","конкурент","a company selling similar things","Our biggest competitor lowered prices.","Iň uly bäsdeşimiz bahalary peseltdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["consumer","/kənˈsjuːmə(r)/","N","sarp ediji","потребитель","a person who buys things","Consumers want lower prices.","Sarp edijiler arzan bahalary isleýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","consumer rights","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["logo","/ˈləʊɡəʊ/","N","logotip","логотип","a symbol that shows a company","The logo is a green leaf.","Logotip ýaşyl ýaprak.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["slogan","/ˈsləʊɡən/","N","şygar","слоган","a short phrase used in advertising","Their slogan is catchy.","Şygarlary ýatda galýan.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","company slogan","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["target audience","/ˈtɑːɡɪt ˈɔːdiəns/","N","nyşana tomaşaçylar","целевая аудитория","the people a product is for","The target audience is teenagers.","Nyşana tomaşaçylar ýetginjekler.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["deal","/diːl/","N","ylalaşyk (söwda)","сделка","a business agreement","They signed a big deal.","Uly ylalaşyga gol çekdiler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make a deal","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["expenses","/ɪkˈspensɪz/","N","çykdajylar","расходы","money spent on business costs","The company pays travel expenses.","Kompaniýa ýol çykdajylaryny töleýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","business expenses","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fee","/fiː/","N","töleg (hyzmat)","плата за услугу","money paid for a service","There is a small fee for delivery.","Eltip bermek üçin kiçi töleg bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","pay a fee","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["invoice","/ˈɪnvɔɪs/","N","hasap-faktura","счёт-фактура","a bill for goods or work","Please pay the invoice this week.","Hasap-fakturany şu hepdede töläň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","send an invoice","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["profit","/ˈprɒfɪt/","N","girdeji","прибыль","money left after costs","The shop made a small profit.","Dükan az girdeji gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make a profit","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["supplier","/səˈplaɪə(r)/","N","üpjün ediji","поставщик","a company that provides goods","We changed our supplier in March.","Martda üpjün edijimizi çalyşdyk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bilingual","/ˌbaɪˈlɪŋɡwəl/","ADJ","iki dilli","двуязычный","able to speak two languages","She grew up bilingual.","Iki dilli bolup ulaldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["decode","/ˌdiːˈkəʊd/","V","koduny açmak","дешифровать","to change a code back to normal text","The team decoded the message.","Topar hatyň koduny açdy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["dishonest","/dɪsˈɒnɪst/","ADJ","namart (dogruçyl däl)","нечестный","not telling the truth","He was dishonest about his age.","Ýaşy barada dogruçyl bolmady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["illogical","/ɪˈlɒdʒɪkl/","ADJ","logikasyz","нелогичный","not sensible","His illogical answer confused us.","Logikasyz jogaby bizi bulaşdyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["impossible","/ɪmˈpɒsəbl/","ADJ","mümkin däl","невозможный","cannot be done","The task seemed impossible.","Tabşyryk mümkin däl ýaly boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["irregular","/ɪˈreɡjələ(r)/","ADJ","kadasyz","неправильный, нерегулярный","not following the normal pattern","The verb has an irregular past form.","Işligiň kadasyz öten zaman görnüşi bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","irregular verbs","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["misunderstand","/ˌmɪsʌndəˈstænd/","V","nädogry düşünmek","неправильно понять","to understand something wrongly","I misunderstood the instructions.","Görkezmeleri nädogry düşündim.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","misunderstand someone","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["nonsense","/ˈnɒnsns/","N","manyşyz söz","чепуха","words that make no sense","That story is complete nonsense.","Ol hekaýa düýbünden manyşyz.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","talk nonsense","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["rebuild","/ˌriːˈbɪld/","V","täzeden gurmak","восстанавливать","to build again","They rebuilt the bridge after the flood.","Suw joşmasyndan soň köprini täzeden gurdular.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","rebuild a house","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["submarine","/ˌsʌbməˈriːn/","N","suwasty gämi","подводная лодка","a ship that travels under water","The submarine dived deep.","Suwasty gämi çuňňur çümdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["supernatural","/ˌsuːpəˈnætʃrəl/","ADJ","tebigatdan daşary","сверхъестественный","not explainable by nature","They told supernatural stories.","Tebigatdan daşary hekaýalar gürrüň berdiler.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"},{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["unfair","/ˌʌnˈfeə(r)/","ADJ","adalatsyz","несправедливый","not right or fair","The rules were unfair to beginners.","Düzgünler başlangyçlar üçin adalatsyz boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["unfortunately","/ʌnˈfɔːtʃənətli/","ADV","gynansak-da","к сожалению","used for bad news","Unfortunately, the shop was closed.","Gynansak-da, dükan ýapykdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["unlock","/ˌʌnˈlɒk/","V","gulpy açmak","отпирать","to open a lock","She unlocked the front door.","Öý gapysynyň gulpuny açdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","unlock the door","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["underestimate","/ˌʌndərˈestɪmeɪt/","V","pes görmek","недооценивать","to think something is less than it is","Never underestimate your opponent.","Bäsdeşiňizi hiç wagt pes görmäň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","underestimate someone","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"wordbuilding"},{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["astronomer","/əˈstrɒnəmə(r)/","N","astronom","астроном","a scientist who studies stars","The astronomer found a new planet.","Astronom täze planetany tapdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["experiment","/ɪkˈsperɪmənt/","N","eksperiment","эксперимент","a test to learn something","The experiment proved the theory.","Eksperiment teoriýany subut etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","do an experiment","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["hypothesis","/haɪˈpɒθəsɪs/","N","çaklama","гипотеза","an idea that you test","The data supported the hypothesis.","Maglumatlar çaklamany goldady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","test a hypothesis","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["laboratory","/ləˈbɒrətri/","N","laboratoriýa","лаборатория","a room for scientific work","The laboratory is on the second floor.","Laboratoriýa ikinji gatda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","research laboratory","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["researcher","/rɪˈsɜːtʃə(r)/","N","barlagçy","исследователь","a person who does scientific study","The researchers published their findings.","Barlagçylar netijelerini çap etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["species","/ˈspiːʃiːz/","N","görnüş (janly)","вид (биологический)","a type of animal or plant","This species lives only in deserts.","Bu görnüş diňe çöllerde ýaşaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["telescope","/ˈtelɪskəʊp/","N","teleskop","телескоп","an instrument for seeing far objects","We watched the moon through a telescope.","Aýa teleskop arkaly seretdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["theory","/ˈθɪəri/","N","teoriýa","теория","an idea that explains something","His theory explains the results.","Teoriýasy netijeleri düşündirýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","scientific theory","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["cell","/sel/","N","öýjük","клетка","the smallest unit of a living thing","Every cell contains DNA.","Her öýjükde DNK bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","brain cell","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["data","/ˈdeɪtə/","N","maglumatlar","данные","facts and numbers collected","The data shows a clear trend.","Maglumatlar aýdyň tendensiýany görkezýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","collect data","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"},{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["gravity","/ˈɡrævəti/","N","dartyş güýji","гравитация","the force that pulls things down","Gravity makes apples fall.","Dartyş güýji almalary gaçyrýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["solar","/ˈsəʊlə(r)/","ADJ","gün (energiýasy)","солнечный","using energy from the sun","They installed solar panels.","Gün panellerini oturdylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","solar energy","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["substance","/ˈsʌbstəns/","N","madda","вещество","a type of material","The substance was completely safe.","Madda düýbünden howpsuz boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","toxic substance","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["make a decision","/meɪk ə dɪˈsɪʒn/","PHR","karar bermek","принять решение","to decide something","We made a decision together.","Karary bile berdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["do research","/duː rɪˈsɜːtʃ/","PHR","barlag geçirmek","проводить исследование","to study a subject carefully","She did research on sleep.","Uky barada barlag geçirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["pay attention","/peɪ əˈtenʃn/","PHR","üns bermek","обращать внимание","to listen or watch carefully","Pay attention to the safety rules.","Howpsuzlyk düzgünlerine üns beriň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pay attention to","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["keep a secret","/kiːp ə ˈsiːkrət/","PHR","sir saklamak","хранить секрет","to not tell a secret","She can never keep a secret.","Ol hiç wagt sir saklap bilmeýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["catch a cold","/kætʃ ə kəʊld/","PHR","sowuklamak","простудиться","to become ill with a cold","I caught a cold in winter.","Gyşda sowukladym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["break a record","/breɪk ə ˈrekɔːd/","PHR","rekord goýmak","побить рекорд","to do better than before","He broke a record in the 100 metres.","100 metrde rekord goýdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["give advice","/ɡɪv ədˈvaɪs/","PHR","maslahat bermek","дать совет","to tell someone what to do","My teacher gave me good advice.","Mugallymym maňa gowy maslahat berdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["spend time","/spend taɪm/","PHR","wagt geçirmek","проводить время","to use time doing something","I spend time with my family at weekends.","Hepde ahyrynda maşgalam bilen wagt geçirýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["tell the truth","/tel ðə truːθ/","PHR","hakykaty aýtmak","говорить правду","to say what is true","He always tells the truth.","Ol hemişe hakykaty aýdýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["do your best","/duː jɔː(r) best/","PHR","elinizden geleni etmek","сделать всё возможное","to try as hard as you can","Just do your best in the exam.","Synagda elinizden geleni ediň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["What do you do?","/wɒt du ju duː/","PHR","Näme işleýärsiň?","Кем вы работаете?","used to ask about someone's job","What do you do? — I am a nurse.","Näme işleýärsiň? — Şepagat uýasy.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Do you have any experience?","/du ju hæv ˈeni ɪkˈspɪəriəns/","PHR","Tejribäňiz barmy?","У вас есть опыт?","used to ask about past work","Do you have any experience in sales?","Satuwda tejribäňiz barmy?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["When can you start?","/wen kæn ju stɑːt/","PHR","Haçan başlap bilersiňiz?","Когда вы можете начать?","used to ask about availability","When can you start? — On Monday.","Haçan başlap bilersiňiz? — Duşenbe.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["What are your strengths?","/wɔːr ər jɔː(r) streŋθs/","PHR","Güýçli taraplaryňyz näme?","Каковы ваши сильные стороны?","used to ask about good points","What are your strengths? — Teamwork.","Güýçli taraplaryňyz näme? — Toparlaşyp işlemek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I'm a hard worker.","/aɪm ə hɑːd ˈwɜːkə(r)/","PHR","Zähmetsöýer adam.","Я трудолюбивый человек.","used to praise your own effort","I am a hard worker and a quick learner.","Zähmetsöýer we çalt öwrenýän adam.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Can you send me your CV?","/kæn ju send miː jɔː(r) ˌsiː ˈviː/","PHR","Te terjimehalyňyzy iberip bilersiňizmi?","Можете прислать резюме?","used to ask for a CV","Can you send me your CV by email?","Te terjimehalyňyzy email bilen iberip bilersiňizmi?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["We'll be in touch.","/wil bi ɪn tʌtʃ/","PHR","Habarlaşarys.","Мы с вами свяжемся.","used to promise contact later","Thank you — we will be in touch.","Sag boluň — habarlaşarys.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["What's it about?","/wɒts ɪt əˈbaʊt/","PHR","Näme barada?","О чём она?","used to ask about a story","What is it about? — A family in wartime.","Näme barada? — Uruş wagtyndaky maşgala.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I couldn't put it down.","/aɪ ˈkʊdnt pʊt ɪt daʊn/","PHR","Elimden goýup bilmedim.","Я не мог оторваться.","used to say a book is exciting","It was so good I could not put it down.","Şeýle gowudy, elimden goýup bilmedim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's a real page-turner.","/ɪts ə rɪəl peɪdʒ ˈtɜːnə(r)/","PHR","Hakyky gyzykly kitap.","Это настоящий увлекательный роман.","used to praise a book","The thriller is a real page-turner.","Triller hakyky gyzykly kitap.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Who's the author?","/huːz ði ˈɔːθə(r)/","PHR","Awtory kim?","Кто автор?","used to ask who wrote a book","Who is the author of this novel?","Bu romanyň awtory kim?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I'm halfway through.","/aɪm ˌhɑːfˈweɪ θruː/","PHR","Ýarysyna ýetdim.","Я на середине.","used to say how far you have read","I am halfway through the second book.","Ikinji kitabyň ýarysyna ýetdim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's set in...","/ɪts set ɪn/","PHR","Wakasy ... geçýär","Действие происходит в...","used to say where a story happens","It is set in 1930s Istanbul.","Wakasy 1930-njy ýyllaryň Stambulynda geçýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I'd recommend it.","/aɪd ˌrekəˈmend ɪt/","PHR","Maslahat bererdim.","Я бы рекомендовал.","used to suggest a book","I would recommend it to anyone.","Hemmä maslahat bererdim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It didn't live up to the hype.","/ɪt ˈdɪdnt lɪv ʌp tuː ðə haɪp/","PHR","Mahabatyna ýetmedi.","Не оправдал ожиданий.","used to say a book disappointed","Honestly, it did not live up to the hype.","Dogrusy, mahabatyna ýetmedi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["That's a waste of time.","/ðæts ə weɪst əv taɪm/","PHR","Wagtyň isribi.","Это пустая трата времени.","used to say something is useless","Waiting in that queue is a waste of time.","Şol nobatda durmak wagtyň isribi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Don't throw it away.","/dəʊnt θrəʊ ɪt əˈweɪ/","PHR","Ony zyňma.","Не выбрасывай это.","used to tell someone to keep something","Do not throw it away — fix it.","Ony zyňma — bejer.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["You could recycle it.","/ju kʊd ˌriːˈsaɪkl ɪt/","PHR","Gaýtadan işledip bilersiň.","Можно сдать в переработку.","used to suggest reusing waste","You could recycle it instead.","Munuň ýerine gaýtadan işledip bilersiň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's still in good condition.","/ɪts stɪl ɪn ɡʊd kənˈdɪʃn/","PHR","Entek gowy ýagdaýda.","Он ещё в хорошем состоянии.","used to say something still works","The bike is still in good condition.","Welosiped entek gowy ýagdaýda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Why don't you sell it?","/waɪ dəʊnt ju sel ɪt/","PHR","Ony satmasaň?","Почему бы не продать?","used to suggest selling","Why don't you sell it online?","Ony onlaýn satmasaň?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I never use it.","/aɪ ˈnevə juːz ɪt/","PHR","Ony hiç ulananok.","Я им никогда не пользуюсь.","used to explain why you keep something","I never use it, but I cannot throw it away.","Hiç ulananok, ýöne zyňyp bilemok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's gone to waste.","/ɪts ɡɒn tu weɪst/","PHR","Isrip boldy.","Это пропало зря.","used to say something was not used","All that food has gone to waste.","Şol naharyň hemmesi isrip boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Let's clear out the attic.","/lets klɪər aʊt ði ˈætɪk/","PHR","Geliň, ýerligi arassalalyň.","Давай разберём чердак.","used to suggest tidying a space","Let us clear out the attic this weekend.","Geliň, şu hepde ahyry ýerligi arassalalyň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["How was the show?","/haʊ wɒz ðə ʃəʊ/","PHR","Tomaşa nädip boldy?","Как прошло шоу?","used to ask about a performance","How was the show? — Brilliant!","Tomaşa nädip boldy? — Ajaýyp!","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["The acting was brilliant.","/ði ˈæktɪŋ wɒz ˈbrɪliənt/","PHR","Aktýorlyk ajaýyp boldy.","Игра актёров была великолепна.","used to praise the actors","The acting was brilliant from start to finish.","Aktýorlyk başdan ahyryna ajaýyp boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I was on the edge of my seat.","/aɪ wɒz ɒn ði edʒ əv maɪ siːt/","PHR","Ynjalyksyzlyk bilen tomaşa etdim.","Я был на краю кресла (в напряжении).","used to say a show was exciting","The final act — I was on the edge of my seat.","Soňky perde — ynjalyksyzlyk bilen tomaşa etdim.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It was a sell-out.","/ɪt wɒz ə sel aʊt/","PHR","Biletler gutardy.","Билеты были полностью распроданы.","used to say every seat was sold","The first night was a sell-out.","Ilkinji agşam biletler gutardy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["The plot was hard to follow.","/ðə plɒt wɒz hɑːd tuː ˈfɒləʊ/","PHR","Wakasy kyn düşündi.","Сюжет было трудно понять.","used to criticise a story","The plot was hard to follow at first.","Wakasy başda kyn düşündi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's on again tonight.","/ɪts ɒn əˈɡen təˈnaɪt/","PHR","Şu agşam ýene bar.","Сегодня снова идёт.","used to say a show repeats","The play is on again tonight at eight.","Oýun şu agşam sekizde ýene bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["They got a standing ovation.","/ðeɪ ɡɒt ə ˈstændɪŋ əʊˈveɪʃn/","PHR","Aýaga galyp el çarpyldy.","Им устроили овацию стоя.","used to describe strong applause","The dancers got a standing ovation.","Tansçylara aýaga galyp el çarpyldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I couldn't hear a word.","/aɪ ˈkʊdnt hɪər ə wɜːd/","PHR","Hiç zat eşitmedim.","Я не слышал ни слова.","used to complain about sound","The music was so loud I could not hear a word.","Saz şeýle güýçlidi, hiç zat eşitmedim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I saw this ad everywhere.","/aɪ sɔː ðɪs æd ˈevriweə(r)/","PHR","Bu mahabady her ýerde gördüm.","Я видел эту рекламу везде.","used to talk about an advertisement","I saw this ad everywhere last month.","Geçen aý bu mahabady her ýerde gördüm.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's a catchy slogan.","/ɪts ə ˈkætʃi ˈsləʊɡən/","PHR","Ýatda galýan şygar.","Это запоминающийся слоган.","used to praise an ad line","Their new slogan is really catchy.","Täze şygarlary hakykatdan ýatda galýan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["Does it live up to its promises?","/dʌz ɪt lɪv ʌp tuː ɪts ˈprɒmɪsɪz/","PHR","Wadalaryna ýetýärmi?","Оно оправдывает обещания?","used to question a claim","The product looks good, but does it live up to its promises?","Haryt gowy görünýär, ýöne wadalaryna ýetýärmi?","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I'm not convinced.","/aɪm nɒt kənˈvɪnst/","PHR","Ynanamok.","Я не убеждён.","used to express doubt","Interesting claims, but I am not convinced.","Gyzykly tassyklamalar, ýöne ynanamok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It's just a gimmick.","/ɪts dʒʌst ə ˈɡɪmɪk/","PHR","Bu diňe hiyle.","Это просто уловка.","used to call something a trick","The free gift is just a gimmick.","Mugt sowgat diňe hiyle.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["word of mouth","/wɜːd əv maʊθ/","PHR","agyzdan-agza","из уст в уста","people telling other people","The shop grew through word of mouth.","Dükan agyzdan-agza ulaldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","spread by word of mouth","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It went viral.","/ɪt went ˈvaɪrəl/","PHR","Internetde ýaýrady.","Это стало вирусным.","used when something spreads online fast","The video went viral overnight.","Wideo bir gijede internetde ýaýrady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["buy one get one free","/baɪ wʌn ɡet wʌn friː/","PHR","birini al, birini mugt al","купи один — второй бесплатно","a common sales offer","The biscuits are buy one get one free.","Kökeler birini al, birini mugt al.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"upp","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["cruel","/ˈkruːəl/","ADJ","rehimsiz","жестокий","causing pain without pity","It was cruel to laugh at him.","Oňa gülmek rehimsiz boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gentle","/ˈdʒentl/","ADJ","mulýum","нежный, мягкий","kind and careful","Be gentle with the kitten.","Pişik çagasyna mulýum bol.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["moody","/ˈmuːdi/","ADJ","keýpi üýtgeýän","с переменчивым настроением","often changing moods","Teenagers can be moody.","Ýetginjekleriň keýpi üýtgäp durýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["optimistic","/ˌɒptɪˈmɪstɪk/","ADJ","oňyn pikirlenýän","оптимистичный","expecting good things","She is optimistic about the future.","Geljege oňyn garaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","optimistic about","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["outgoing","/ˈaʊtɡəʊɪŋ/","ADJ","açyk (jemgyýetçil)","общительный, открытый","friendly and sociable","His outgoing manner wins people over.","Açyk häsiýeti adamlary özüne çekýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pessimistic","/ˌpesɪˈmɪstɪk/","ADJ","ýaramaz pikirlenýän","пессимистичный","expecting bad things","Do not be so pessimistic!","Beýle ýaramaz pikirlenme!","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["vain","/veɪn/","ADJ","özüni göterýän","тщеславный","too proud of your appearance","The vain actor admired his photo.","Özüni göterýän aktýor suratyna syn etdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wise","/waɪz/","ADJ","paýhasly (dana)","мудрый","having deep understanding","My grandmother gave me wise advice.","Mamam paýhasly maslahat berdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ambition","/æmˈbɪʃn/","N","maksat (öňe saýlanma)","амбиция, стремление","a strong wish to achieve something","Her ambition is to become a doctor.","Maksady lukman bolmak.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","career ambition","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["job satisfaction","/dʒɒb ˌsætɪsˈfækʃn/","N","işden kanagatlanma","удовлетворение работой","the pleasure you get from your job","Job satisfaction matters more than pay.","Işden kanagatlanma aýlykdan möhüm.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["profession","/prəˈfeʃn/","N","hünär (kär)","профессия","a job needing special training","Teaching is a noble profession.","Mugallymçylyk asylly hünär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["promotion","/prəˈməʊʃn/","N","wezipe galmak","повышение (в должности)","moving to a higher job level","She got a promotion last year.","Geçen ýyl wezipesi galdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get a promotion","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["qualified","/ˈkwɒlɪfaɪd/","ADJ","hünärli","квалифицированный","having the right training for a job","We need a qualified electrician.","Hünärli elektrik gerek.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","highly qualified","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["unemployment","/ˌʌnɪmˈplɔɪmənt/","N","işsizlik","безработица","the state of having no job","Unemployment fell this year.","Işsizlik şu ýyl azaldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","unemployment rate","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["workaholic","/ˌwɜːkəˈhɒlɪk/","N","işbaz","трудоголик","a person who works too much","The workaholic never takes holidays.","Işbaz hiç wagt dynç almaga gitmeýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["workforce","/ˈwɜːkfɔːs/","N","işçi güýji","рабочая сила","all the workers of a company","The workforce grew by ten per cent.","Işçi güýji on göterim artdy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["anger","/ˈæŋɡə(r)/","N","gahar","гнев","a strong feeling of displeasure","He spoke with anger in his voice.","Sesinde gahar bilen gürledi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","feel anger","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["anxiety","/æŋˈzaɪəti/","N","alada (ynjalyksyzlyk)","тревога","a feeling of worry","Exams cause anxiety for students.","Synaglar talyplarda alada döredýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","feel anxiety","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["courage","/ˈkʌrɪdʒ/","N","edermenlik","мужество","the ability to face danger","The firefighter showed great courage.","Ýangyn söndüriji uly edermenlik görkezdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","have the courage","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["curiosity","/ˌkjʊəriˈɒsəti/","N","interik","любопытство","a wish to know things","Her curiosity never stops.","Interigi hiç wagt gutaranok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","out of curiosity","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["enthusiasm","/ɪnˈθjuːziæzəm/","N","yhläs","энтузиазм","a feeling of great interest","She talked with real enthusiasm.","Hakyky yhläs bilen gürrüň berdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","show enthusiasm","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["friendship","/ˈfrendʃɪp/","N","dostluk","дружба","the relationship between friends","Their friendship lasted forty years.","Dostlugy kyrk ýyl dowam etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["happiness","/ˈhæpinəs/","N","bagt","счастье","the feeling of being happy","Money does not always bring happiness.","Pul hemişe bagt getirmeýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["honesty","/ˈɒnəsti/","N","dogruçyllyk","честность","the quality of telling the truth","I appreciate your honesty.","Dogruçyllygyňa baha berýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["intelligence","/ɪnˈtelɪdʒəns/","N","zeka","интеллект","the ability to learn and understand","The puzzle tested my intelligence.","Tapmaça zekamy synady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["kindness","/ˈkaɪndnəs/","N","mähirlilik","доброта","the quality of being kind","Thank you for your kindness.","Mähirliligiňiz üçin sag boluň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["loneliness","/ˈləʊnlinəs/","N","ýalňyzlyk","одиночество","sadness from being alone","Loneliness affects many old people.","Ýalňyzlyk köp garrylara täsir edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["patience","/ˈpeɪʃns/","N","sabyr","терпение","the ability to wait calmly","Teaching requires great patience.","Mugallymçylyk uly sabyr talap edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","lose patience","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["pride","/praɪd/","N","buýsanç","гордость","a feeling of pleasure in yourself","She spoke with pride about her son.","Ogly barada buýsanç bilen gürledi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take pride in","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["wealth","/welθ/","N","baýlyk","богатство","a large amount of money","He shared his wealth with others.","Baýlygyny beýlekiler bilen paýlaşdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["acquaintance","/əˈkweɪntəns/","N","tanyş","знакомый","a person you know a little","He is an acquaintance, not a friend.","Ol dost däl, tanyş.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bond","/bɒnd/","N","baglanyşyk (duýgy)","связь, узы","a strong feeling between people","The twins have a special bond.","Ekizleriň aýratyn baglanyşygy bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","emotional bond","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["companion","/kəmˈpæniən/","N","ýoldaş (hemra)","спутник, компаньон","a person you spend time with","The dog was her faithful companion.","It onuň wepaly ýoldaşy boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["engagement","/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒmənt/","N","atlanysyklar","помолвка","an agreement to marry","They announced their engagement.","Atlanyşyklaryny yglan etdiler.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["mate","/meɪt/","N","dost (ýoldaş)","приятель","a friend (informal)","He went fishing with his mates.","Dostlary bilen balyk tutmaga gitdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["relatives","/ˈrelətɪvz/","N","garyndaşlar","родственники","members of your family","All our relatives came to the wedding.","Ähli garyndaşlarymyz toýa geldi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["sibling","/ˈsɪblɪŋ/","N","dogan (aga-ini/uýa)","брат или сестра","a brother or sister","Do you have any siblings?","Doganyňyz barmy?","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["spouse","/spaʊs/","N","ýanýoldaş","супруг(а)","a husband or wife","You may bring your spouse to the dinner.","Agşamlyk nahara ýanýoldaşyňyzy alyp gelip bilersiňiz.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["generation gap","/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn ɡæp/","N","nesil tapawudy","разрыв поколений","differences between old and young","Music often shows the generation gap.","Saz köplenç nesil tapawudyny görkezýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["get away with","/ɡet əˈweɪ wɪð/","PHR","jezasyz gutulmak","сходить с рук","to do something wrong without punishment","He never gets away with lies.","Ýalany hiç wagt jezasyz galmaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get down to","/ɡet daʊn tuː/","PHR","başlamak (çynlakaý)","браться за","to start doing something seriously","Let us get down to work.","Geliň, işe girişeliň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get down to business","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get over","/ɡet ˈəʊvə(r)/","PHR","gutulmak (keselden)","оправиться от","to recover from something bad","She finally got over the flu.","Ahyry dümewden gutuldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get over an illness","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get together","/ɡet təˈɡeðə(r)/","PHR","ýygnanmak","собираться вместе","to meet and spend time","We get together every Sunday.","Her ýekşenbe ýygnanýarys.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get used to","/ɡet ˈjuːzd tuː/","PHR","öwrenişmek","привыкать","to become familiar with something","I got used to the cold weather.","Sowuk howa öwrenişdim.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get used to doing","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get away","/ɡet əˈweɪ/","PHR","gaçyp gutulmak","сбежать, вырваться","to escape, or go on holiday","The thieves got away in a car.","Ogrular maşyn bilen gaçyp gutuldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["get round to","/ɡet ˈraʊnd tuː/","PHR","wagt tapyp etmek","собираться сделать","to finally do something delayed","I never got round to calling him.","Oňa jaň etmäge wagt tapmadym.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["battlefield","/ˈbætlfiːld/","N","söweş meýdany","поле боя","a place where a battle happens","The battlefield is now a museum.","Söweş meýdany indi muzeý.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["casualty","/ˈkæʒuəlti/","N","pidalar (ýitgiler)","жертвы, потери","a person killed or injured in war","The battle caused many casualties.","Söweş köp pidalara sebäp boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["civilian","/səˈvɪliən/","N","asuda ilat","мирный житель","a person not in the army","The war harmed many civilians.","Uruş köp asuda ilata zyýan ýetirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["defeat","/dɪˈfiːt/","V","ýeňmek","побеждать (в войне)","to win against an enemy","The army defeated the invaders.","Goşun basyp alýjylary ýeňdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["defend","/dɪˈfend/","V","goramak","защищать","to protect from attack","The soldiers defended the city.","Esgirler şäheri gorady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","defend against","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["enemy","/ˈenəmi/","N","duşman","враг","a person or country you fight","The enemy attacked at dawn.","Duşman dan atacasy hüjüm etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["invade","/ɪnˈveɪd/","V","basyp almak","вторгаться","to enter a country by force","The invaders crossed the border.","Basyp alýjylar serhetden geçdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["rescue","/ˈreskjuː/","V","halas etmek","спасать","to save someone from danger","Firefighters rescued the family.","Ýangyn söndürijiler maşgalany halas etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","rescue someone","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["siege","/siːdʒ/","N","gabaw","осада","surrounding a place to force surrender","The siege lasted three months.","Gabaw üç aý dowam etdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","under siege","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["surrender","/səˈrendə(r)/","V","boýun egmek","сдаваться","to stop fighting and admit defeat","The troops were forced to surrender.","Goşun boýun egmäge mejbur boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["victim","/ˈvɪktɪm/","N","pida","жертва","a person harmed by something","The victims received help quickly.","Pidalar kömegi tiz aldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","victim of","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["weapon","/ˈwepən/","N","ýarag","оружие","an object used for fighting","The museum displays old weapons.","Muzeý köne ýaraglary görkezýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","carry a weapon","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bestseller","/ˌbestˈselə(r)/","N","iň köp satylýan kitap","бестселлер","a book that sells in huge numbers","Her novel became a bestseller.","Romany iň köp satylýan kitap boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["blockbuster","/ˈblɒkbʌstə(r)/","N","uly üstünlikli film","блокбастер","a very successful film","The blockbuster earned millions.","Uly üstünlikli film millionlar gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["cliffhanger","/ˈklɪfhæŋə(r)/","N","yzy gyzykly gutarýan","захватывающая концовка","an ending that leaves you wanting more","The series ended on a cliffhanger.","Serial yzy gyzykly gutardy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["gripping","/ˈɡrɪpɪŋ/","ADJ","özüne bend edýän","захватывающий","so exciting you cannot stop","It was a gripping thriller.","Özüne bend edýän triller boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["masterpiece","/ˈmɑːstəpiːs/","N","şedewr","шедевр","an excellent work of art","The painting is a true masterpiece.","Surat hakyky şedewr.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["moving","/ˈmuːvɪŋ/","ADJ","täsirli (duýgur)","трогательный","making you feel strong emotions","The ending was deeply moving.","Soňy örän täsirli boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["twist","/twɪst/","N","garaşylmadyk öwrüm","неожиданный поворот","a surprising change in a story","The final twist shocked everyone.","Soňky öwrüm hemmäni şok etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","plot twist","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["accent","/ˈæksent/","N","talaffuz (şiwä)","акцент","a way of speaking from a region","She has a beautiful accent.","Owadan talaffuzy bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","foreign accent","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["echo","/ˈekəʊ/","N","ýaň","эхо","a sound that comes back","Our voices made an echo.","Seslerimiz ýaň etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hoarse","/hɔːs/","ADJ","ýogyn (sesi ýatyk)","охрипший","with a rough voice","He was hoarse after shouting.","Gygyrandan soň sesi ýatyk boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mumble","/ˈmʌmbl/","V","pyşyrdamak (aňsat eşitmezlik)","бормотать","to speak unclearly and quietly","He mumbled an apology.","Ötünç sorap pyşyrdady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mutter","/ˈmʌtə(r)/","V","zöldürdemek","ворчать себе под нос","to complain quietly under the breath","She muttered about the price.","Baha barada zöldürdedi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sigh","/saɪ/","V","ah çekmek","вздыхать","to breathe out slowly with feeling","She sighed with relief.","Ýeňillik bilen ah çekdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["squeak","/skwiːk/","V","çyrlamak (ýuka ses)","пищать","to make a short high sound","The mouse squeaked in the trap.","Syçan duzakda çyrlady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["whisper","/ˈwɪspə(r)/","V","pyşyrdamak","шептать","to speak very quietly","She whispered the answer.","Jogaby pyşyrdady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","whisper to","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ahead of time","/əˈhed əv taɪm/","PHR","öňünden","заранее","earlier than planned","We finished ahead of time.","Öňünden gutardy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["behind schedule","/bɪˈhaɪnd ˈʃedjuːl/","PHR","meýilnamadan yza galan","с опозданием от графика","later than planned","The project is two weeks behind schedule.","Taslama iki hepde yza galdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["for the time being","/fə ðə taɪm ˈbiːɪŋ/","PHR","häzirlikçe","на данный момент","for now, but not for ever","Stay here for the time being.","Häzirlikçe şu ýerde gal.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["in advance","/ɪn ədˈvɑːns/","PHR","öňünden (öňünden tölemek)","заблаговременно","before something happens","Book the tickets in advance.","Biletleri öňünden bronla.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pay in advance","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["in no time","/ɪn nəʊ taɪm/","PHR","göz açyp ýumasy salymda","в мгновение ока","very quickly","Dinner will be ready in no time.","Agşamlyk göz açyp ýumasy salymda taýyn bolar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["time after time","/taɪm ˈɑːftə taɪm/","PHR","gaýta-gaýta","раз за разом","again and again","He has warned you time after time.","Saňa gaýta-gaýta duýdurdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["from time to time","/frɒm taɪm tuː taɪm/","PHR","wagtal-wagtal","время от времени","sometimes, not often","We visit them from time to time.","Wagtal-wagtal olara baryp görýäris.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["kill time","/kɪl taɪm/","PHR","wagt öldürmek","коротать время","to do something while waiting","We killed time at the airport.","Howa menzilinde wagt öldürdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bankrupt","/ˈbæŋkrʌpt/","ADJ","müflüs","банкрот","unable to pay your debts","The company went bankrupt last year.","Kompaniýa geçen ýyl müflüs boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","go bankrupt","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["currency","/ˈkʌrənsi/","N","walýuta","валюта","the money used in a country","The local currency is the manat.","Ýerli walýuta manat.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","foreign currency","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fortune","/ˈfɔːtʃuːn/","N","uly baýlyk","состояние, состояние денег","a very large amount of money","The car cost a fortune.","Maşyn uly baýlyga durdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","cost a fortune","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["income","/ˈɪnkʌm/","N","girdeji (aýlyk)","доход","money received regularly","Their income covers all expenses.","Girdejileri ähli çykdajylary örtýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","monthly income","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"},{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["instalment","/ɪnˈstɔːlmənt/","N","bölekleýin töleg","взнос, рассрочка","one part of a total payment","We pay the loan in monthly instalments.","Karzy aýlyk bölekleýin töleýäris.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","pay in instalments","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pension","/ˈpenʃn/","N","pensiýa (pul)","пенсия","money paid after retirement","Her pension is paid monthly.","Pensiýasy aýlyk tölenýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","state pension","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cheque","/tʃek/","N","çek","чек","a paper order to a bank to pay","He paid the rent by cheque.","Kärendäni çek bilen töledi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pay by cheque","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["absent-minded","/ˌæbsnt ˈmaɪndɪd/","ADJ","ünsüz (huşsuz)","рассеянный","often forgetting things","The absent-minded professor lost his keys.","Ünsüz professor açarlaryny ýitirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["broad-minded","/ˌbrɔːd ˈmaɪndɪd/","ADJ","giň pikirli","широко мыслящий","accepting different opinions","Her broad-minded parents welcomed everyone.","Giň pikirli ene-atasy hemmäni garşylady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["deep-fried","/ˌdiːp ˈfraɪd/","ADJ","ýagda gowrulan","жаренный во фритюре","cooked in deep hot oil","Deep-fried food is not healthy.","Ýagda gowrulan nahar peýdaly däl.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["first-class","/ˌfɜːst ˈklɑːs/","ADJ","birinji derejeli","первоклассный","of the best quality","We travelled first-class to London.","Londona birinji derejeli gatnadyk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ill-mannered","/ˌɪl ˈmænəd/","ADJ","edebsiz","невоспитанный","having bad manners","The ill-mannered guest interrupted everyone.","Edebsiz myhman hemmäniň sözünü kesdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["short-sighted","/ˌʃɔːt ˈsaɪtɪd/","ADJ","uzagy görmeyän","близорукий; недальновидный","unable to see far, or not planning ahead","It was a short-sighted decision.","Uzagy görmeyän karar boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["well-behaved","/ˌwel bɪˈheɪvd/","ADJ","edeply","воспитанный (о поведении)","behaving politely","The well-behaved children sat quietly.","Edepli çagalar sessiz otyrdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["well-dressed","/ˌwel ˈdrest/","ADJ","oňat geýnen","хорошо одетый","wearing nice clothes","The well-dressed guests arrived at eight.","Oňat geýnen myhmanlar sekizde geldi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["well-off","/ˌwel ˈɒf/","ADJ","halatly (baý)","состоятельный","having plenty of money","Her well-off family helped with the fees.","Halatly maşgalasy töleglere kömek etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["time-consuming","/ˌtaɪm kənˈsjuːmɪŋ/","ADJ","wagt talap edýän","трудоёмкий","taking a lot of time","Sorting photos is time-consuming.","Suratlary tertiplemek wagt talap edýän iş.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["mouth-watering","/ˌmaʊθ ˈwɔːtərɪŋ/","ADJ","agyz suwardyjy","аппетитный","looking or smelling delicious","The cake looked mouth-watering.","Tort agyz suwardyjy görünýärdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["backup","/ˈbækʌp/","N","ätiýaç nusga","резервная копия","a copy of data kept safe","Always make a backup of your files.","Faýllaryňyzyň ätiýaç nusgasyny hemişe ediň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make a backup","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["browser","/ˈbraʊzə(r)/","N","brauzer","браузер","a program for using the internet","Open the browser and type the address.","Brauzeri açyň we salgyny ýazyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","web browser","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["crash","/kræʃ/","V","işlemez bolmak","зависать, падать (о программе)","to stop working suddenly","My computer crashed twice today.","Kompýuterim şu gün iki gezek işlemez boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["gadget","/ˈɡædʒɪt/","N","enjamjagaz (gajet)","гаджет","a small clever device","He loves the latest gadgets.","Iň täze gajetleri gowy görýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","electronic gadget","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["glitch","/ɡlɪtʃ/","N","kiçi näsazlyk","мелкий сбой","a small technical problem","A glitch delayed the update.","Kiçi näsazlyk täzelenmäni giçikdirdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["network","/ˈnetwɜːk/","N","tor","сеть","a system of connected computers","The network is down again.","Tor ýene işlemeýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","mobile network","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["notification","/ˌnəʊtɪfɪˈkeɪʃn/","N","habarnama","уведомление","a message telling you something","Turn off the notifications.","Habarnamalary öçür.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","push notification","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["password","/ˈpɑːswɜːd/","N","açarsöz","пароль","a secret word to enter a system","Never share your password.","Açarsözüňizi hiç wagt paýlaşmaň.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","change your password","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["software","/ˈsɒftweə(r)/","N","programma üpjünçiligi","программное обеспечение","programs that run on computers","The software needs an update.","Programma üpjünçiligi täzelenmeli.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","install software","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["spam","/spæm/","N","islenmeýän hatlar","спам","unwanted email messages","My inbox is full of spam.","Poçta gutym islenmeýän hatlardan doly.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","spam email","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["update","/ˈʌpdeɪt/","V","täzelemek","обновлять","to make software newer","Update the app before the trip.","Syýahatdan öň programmany täzeläň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","software update","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["virus","/ˈvaɪrəs/","N","wirus","вирус (компьютерный)","a program that damages computers","A virus deleted all my files.","Wirus ähli faýllarymy pozdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","computer virus","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["antisocial","/ˌæntiˈsəʊʃl/","ADJ","jemgyýete garşy","антисоциальный","avoiding other people","Staying home every night seems antisocial.","Her agşam öýde galmak jemgyýete garşy görünýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["co-founder","/ˌkəʊ ˈfaʊndə(r)/","N","bilelikde esaslandyryjy","сооснователь","a person who starts a company with others","She is the co-founder of the app.","Programmanyň bilelikde esaslandyryjysy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["counter-attack","/ˌkaʊntər əˈtæk/","N","jogap hüjümi","контратака","an attack in reply to another","The team scored on a counter-attack.","Topar jogap hüjüminde utuk gazandy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["devalue","/ˌdiːˈvæljuː/","V","bahasyny gaçyrmak","обесценивать","to reduce the value of something","The currency was devalued.","Walýutanyň bahasy gaçyryldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["extraordinary","/ɪkˈstrɔːdnri/","ADJ","adatdan daşary","необычайный","very unusual and impressive","She has an extraordinary memory.","Adatdan daşary ýady bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["forearm","/ˈfɔːrɑːm/","N","baldyr (el)","предплечье","the part of the arm below the elbow","He tattooed his forearm.","Eliniň baldyryna nakgaş etdirdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["international","/ˌɪntəˈnæʃnəl/","ADJ","halkara","международный","involving several countries","The airport handles international flights.","Howa menzili halkara uçuşlary kabul edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["multimedia","/ˌmʌltiˈmiːdiə/","N","multimedia","мультимедиа","using sound, video and text together","The lesson used multimedia tools.","Sapak multimedia gurallaryny ulandy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["nonstop","/ˌnɒnˈstɒp/","ADV","tohtamanzyn (fasylasysyz)","безостановочно","without stopping","We flew nonstop to Ashgabat.","Aşgabada tohtamanzyn uçduk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["preview","/ˈpriːvjuː/","N","öňünden görkezme","предварительный просмотр","an early look at something","We saw a preview of the film.","Filmiň öňünden görkezmesini gördük.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","sneak preview","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["semicircle","/ˈsemisɜːkl/","N","ýarym tegelek","полукруг","half of a circle","The chairs stood in a semicircle.","Stullar ýarym tegelek bolup durdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["transfer","/trænsˈfɜː(r)/","V","geçirmek","переводить, перемещать","to move from one place to another","He transferred to another department.","Başga bölüme geçdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","transfer money","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["upgrade","/ˈʌpɡreɪd/","V","gowulandyrmak (täzelemek)","модернизировать","to improve to a better version","They upgraded our hotel room.","Myhmanhana otagymyzy gowulandyrdylar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","upgrade to","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["artwork","/ˈɑːtwɜːk/","N","sungat eseri","произведение искусства","a painting or drawing","The gallery displays modern artwork.","Galereýa häzirki zaman sungat eserlerini görkezýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["canvas","/ˈkænvəs/","N","kanwas","холст","cloth that paintings are done on","The artist painted on a huge canvas.","Suratkeş ägirt kanwasda surat çekdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["contemporary","/kənˈtemprəri/","ADJ","häzirki zaman","современный","belonging to the present time","She collects contemporary art.","Häzirki zaman sungatyny ýygnaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","contemporary art","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["exhibition","/ˌeksɪˈbɪʃn/","N","sergi","выставка","a public show of art","The exhibition opens on Friday.","Sergi anna güni açylýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","visit an exhibition","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["landscape","/ˈlændskeɪp/","N","tebigat görnüşi","пейзаж","a picture of countryside","He painted a mountain landscape.","Dag görnüşini surat çekdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["portrait","/ˈpɔːtrət/","N","portret","портрет","a picture of a person","The portrait hangs in the hall.","Portret zalyň diwarynda asylgy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","paint a portrait","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["sculpture","/ˈskʌlptʃə(r)/","N","heýkel","скульптура","a statue or carved art","The sculpture stands in the park.","Heýkel parkyň içinde dur.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["sketch","/sketʃ/","N","çyzgy (garalama)","набросок, эскиз","a quick simple drawing","She made a sketch of the old man.","Garry adamyň çyzgysyny etdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make a sketch","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["still life","/ˌstɪl ˈlaɪf/","N","natýurmort","натюрморт","a painting of objects like fruit","The still life shows apples and grapes.","Natýurmortda alma we üzüm görkezilýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["out of the blue","/aʊt əv ðə bluː/","PHR","duýdansyz","как гром среди ясного неба","suddenly and unexpectedly","She called me out of the blue.","Duýdansyz maňa jaň etdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["red tape","/ˌred ˈteɪp/","N","kagyzbazlyk","бюрократия, волокита","too many official rules","Red tape delayed the project.","Kagyzbazlyk taslamany giçikdirdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["white lie","/ˌwaɪt ˈlaɪ/","N","ýumşak ýalan","невинная ложь","a small lie that does not hurt","It was just a white lie.","Diňe ýumşak ýalan boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","tell a white lie","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["antibiotic","/ˌæntibaɪˈɒtɪk/","N","antibiotik","антибиотик","medicine that kills bacteria","The doctor prescribed an antibiotic.","Lukman antibiotik ýazdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","take antibiotics","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["check-up","/ˈtʃek ʌp/","N","lukmançylyk barlagy","медосмотр","a general medical examination","I have a check-up next week.","Indiki hepde lukmançylyk barlagym bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","medical check-up","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["cure","/kjʊə(r)/","N","bejergi (emel)","лекарство, средство","a treatment that ends an illness","There is no cure yet.","Entek emel ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","find a cure","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["diagnosis","/ˌdaɪəɡˈnəʊsɪs/","N","kesel anyklama","диагноз","a doctor's judgement of an illness","The diagnosis was made quickly.","Diaгноз tiz goýuldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","make a diagnosis","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["GP","/ˌdʒiː ˈpiː/","N","maşgala lukmany","врач общей практики","a general practice doctor","Make an appointment with the GP.","Maşgala lukmanyna ýazylyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","go to the GP","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["injection","/ɪnˈdʒekʃn/","N","ukol (sanjym)","укол, инъекция","medicine given with a needle","The injection did not hurt.","Ukol agyrmady.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","give an injection","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["operation","/ˌɒpəˈreɪʃn/","N","operasiýa","операция","a medical procedure inside the body","She had an operation on her heart.","Ýüregine operasiýa etdirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","have an operation","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["remedy","/ˈremədi/","N","emel (halk bejergisi)","средство (от болезни)","something that cures a problem","Honey is a good remedy for coughs.","Bal üsgülewüğe gowy emel.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","home remedy","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["side effect","/ˌsaɪd ɪˈfekt/","N","gapdal täsiri","побочный эффект","an unwanted effect of medicine","The pill has no side effects.","Dermanyň gapdal täsiri ýok.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["surgeon","/ˈsɜːdʒən/","N","hirurg","хирург","a doctor who does operations","The surgeon explained the risks.","Hirurg howplary düşündirdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["treatment","/ˈtriːtmənt/","N","bejergi","лечение","care given for an illness","The treatment worked well.","Bejergi gowy netije berdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","medical treatment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["vaccination","/ˌvæksɪˈneɪʃn/","N","waksina (sanjym)","вакцинация","an injection that prevents disease","The vaccination protects children.","Waksina çagalary goraýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","get a vaccination","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["attraction","/əˈtrækʃn/","N","görmeli ýer","достопримечательность","a place tourists visit","The old city is the main attraction.","Köne şäher esasy görmeli ýer.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","tourist attraction","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["backpacker","/ˈbækpækə(r)/","N","ýeňil sumkaly syýahatçy","бэкпекер","a traveller with a big bag","Backpackers prefer cheap hostels.","Ýeňil sumkaly syýahatçylar arzan ýatakhanalary gowy görýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["brochure","/ˈbrəʊʃə(r)/","N","buklet","брошюра","a small book of travel information","The brochure lists all the hotels.","Buklet ähli myhmanhanalary sanlaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","travel brochure","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["destination","/ˌdestɪˈneɪʃn/","N","barmaly ýer","пункт назначения","the place you travel to","Paris is a popular destination.","Parij meşhur barmaly ýer.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","tourist destination","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["excursion","/ɪkˈskɜːʃn/","N","ekskursiýa","экскурсия","a short organised trip","We went on a boat excursion.","Gaýyk ekskursiýasyna gitdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","go on an excursion","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["itinerary","/aɪˈtɪnərəri/","N","syýahat meýilnamasy","маршрут","a plan of a journey","The itinerary includes three cities.","Syýahat meýilnamasy üç şäheri öz içine alýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","plan an itinerary","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["resort","/rɪˈzɔːt/","N","dynç alyş ýeri","курорт","a place for holidays","Awaza is a seaside resort.","Awaza deňiz kenaryndaky dynç alyş ýeri.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","beach resort","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["travel agent","/ˈtrævl eɪdʒənt/","N","syýahat agenti","турагент","a person who arranges trips","The travel agent found us a deal.","Syýahat agenti bize arzan tapdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["holidaymaker","/ˈhɒlədeɪmeɪkə(r)/","N","dynç alyşçy","отпускник","a person on holiday","The beach was crowded with holidaymakers.","Kenar dynç alyşçylardan doly boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["animal rights","/ˌænɪml ˈraɪts/","N","haýwan hukuklary","права животных","the idea that animals deserve care","She campaigns for animal rights.","Haýwan hukuklary üçin kampaniýa alyp barýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cage","/keɪdʒ/","N","gapas","клетка","a box with bars for animals","The parrot escaped from its cage.","Tötüji gapasdan gaçdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in a cage","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["cruelty","/ˈkruːəlti/","N","rehimsizlik","жестокость","behaviour that causes suffering","Cruelty to animals is a crime.","Haýwanlara rehimsizlik jenaýat.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","animal cruelty","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["extinction","/ɪkˈstɪŋkʃn/","N","ýok bolmak (görnüşiň)","вымирание","when a species dies out","The tiger faces extinction.","Ýolbars ýok bolmak howpy astynda.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","face extinction","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fur","/fɜː(r)/","N","ýüň (haýwanyň)","мех","the soft hair on animals","The cat has soft white fur.","Pişigiň ýumşak ak ýüňi bar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["habitat","/ˈhæbɪtæt/","N","ýaşaýyş gurşawy","среда обитания","the natural home of an animal","Cutting trees destroys habitats.","Agaçlary çapmak ýaşaýyş gurşawyny weýran edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","natural habitat","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hunt","/hʌnt/","V","awlamak","охотиться","to chase animals to catch them","Lions hunt at night.","Ýolbarslar gije awlaýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["poacher","/ˈpəʊtʃə(r)/","N","bikanun awçy","браконьер","a person who hunts illegally","Poachers killed the rhino.","Bikanun awçylar karkidany öldürdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stray","/streɪ/","ADJ","eýesiz (haýwan)","бездомный (о животном)","lost, with no home","A stray dog followed us home.","Eýesiz it yzymyzdan öýe geldi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","stray cat","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wildlife","/ˈwaɪldlaɪf/","N","ýabany tebigat","дикая природа","animals and plants in nature","The reserve protects wildlife.","Goraghana ýabany tebigaty goraýar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","wildlife reserve","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dice","/daɪs/","V","kubik dogramak","нарезать кубиками","to cut into small cubes","Dice the onions and carrots.","Sogany we käşiri kubik dogra.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["grate","/ɡreɪt/","V","gyrkmak (rende)","тереть на тёрке","to rub food into small pieces","Grate the cheese over the pasta.","Peýniri makaronyň üstüne gyrk.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","grate the cheese","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["knead","/niːd/","V","ýugurmak (hamyr)","месить (тесто)","to press dough with the hands","Knead the dough for ten minutes.","Hamry on minut ýugur.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["melt","/melt/","V","eremek","таять, топить","to become liquid with heat","Melt the butter in a pan.","Ýagy gazanda eredýiň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","melt the butter","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["peel","/piːl/","V","gabygyny soýmak","чистить (кожуру)","to take the skin off fruit","Peel the potatoes first.","Ilki ýeralmanyň gabygyny sow.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","peel the potatoes","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["saucepan","/ˈsɔːspən/","N","gazanjagaz","кастрюля","a deep pan for cooking","Put the milk in a saucepan.","Süýdi gazanjagaza guý.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["seasoning","/ˈsiːznɪŋ/","N","tagam beriji","приправа","salt, pepper and herbs","Add seasoning to taste.","Tagamyna görä tagam beriji goşuň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","add seasoning","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sieve","/sɪv/","N","ele","сито","a tool with holes for separating","Sift the flour through a sieve.","Uny elekden geçir.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","through a sieve","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["simmer","/ˈsɪmə(r)/","V","haýal gaýnatmak","томить на медленном огне","to cook just below boiling","Simmer the soup for twenty minutes.","Çorbany ýigrimi minut haýal gaýnat.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["whisk","/wɪsk/","V","galtaşdyryp çalmak","взбивать венчиком","to beat with a special tool","Whisk the cream until thick.","Gaýmagy goýalýança galtaşdyryp çal.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["marinade","/ˈmærɪneɪd/","V","duzlama ýatyrmak","мариновать","to leave food in a flavoured liquid","Marinade the chicken for an hour.","Towugy bir sagat duzlamada ýatyryň.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":9,"lesson":"9B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["appointment","/əˈpɔɪntmənt/","N","bellenen wagt (duşuşyk)","встреча, запись (на приём)","an arranged meeting","I have a dentist appointment at four.","Sagat dörtde diş lukmanyna ýazyldym.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make an appointment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["arrangement","/əˈreɪndʒmənt/","N","gurnama (meýilleşdirme)","договорённость","a plan made for something","We made arrangements for the trip.","Syýahat üçin gurnama etdik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","make arrangements","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["assessment","/əˈsesmənt/","N","bahalandyryş","оценка, аттестация","a judgement of quality","The assessment takes one hour.","Bahalandyryş bir sagat alýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","assessment test","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["commitment","/kəˈmɪtmənt/","N","ygrarlylyk","преданность, обязательство","a promise to work hard at something","The job needs real commitment.","Iş hakyky ygrarlylyk talap edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","make a commitment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["employment","/ɪmˈplɔɪmənt/","N","iş bilen üpjünçilik","занятость","having a paid job","Employment rose in the spring.","Ýazda iş bilen üpjünçilik artdy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","full employment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["entertainment","/ˌentəˈteɪnmənt/","N","güýme","развлечение","things that amuse people","The city offers great entertainment.","Şäher ajaýyp güýme hödürleýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","live entertainment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["equipment","/ɪˈkwɪpmənt/","N","enjam","оборудование","the things needed for an activity","The camping equipment is new.","Kemping enjamy täze.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","sports equipment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["failure","/ˈfeɪljə(r)/","N","şowsuzlyk","неудача, провал","not succeeding","Failure taught him a lot.","Şowsuzlyk oňa köp zat övretdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","fear of failure","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["performance","/pəˈfɔːməns/","N","çykyş (tomaşa)","выступление, представление","a show or act","Her performance was brilliant.","Çykyşy ajaýyp boldy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","live performance","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["replacement","/rɪˈpleɪsmənt/","N","çalşylma (çalyşma)","замена","a person or thing that replaces another","We need a replacement for the old printer.","Köne printere çalşylma gerek.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","replacement parts","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10A","section":"wordbuilding"}]],["beside","/bɪˈsaɪd/","PREP","ýanynda","рядом с","next to something","The bag is beside the door.","Sumka gapynyň ýanynda.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["besides","/bɪˈsaɪdz/","ADV","mundan başga-da","кроме того","in addition","Besides, it was too late.","Mundan başga-da, gaty giçdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["compliment","/ˈkɒmplɪmənt/","N","taryp","комплимент","words that praise someone","He paid her a nice compliment.","Oňa owadan taryp aýtdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","pay a compliment","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["complement","/ˈkɒmplɪment/","V","üstüni ýetirmek","дополнять","to go well with something","The sauce complements the fish.","Sous balygyň üstüni ýetirýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["economic","/ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪk/","ADJ","ykdysady","экономический","about the economy","The country faces economic problems.","Ýurt ykdysady kynçylyklar bilen ýüzbe-ýüz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","economic growth","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["historical","/hɪˈstɒrɪkl/","ADJ","taryhy (taryha degişli)","исторический (связанный с историей)","about the past","She loves historical novels.","Taryhy romanlary gowy görýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","historical novel","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["job","/dʒɒb/","N","iş (bir wezipe)","работа (конкретная)","a particular piece of work","He found a new job in May.","Maý aýynda täze iş tapdy.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["shade","/ʃeɪd/","N","kölege (ýagtylykdan)","тень (от солнца)","a place protected from sun","We sat in the shade of the tree.","Agaçyň kölegesinde oturduk.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","in the shade","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["shadow","/ˈʃædəʊ/","N","saýa","тень (силуэт)","a dark shape made by light","His shadow stretched across the wall.","Saýasy diwara düşdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","cast a shadow","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["prize","/praɪz/","N","baýrak","приз, премия","something won in a competition","She won first prize.","Birinji baýragy gazandy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","win a prize","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":10,"lesson":"10B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["How do you manage?","/haʊ du ju ˈmænɪdʒ/","PHR","Nädip hötdeleýärsiň?","Как вы справляетесь?","used to ask how someone copes","How do you manage with two jobs?","Iki işi nädip hötdeleýärsiň?","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["work-life balance","/ˌwɜːk laɪf ˈbæləns/","N","iş-öý deňagramlylygy","баланс работы и жизни","an equal mix of work and home life","Good work-life balance keeps you healthy.","Gowy iş-öý deňagramlylygy sagdyn saklaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I work from home.","/aɪ wɜːk frɒm həʊm/","PHR","Öýden işleýärin.","Я работаю из дома.","used to say where you work","I work from home twice a week.","Hepdede iki gezek öýden işleýärin.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["It runs in the family.","/ɪt rʌnz ɪn ðə ˈfæməli/","PHR","Maşgalada bar.","Это семейное (передаётся по наследству).","used when a trait is inherited","Musical talent — it runs in the family.","Saz zehini — maşgalada bar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["family business","/ˈfæməli ˈbɪznəs/","N","maşgala kärhanasy","семейный бизнес","a company owned by a family","They run a small family business.","Kiçi maşgala kärhanasyny dolandyrýarlar.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["the breadwinner","/ðə ˈbredwɪnə(r)/","N","maşgala ekleýji","кормилец","the person who earns for a family","She is the main breadwinner.","Maşgalanyň esasy ekleýjisi ol.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["work long hours","/wɜːk lɒŋ ˈaʊəz/","PHR","uzak sagat işlemek","работать подолгу","to work a lot","Doctors often work long hours.","Lukmanlar köplenç uzak sagat işleýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["quality time","/ˈkwɒləti taɪm/","N","hil wagty (maşgala bilen)","качественное время (с близкими)","time spent giving full attention","Spend quality time with your children.","Çagalaryňyz bilen hil wagtyny geçiriň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE1","section":"vocabulary"}]],["date back to","/deɪt bæk tuː/","PHR","şol döwürden galan","относиться к (о времени)","used to say how old something is","The castle dates back to the twelfth century.","Gala on ikinji asyrdan galan.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["steeped in history","/stiːpt ɪn ˈhɪstri/","PHR","taryha baý","насыщенный историей","used for very historic places","The old city is steeped in history.","Köne şäher taryha baý.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ancient ruins","/ˈeɪnʃnt ˈruːɪnz/","N","gadymy harabalar","древние руины","old buildings that have fallen","We explored the ancient ruins.","Gadymy harabalary öwrendik.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["a turning point","/ə ˈtɜːnɪŋ pɔɪnt/","N","öwrülişik nokady","поворотный момент","a moment that changes everything","The battle was a turning point.","Söweş öwrülişik nokady boldy.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["go down in history","/ɡəʊ daʊn ɪn ˈhɪstri/","PHR","taryha girmek","войти в историю","to be remembered for ever","She went down in history as a pioneer.","Öňdebaryjy hökmünde taryha girdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["back in the day","/bæk ɪn ðə deɪ/","PHR","köne döwürlerde","в былые времена","used about the past","Back in the day, there was no internet.","Köne döwürlerde internet ýokdy.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["living history","/ˈlɪvɪŋ ˈhɪstri/","N","ýaşaýan taryh","живая история","old traditions still alive today","The market is living history.","Bazar ýaşaýan taryh.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["pass into legend","/pɑːs ˈɪntə ˈledʒənd/","PHR","rowaýata öwrülmek","войти в легенды","to become famous in stories","The hero passed into legend.","Gahryman rowaýata öwrüldi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE2","section":"vocabulary"}]],["I'm stressed out.","/aɪm ˌstrest ˈaʊt/","PHR","Dartgynly ýagdaýda.","Я в стрессе.","used to say you feel too much pressure","I am stressed out before exams.","Synagdan öň dartgynly ýagdaýda bolýaryn.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["wind down","/waɪnd daʊn/","PHR","köşeşmek (dynç almak)","расслабляться (постепенно)","to relax after activity","I wind down with a book.","Kitap bilen köşeşýärin.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["recharge my batteries","/ˌriːˈtʃɑːdʒ maɪ ˈbætriz/","PHR","güýjümi dikeltmek","подзарядиться","to get energy back","A weekend at the lake recharges my batteries.","Köl kenaryndaky hepde ahyry güýjümi dikeldýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["helps me unwind","/helps miː ˌʌnˈwaɪnd/","PHR","maňa köşeşmäge kömek edýär","помогает мне расслабиться","used to say what relaxes you","Walking helps me unwind.","Ýöremek maňa köşeşmäge kömek edýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["burnout","/ˈbɜːnaʊt/","N","ýadawlyk (işden)","выгорание","exhaustion from working too hard","He had to stop working to avoid burnout.","Ýadawlykdan gaça durmak üçin işi bes etmeli boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["chill out","/tʃɪl aʊt/","PHR","dynç almak (gowşurmak)","расслабиться, отдохнуть","to relax completely","Let us chill out by the pool.","Geliň, howzuň ýanynda dynç alalyň.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["at breaking point","/ət ˈbreɪkɪŋ pɔɪnt/","PHR","çydap bilmeýän ýagdaýda","на грани срыва","almost unable to cope","She was at breaking point after the exams.","Synaglardan soň çydap bilmeýän ýagdaýda boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["let off steam","/let ɒf stiːm/","PHR","gaharyny çykarmak","выпустить пар","to get rid of strong feelings","He runs to let off steam.","Gaharyny çykarmak üçin ylgaw edýär.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE3","section":"vocabulary"}]],["beautifully illustrated","/ˈbjuːtɪfli ˈɪləstreɪtɪd/","ADJ","owadan suratlandyrylan","красочно иллюстрированный","with lovely pictures","It is a beautifully illustrated book.","Owadan suratlandyrylan kitap.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bring it to life","/brɪŋ ɪt tuː laɪf/","PHR","jana getirýär","оживляет","used when pictures make a story vivid","The drawings bring the story to life.","Çyzgylar hekaýany jana getirýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["graphic novel","/ˈɡræfɪk ˈnɒvl/","N","komiks roman","графический роман","a novel told in pictures","He reads graphic novels.","Komiks romanlary okaýar.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["eye-catching","/ˈaɪ kætʃɪŋ/","ADJ","göze ilýän","бросающийся в глаза","immediately noticed","The poster is very eye-catching.","Plakat gaty göze ilýän.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["the visuals","/ðə ˈvɪʒuəlz/","N","wizual taraplary","визуальный ряд","the images in a film or book","The visuals are stunning.","Wizual taraplary haýran galdyryjy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["The cover draws you in.","/ðə ˈkʌvə(r) drɔːz juː ɪn/","PHR","Muqawasy özüne çekýär.","Обложка притягивает.","used to praise a book cover","The cover draws you in immediately.","Muqawasy dessine özüne çekýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["caption","/ˈkæpʃn/","N","surat ýazgysy","подпись (к рисунку)","words under a picture","Read the caption below the photo.","Suratyň aşagyndaky ýazgyny oka.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","photo caption","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["full-page spread","/ˌfʊl peɪdʒ ˈspred/","N","tutuş sahypa ýaýran","разворот на всю страницу","a picture across a whole page","The map is a full-page spread.","Karta tutuş sahypa ýaýran.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE4","section":"vocabulary"}]],["give me the creeps","/ɡɪv miː ðə kriːps/","PHR","tenim ürkýär","меня пробирает дрожь","used to say something scares you","Spiders give me the creeps.","Mör-möjekler tenimi ürküzýär.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["bee sting","/ˈbiː stɪŋ/","N","ary çakmasy","укус пчелы","a wound from a bee","A bee sting can hurt a lot.","Ary çakmasy gaty agyryp biler.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["insect bite","/ˈɪnsekt baɪt/","N","möjek çakmasy","укус насекомого","a mark from an insect","Put cream on the insect bite.","Möjek çakmasyna krem çal.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["creepy-crawly","/ˈkriːpi krɔːli/","N","ýyldyryjy mör-möjek","букашка (разг.)","an insect or spider (informal)","There is a creepy-crawly on the wall!","Diwarda ýyldyryjy mör-möjek bar!","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["harmless","/ˈhɑːmləs/","ADJ","zyýansyz","безвредный","causing no harm","The spider is completely harmless.","Mör-möjek düýbünden zyýansyz.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["leave it alone","/liːv ɪt əˈləʊn/","PHR","Ona degme.","Не трогай его.","used to say do not disturb","That beetle is harmless — leave it alone.","Şol tomzak zyýansyz — ona degme.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["spider web","/ˈspaɪdə(r) web/","N","möjek tory","паутина","the net a spider spins","A spider web covered the corner.","Möjek tory burçy örtüpdi.","A2","Oxford 3000","—","—","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["swarm","/swɔːm/","N","topar (mör-möjek)","рой","a large moving group of insects","A swarm of bees flew past.","Ary topary uçup geçdi.","B1","Oxford 5000","—","a swarm of bees","New",[{"book":"adv","unit":11,"lesson":"CE5","section":"vocabulary"}]],["and so on","/ænd səʊ ˈɒn/","PHR","we şuňa meňzeşler","и тому подобное","used after a list to mean there are more examples","We bought bread, cheese, fruit and so on.","Biz çörek, peýnir, miwe we şuňa meňzeşleri satyn aldyk.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["or something","/ɔː ˈsʌmθɪŋ/","PHR","ýa-da meňzeş zat","или что-то вроде","used when you are not sure of the exact thing","He is a lawyer or something.","Ol aklawçy ýa-da meňzeş zat.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["more or less","/mɔː ɔː les/","PHR","takmynan (üç aşak bäş ýokary)","более или менее","almost, but not exactly","The work is more or less finished.","Iş takmynan gutardy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["to some extent","/tə sʌm ɪkˈstent/","PHR","belli bir derejede","в некоторой степени","partly, but not completely","You are right to some extent.","Sen belli bir derejede mamla.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["roughly","/ˈrʌfli/","ADV","takmynan","примерно","approximately, not exactly","It costs roughly ten manat.","Ol takmynan on manat durýar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["whatnot","/ˈwɒtnɒt/","N","we şuňa meňzeş zatlar","и прочее","used after a list to mean other similar things","The box held pens, paper, whatnot.","Gutuda galam, kagyz we şuňa meňzeş zatlar bardy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["or so","/ɔː səʊ/","PHR","töweregi (takmynan)","или около того","used after a number to mean approximately","There were thirty or so guests.","Otuza töweregi myhman bardy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["upbringing","/ˈʌpbrɪŋɪŋ/","N","terbiýe (ösüş)","воспитание","the way a child is raised and taught behaviour","He had a strict upbringing.","Onuň berk terbiýesi bardy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["outcome","/ˈaʊtkʌm/","N","netije","результат, исход","the result of an event or process","Nobody knows the outcome yet.","Netijäni heniz hiç kim bilenok.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["downpour","/ˈdaʊnpɔː/","N","guýma ýagyş","ливень","a lot of rain falling in a short time","We got caught in a downpour.","Biz guýma ýagyşa düşdük.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["aftertaste","/ˈɑːftəteɪst/","N","tagam yzy (agyzda galan)","послевкусие","a taste that stays in your mouth afterwards","The medicine left a bitter aftertaste.","Derman ajy tagam yzyny galdyrdy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["outcry","/ˈaʊtkraɪ/","N","garym-gatym protest","возмущение, протест","a strong public expression of anger","The tax caused a public outcry.","Salgyt jemgyýetçilik protestine sebäp boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["downfall","/ˈdaʊnfɔːl/","N","ýykylyş (derejeden gaçma)","падение, крах","the loss of power or success of a person","Greed was his downfall.","Açgözlük onuň ýykylyşy boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["backlash","/ˈbæklæʃ/","N","güýçli garşylyk","резкая негативная реакция","a strong negative reaction by many people","The decision provoked a backlash.","Bu karar güýçli garşylyk döretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["aftermath","/ˈɑːftəmæθ/","N","soňy (waka soňy)","последствия","the period and effects following a bad event","They rebuilt the town in the aftermath.","Olar şäheri wakanyň soňunda täzeden gurdular.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["outlay","/ˈaʊtleɪ/","N","çykdajy (ilkinji)","затраты, расходы","an amount of money spent on something","The initial outlay was high.","Ilkinji çykdajy ýokary boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["intake","/ˈɪnteɪk/","N","kabul (içine alyş)","потребление, приём","the amount taken in over a period","Cut down your daily sugar intake.","Gündelik şeker kabulyňyzy azaldyň.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["outburst","/ˈaʊtbɜːst/","N","duýgy partlamasy","вспышка, взрыв эмоций","a sudden strong expression of emotion","She regretted her angry outburst.","Ol gaharly partlamasyna ökünýärdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":1,"lesson":"1B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["amoral","/ˌeɪˈmɒrəl/","ADJ","ahlaksyz (ýörelgesiz)","аморальный","not having any sense of right and wrong","He took an amoral view of business.","Ol işewürlige ahlaksyz garaýardy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["antenatal","/ˌæntiˈneɪtl/","ADJ","dogluşdan öňki","дородовой","relating to the time before a baby is born","She goes to antenatal classes.","Ol dogluşdan öňki sapaklara gatnaşýar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["circumnavigate","/ˌsɜːkəmˈnævɪɡeɪt/","V","töweregini aýlanyp geçmek","совершить кругосветное плавание","to sail all the way around something","They circumnavigated the globe.","Olar Ýer şarynyň daşyny aýlanyp geçdiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["counterproductive","/ˌkaʊntəprəˈdʌktɪv/","ADJ","netijesiz (garşy täsirli)","контрпродуктивный","having the opposite of the effect you want","The new rule proved counterproductive.","Täze düzgün netijesiz boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["misjudge","/ˌmɪsˈdʒʌdʒ/","V","ýalňyş baha bermek","неправильно оценить","to form a wrong opinion of someone or something","I misjudged how long it would take.","Men onuň näçe wagt aljakdygyny ýalňyş çakladym.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["overestimate","/ˌəʊvərˈestɪmeɪt/","V","artyk baha bermek","переоценить","to think something is bigger or better than it is","We overestimated the cost.","Biz bahany artyk çakladyk.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["substandard","/ˌsʌbˈstændəd/","ADJ","standartdan pes","некачественный","worse than the normal or accepted level","They used substandard materials.","Olar standartdan pes material ulandylar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["transformation","/ˌtrænsfəˈmeɪʃn/","N","özgerdiliş","преобразование","a complete change in form or appearance","The city underwent a transformation.","Şäher özgerdilişe sezewar boldy.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["accuracy","/ˈækjərəsi/","N","takyklyk","точность","the quality of being correct and exact","Check the accuracy of the figures.","Sanlaryň takyklygyny barlaň.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["resilience","/rɪˈzɪliəns/","N","çydamlylyk (gaýtadan dikeliş)","устойчивость, жизнестойкость","the ability to recover quickly after problems","Her resilience impressed everyone.","Onuň çydamlylygy hemmäni haýran galdyrdy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stride","/straɪd/","V","ädim ätmek (ynamly)","шагать","to walk with long confident steps","She strode into the room.","Ol otaga ynamly ädim ädip girdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stroll","/strəʊl/","V","haýal gezelenç etmek","прогуливаться","to walk slowly in a relaxed way","They strolled along the beach.","Olar kenarda haýal gezelenç etdiler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["trudge","/trʌdʒ/","V","agyr ädimlemek (ýadaw)","плестись","to walk slowly with heavy steps, tiredly","We trudged home in the snow.","Biz garda ýadaw ädimläp öýe gaýtdyk.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wander","/ˈwɒndə/","V","aýlanyp ýörmek (maksatsyz)","бродить","to walk around slowly with no clear direction","We wandered through the old town.","Biz köne şäherde aýlanyp ýördük.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stagger","/ˈstæɡə/","V","titräp ýörmek (ykjyramak)","шататься","to walk unsteadily, almost falling","He staggered out of the bar.","Ol bardan titräp çykdy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["stumble","/ˈstʌmbl/","V","büzülip gitmek (aýagy büdräp)","спотыкаться","to hit your foot and almost fall while walking","She stumbled over a stone.","Ol daşa büzlip gitdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tiptoe","/ˈtɪptəʊ/","V","barmak ujunda ýörmek","красться на цыпочках","to walk quietly on the tips of your toes","He tiptoed past the bedroom.","Ol ýatylýan otagyň deňinden barmak ujunda geçdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sprint","/sprɪnt/","V","tiz ylgamak (gysga aralyk)","мчаться, бежать спринт","to run at full speed for a short distance","She sprinted to catch the bus.","Ol awtobusa ýetişmek üçin tiz ylgady.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["shuffle","/ˈʃʌfl/","V","aýak süýşürip ýörmek","шаркать","to walk without lifting your feet properly","The old man shuffled to the door.","Garry adam aýak süýşürip gapa bardy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["trek","/trek/","V","uzyn we kyn ýol ýöremek","совершать долгий переход","to make a long hard journey on foot","We trekked through the mountains.","Biz daglaryň içinden uzyn ýol ýördük.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":2,"lesson":"2B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["questionnaire","/ˌkwestʃəˈneə/","N","soragnama","анкета","a set of written questions to collect information","We sent out a questionnaire.","Biz soragnama iberdik.","C1","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["survey","/ˈsɜːveɪ/","N","sorag-jogap barlagy","опрос","a study that asks people questions to find opinions","A recent survey shows the trend.","Soňky sorag-jogap bu tendensiýany görkezýär.","B2","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["sample","/ˈsɑːmpl/","N","nusga (barlag topary)","выборка","a small group used to represent a larger one","The sample included two hundred students.","Nusga iki ýüz studenti öz içine aldy.","B2","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["respondent","/rɪˈspɒndənt/","N","jogap beriji","респондент","a person who answers questions in a survey","Half the respondents agreed.","Jogap berijileriň ýarysy razy boldy.","C1","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["findings","/ˈfaɪndɪŋz/","N","tapyndylar (barlag netijeleri)","результаты исследования","the results of a study or investigation","The findings were published last week.","Tapyndylar geçen hepde çap edildi.","C1","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["statistics","/stəˈtɪstɪks/","N","statistika","статистика","numbers that summarise a large set of facts","The statistics show a rise.","Statistika ösüşi görkezýär.","B2","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["variable","/ˈveəriəbl/","N","üýtgeýän ululyk","переменная","a factor that can change and affect a result","Age is an important variable.","Ýaş möhüm üýtgeýän ululykdyr.","C1","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["correlation","/ˌkɒrəˈleɪʃn/","N","özara baglanyşyk","корреляция","a connection between two things that change together","There is a strong correlation here.","Bu ýerde güýçli özara baglanyşyk bar.","C2","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["methodology","/ˌmeθəˈdɒlədʒi/","N","metodologiýa (usul ulgamy)","методология","the set of methods used in a study","The methodology is explained below.","Metodologiýa aşakda düşündirilýär.","C1","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["analysis","/əˈnæləsɪs/","N","seljerme","анализ","a detailed examination of something","The analysis took three months.","Seljerme üç aý aldy.","B2","Academic","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3A","section":"vocabulary"}]],["a wild-goose chase","/ə waɪld ɡuːs tʃeɪs/","PHR","biyparajy gözleg (boş iş)","бесполезная погоня","a hopeless search for something you cannot find","Looking for him was a wild-goose chase.","Ony gözlemek boşa iş boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["break the ice","/breɪk ði aɪs/","PHR","buzuny döwmek (gepleşigi başlamak)","разрядить обстановку","to make people relax at the start of a meeting","A joke helped break the ice.","Degişme buzuny döwmäge kömek etdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["in a pickle","/ɪn ə ˈpɪkl/","PHR","kyn ýagdaýda","в затруднительном положении","in a difficult or troubling situation","I am in a bit of a pickle.","Men birhili kyn ýagdaýda.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["a heart of gold","/ə hɑːt əv ɡəʊld/","PHR","altyn ýürekli","золотое сердце","very kind and generous","She has a heart of gold.","Onuň altyn ýüregi bar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["seen better days","/siːn ˈbetə deɪz/","PHR","öňki günleri gowy bolan (könelen)","видал лучшие времена","old and in worse condition than before","This coat has seen better days.","Bu palto öňki günlerini gördi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fair play","/feə pleɪ/","PHR","adalatly oýun","честная игра","honest and equal behaviour in a competition","We believe in fair play.","Biz adalatly oýna ynanýarys.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["love is blind","/lʌv ɪz blaɪnd/","PHR","söýgi kordur","любовь слепа","you cannot see the faults of someone you love","They say love is blind.","Söýgi kordur diýýärler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["too much of a good thing","/tuː mʌtʃ əv ə ɡʊd θɪŋ/","PHR","gowy zadyň hem köpi artyk","всё хорошо в меру","even something good is bad in large amounts","Three cakes is too much of a good thing.","Üç tort gowy zadyň hem köpi artyk.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["a brave new world","/ə breɪv njuː wɜːld/","PHR","täze dünýä (üýtgeşik döwür)","дивный новый мир","a new situation that seems exciting but strange","Technology created a brave new world.","Tehnologiýa täze dünýäni döretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wear your heart on your sleeve","/weə jɔː hɑːt ɒn jɔː sliːv/","PHR","duýgularyňy gizlemän görkezmek","носить сердце нараспашку","to show your feelings openly","He always wears his heart on his sleeve.","Ol hemişe duýgularyny açyk görkezýär.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["the green-eyed monster","/ðə ɡriːn aɪd ˈmɒnstə/","PHR","göripçilik (ysmanak)","зеленоглазое чудовище (ревность)","a way of describing jealousy","Jealousy is the green-eyed monster.","Göripçilik ysmanakdyr.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["in stitches","/ɪn ˈstɪtʃɪz/","PHR","gaty gülýän (garym-gatym)","умирать со смеху","laughing very hard","His jokes had us in stitches.","Onuň degişmeleri bizi gaty güldürdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":3,"lesson":"3B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["odds and ends","/ɒdz ənd endz/","PHR","owny-uwak zatlar","мелочи, всякая всячина","small things of different kinds","The box was full of odds and ends.","Guty owny-uwak zatlar bilen doludy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ups and downs","/ʌps ənd daʊnz/","PHR","belent-pes günler","взлёты и падения","a mixture of good and bad experiences","Every marriage has its ups and downs.","Her bir durmuşyň belent-pes günleri bolýar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bits and pieces","/bɪts ənd ˈpiːsɪz/","PHR","owny-uwak bölekler","мелкие предметы","small separate items or tasks","I have a few bits and pieces to do.","Eden bir-iki owny işim bar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["pros and cons","/prəʊz ənd kɒnz/","PHR","artykmaçlyklary we kemçilikleri","за и против","the advantages and disadvantages of something","We weighed up the pros and cons.","Biz artykmaçlyklaryny we kemçiliklerini deňeşdirdik.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["by and large","/baɪ ənd lɑːdʒ/","PHR","umuman alanyňda","в целом","in general, when everything is considered","By and large, the plan worked.","Umuman alanyňda, meýilnama işledi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hit and miss","/hɪt ənd mɪs/","PHR","şowsuz ýa-da üstünlikli (tötänleýin)","то густо, то пусто","sometimes good and sometimes bad, unpredictable","The service here is hit and miss.","Bu ýerdäki hyzmat tötänleýin.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["touch and go","/tʌtʃ ənd ɡəʊ/","PHR","howply ýagdaý (iki aralykda)","на волоске","uncertain, could succeed or fail at any moment","His recovery was touch and go.","Onuň sagalmagy howply ýagdaýdady.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["now and then","/naʊ ənd ðen/","PHR","ara-syrada","время от времени","sometimes, but not often","We meet now and then.","Biz ara-syrada duşuşýarys.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["back and forth","/bæk ənd fɔːθ/","PHR","ylla-yzlary (gidip-gelip)","взад и вперёд","moving first one way and then the other","They argued back and forth.","Olar ylla-yzlary jedelleşdiler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["give and take","/ɡɪv ənd teɪk/","PHR","özara ýüzleşme (ylalaşyk)","взаимные уступки","willingness to compromise with others","Marriage needs give and take.","Durmuş özara ýüzleşmäni talap edýär.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wear and tear","/weə ənd teə/","PHR","könelme (ulanyş zerarly)","износ","damage that happens through normal use","The warranty covers wear and tear.","Kepillik könelmäni öz içine alýar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["safe and sound","/seɪf ənd saʊnd/","PHR","aman-esen (zyýansyz)","цел и невредим","back without any harm or injury","The children came home safe and sound.","Çagalar öýe aman-esen geldiler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["CEO","/ˌsiː iː ˈəʊ/","N","baş direktor (edara ýolbaşçysy)","генеральный директор","the person in charge of a company, chief executive officer","The CEO announced the deal.","Baş direktor şertnamany yglan etdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["DIY","/ˌdiː aɪ waɪ/","N","özüň et (öý işleri)","сделай сам","doing home repairs yourself, do it yourself","He is good at DIY.","Ol öý işlerini özi etmegi başarýar.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["FAQ","/ˌef eɪ ˈkjuː/","N","ýygy soralýan soraglar","часто задаваемые вопросы","a list of questions people often ask, and answers","Check the FAQ on our website.","Web sahypamyzdaky ýygy soralýan soraglara serediň.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ASAP","/ˌeɪ es eɪ ˈpiː/","ADV","mümkin boldugyça tiz","как можно скорее","as soon as possible","Call me back ASAP.","Maňa mümkin boldugyça tiz jaň ediň.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ETA","/ˌiː tiː ˈeɪ/","N","gelýän wagty (çaklama)","расчётное время прибытия","the time something is expected to arrive","The ETA is six o clock.","Gelýän wagty sagat alty.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["RSVP","/ˌɑːr es viː ˈpiː/","PHR","jogap bermegiňizi haýyş edýäris","просьба ответить","please reply, from French repondez s il vous plait","Please RSVP by Friday.","Anna gününe çenli jogap bermegiňizi haýyş edýäris.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["HQ","/ˌeɪtʃ ˈkjuː/","N","baş edara","штаб-квартира","the main office of an organisation, headquarters","The HQ is in Ashgabat.","Baş edara Aşgabatda.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["PR","/ˌpiː ˈɑːr/","N","jemgyýetçilik bilen aragatnaşyk","связи с общественностью","the work of managing a public image, public relations","She works in PR.","Ol jemgyýetçilik aragatnaşygynda işleýär.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["HR","/ˌeɪtʃ ˈɑːr/","N","işgärler bölümi","отдел кадров","the department that manages staff, human resources","Contact HR about the job.","Iş barada işgärler bölümi bilen habarlaşyň.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["GDP","/ˌdʒiː diː ˈpiː/","N","jemi içerki önüm","валовой внутренний продукт","the total value of goods a country produces, gross domestic product","The GDP grew by three per cent.","Jemi içerki önüm üç göterim ösdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":4,"lesson":"4B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["devastated","/ˈdevəsteɪtɪd/","ADJ","örän gamgyn (ýüregi ezilen)","опустошённый, убитый горем","extremely upset and shocked","He was devastated by the news.","Ol bu habardan örän gamgyn boldy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ecstatic","/ɪkˈstætɪk/","ADJ","joşgunly begençli","в экстазе","feeling overwhelming happiness","The fans were ecstatic.","Janköýerler joşgunly begençlidiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gutted","/ˈɡʌtɪd/","ADJ","örän lapykeç","глубоко разочарованный","extremely disappointed, informal","She was gutted to lose.","Ol utulyp örän lapykeç boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["over the moon","/ˌəʊvə ðə muːn/","PHR","aýyň üstünde (örän şat)","на седьмом небе","extremely pleased about something","He was over the moon about the job.","Ol iş barada aýyň üstündedi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["apprehensive","/ˌæprɪˈhensɪv/","ADJ","aladaly (howatyrly)","опасающийся","worried that something bad may happen","She felt apprehensive before the exam.","Ol synagdan öň howatyrlandy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["resentful","/rɪˈzentfl/","ADJ","kineli (gaharly)","возмущённый, обиженный","feeling bitter anger at unfair treatment","She was resentful of his success.","Ol onuň üstünligine kineli boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["content","/kənˈtent/","ADJ","kanagatlanýan (hoşal)","довольный","happy and satisfied with what you have","He is content with his life.","Ol durmuşyndan kanagatlanýar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["elated","/ɪˈleɪtɪd/","ADJ","örän begençli (joşan)","ликующий","extremely happy and proud","They were elated by the victory.","Olar ýeňişden örän begençlidiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["despondent","/dɪˈspɒndənt/","ADJ","umytsyz (ruhdan düşen)","унылый, подавленный","unhappy and without hope","She grew despondent after months.","Aýlardan soň ol umytsyz boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["immigrant","/ˈɪmɪɡrənt/","N","gelen immigrant (gelip ýerleşen)","иммигрант","a person who comes to live in a new country","The city welcomed the immigrants.","Şäher immigrantlary garşylady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["emigrant","/ˈemɪɡrənt/","N","giden immigrant (öz ýurdundan çykan)","эмигрант","a person who leaves their country to live abroad","Many emigrants sought work abroad.","Köp emigrantlar daşary ýurtda iş gözlediler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["migrant","/ˈmaɪɡrənt/","N","göçüp ýören adam","мигрант","a person who moves to find work, often for a while","Migrant workers follow the harvest.","Göçüp ýören işçiler hasylyň yzyna düşýärler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["refugee","/ˌrefjuˈdʒiː/","N","bosgun","беженец","a person forced to leave home by war or danger","The refugees crossed the border.","Bosgunlar serhetden geçdiler.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["asylum seeker","/əˈsaɪləm ˌsiːkə/","N","pena gözleýän","лицо, ищущее убежища","a person asking another country for protection","The asylum seeker waited for a decision.","Pena gözleýän karara garaşdy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["expatriate","/eksˈpætriət/","N","daşary ýurtda ýaşaýan watandaş","экспатриант","a person living outside their native country","The expatriate works for an oil firm.","Ekspat nebit kompaniýasynda işleýär.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["indigenous","/ɪnˈdɪdʒənəs/","ADJ","ýerli (gadymy)","коренной","living in a place before others arrived","The indigenous people protect the forest.","Ýerli halk tokaýy goraýar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ethnic minority","/ˈeθnɪk maɪˈnɒrəti/","N","etniçeslik azlyk","этническое меньшинство","a group with a different culture within a country","The law protects every ethnic minority.","Kanun her etniçeslik azlygy goraýar.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["diaspora","/daɪˈæspərə/","N","dagynyk millet (ýaýran halk)","диаспора","people scattered away from their homeland","The diaspora keeps its traditions.","Diaspora öz däplerini saklaýar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["integration","/ˌɪntɪˈɡreɪʃn/","N","jemi bolup goşulma (uýgunlaşma)","интеграция","the process of joining and fitting into a group","Integration takes time and effort.","Goşulma wagt we tagalla talap edýär.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":5,"lesson":"5B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["deeply","/ˈdiːpli/","ADV","çuňňur (güýçli)","глубоко","used to add strong feeling to a verb","I deeply regret the mistake.","Men ýalňyşlyga çuňňur ökünýärin.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["highly","/ˈhaɪli/","ADV","örän (ýokary derejede)","весьма, крайне","used to mean very, especially with praise","I highly recommend this book.","Men bu kitaby örän maslahat berýärin.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["utterly","/ˈʌtəli/","ADV","düýbünden (doly)","совершенно","completely, often with a negative idea","The idea was utterly ridiculous.","Bu pikiriň düýbünden many ýokdy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["virtually","/ˈvɜːtʃuəli/","ADV","diýen ýaly (tas)","практически","almost completely, nearly","It is virtually impossible.","Bu diýen ýaly mümkin däl.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bitterly","/ˈbɪtəli/","ADV","ajy (örän, gynançly)","горько","used to show strong sadness or anger","She was bitterly disappointed.","Ol ajy lapykeç boldy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["manufacture","/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃə/","V","önümçilikde ýasamak","производить","to make goods in large numbers with machines","The factory manufactures parts.","Zawod bölekleri öndürýär.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["assemble","/əˈsembl/","V","ýygnamak (böleklerden)","собирать, монтировать","to fit parts together to make something","He assembled the shelf himself.","Ol tekjäni özi ýygnady.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["forge","/fɔːdʒ/","V","demir urup ýasamak","ковать","to shape metal by heating and hammering","They forged the iron gates.","Olar demir derwezeleri urup ýasadylar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["craft","/krɑːft/","V","ussatlyk bilen ýasamak","изготавливать вручную","to make something carefully with skill","She crafted a wooden bowl.","Ol ussatlyk bilen agaç käse ýasady.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["mould","/məʊld/","V","galyba salyp şekil bermek","формовать, лепить","to shape soft material into a form","The potter moulded the clay.","Küýzegär palçyga şekil berdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["construct","/kənˈstrʌkt/","V","gurmak (binany)","строить, сооружать","to build something large such as a bridge","They constructed a new bridge.","Olar täze köpri gurdular.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["innovative","/ˈɪnəveɪtɪv/","ADJ","täzeçil (özgerdiji)","инновационный","using new ideas or methods","It is an innovative design.","Bu täzeçil dizaýn.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gross","/ɡrəʊs/","NUM","ýüz kyrk dört","гросс (144 штуки)","a group of one hundred and forty-four","They ordered a gross of pens.","Olar ýüz kyrk dört sany galam sargyt etdiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ratio","/ˈreɪʃiəʊ/","N","gatnaşyk (san deňeşdirme)","соотношение","the relationship between two amounts as numbers","The teacher-pupil ratio is low.","Mugallym-okuwçy gatnaşygy pes.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["fraction","/ˈfrækʃn/","N","bölek (kesir)","дробь","a part of a whole, shown as one number over another","Three quarters is a fraction.","Dörtden üç bölekdir.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["decimal","/ˈdesɪml/","N","onluk san (oturlyk)","десятичная дробь","a number written with a point, not a fraction","Write it as a decimal.","Ony onluk san görnüşinde ýazyň.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["square metre","/skweə ˈmiːtə/","N","kwadrat metr","квадратный метр","a unit for measuring area","The flat is fifty square metres.","Öý elli kwadrat metr.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["hectare","/ˈhekter/","N","gektar","гектар","a unit of area equal to ten thousand square metres","The farm covers ten hectares.","Ferma on gektary eýeleýär.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tonne","/tʌn/","N","tonna (metric)","тонна","a unit of weight equal to one thousand kilograms","The load weighed a tonne.","Ýük bir tonna çekýärdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["dimensions","/daɪˈmenʃnz/","N","ölçegler (ululyk)","размеры","the measurements of size or shape","Check the dimensions before you build.","Gurmazdan öň ölçegleri barlaň.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":6,"lesson":"6B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["probation","/prəˈbeɪʃn/","N","şertli synag möhleti","испытательный срок","a period of good behaviour instead of prison","He was released on probation.","Ol şertli synag möhleti bilen boşadyldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["community service","/kəˈmjuːnəti ˈsɜːvɪs/","N","jemgyýetçilik hyzmaty","общественные работы","unpaid work for the community as a punishment","She did community service.","Ol jemgyýetçilik hyzmatyny etdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["suspended sentence","/səˈspendɪd ˈsentəns/","N","şertli höküm (tussaglyksyz)","условный срок","a prison sentence not served unless you offend again","He got a suspended sentence.","Ol şertli höküm aldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["parole","/pəˈrəʊl/","N","möhletinden öň boşatma","досрочное освобождение","permission to leave prison before the end of a sentence","She was released on parole.","Ol möhletinden öň boşadyldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["capital punishment","/ˈkæpɪtl ˌpʌnɪʃmənt/","N","ölüm jezasyny","смертная казнь","the punishment of death for a crime","Capital punishment is banned here.","Bu ýerde ölüm jezasy gadagan.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["life sentence","/laɪf ˈsentəns/","N","ömürlik höküm","пожизненное заключение","a punishment of staying in prison for life","He received a life sentence.","Ol ömürlik höküm aldy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["acquit","/əˈkwɪt/","V","aklamak (günäsiz tapmak)","оправдать","to officially say someone is not guilty","The jury acquitted her.","Kazyýet ony akady.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["verdict","/ˈvɜːdɪkt/","N","kazyýet karary","вердикт","the decision of guilty or not guilty in court","The verdict was not guilty.","Kazyýet karary günäsiz boldy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["custody","/ˈkʌstədi/","N","tussaglyk (saklamak)","под стражей, опека","the state of being kept in prison or under guard","The suspect is in custody.","Güman edilýän tussaglykda.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["thrifty","/ˈθrɪfti/","ADJ","tygşytly (ojakly)","бережливый","careful with money, in a good way","She is thrifty and saves well.","Ol tygşytly we gowy tygşytlaýar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["stingy","/ˈstɪndʒi/","ADJ","gysganç (pula gysganç)","скупой","unwilling to spend money, in a bad way","He is too stingy to tip.","Ol çaý pul bermäge gaty gysganç.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["curious","/ˈkjʊəriəs/","ADJ","merakly (bilmek isleýän)","любопытный","eager to know things, in a good way","Children are naturally curious.","Çagalar tebigy merakly.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["nosy","/ˈnəʊzi/","ADJ","burnuny sokýan","любопытный (навязчивый)","too interested in other people s business, bad way","Do not be so nosy.","Beýle burnuňy sokma.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["determined","/dɪˈtɜːmɪnd/","ADJ","kürt (berk kararly)","решительный","having a strong will to succeed, good way","She is determined to win.","Ol ýeňmäge berk kararly.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["ruthless","/ˈruːθləs/","ADJ","rehimsiz (aýamasyz)","безжалостный","doing anything to succeed, with no pity, bad way","He is a ruthless businessman.","Ol rehimsiz işewür.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["extravagant","/ɪkˈstrævəɡənt/","ADJ","ysraçy (çendenaşa)","расточительный","spending far too much money, bad way","The party was extravagant.","Toý ysraçy boldy.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":7,"lesson":"7B","section":"vocabulary"}]],["nibble","/ˈnɪbl/","V","ujy bilen dişlemek","покусывать, грызть","to eat small bites of something","She nibbled a biscuit.","Ol kökäni ujy bilen dişledi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gulp","/ɡʌlp/","V","yldyrym ýaly ýuwdamak","глотать","to swallow food or drink very quickly","He gulped down his coffee.","Ol kofesini yldyrym ýaly ýuwtdy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["devour","/dɪˈvaʊə/","V","horluk bilen iýmek","пожирать","to eat something quickly and eagerly","The boys devoured the pizza.","Oglanlar pizzany horluk bilen iýdiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["sip","/sɪp/","V","ujy bilen içmek (az-azdan)","потягивать, отпивать","to drink a small amount at a time","She sipped her tea slowly.","Ol çaýyny haýal ujy bilen içdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["savour","/ˈseɪvə/","V","tagamyny çykaryp iýmek","наслаждаться вкусом","to enjoy food or an experience slowly","Savour every moment.","Her bir pursadyň tagamyny çykar.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["munch","/mʌntʃ/","V","gatyrdadyp iýmek","хрустеть, чавкать","to eat something noisily","He munched on an apple.","Ol almany gatyrdadyp iýdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gobble up","/ˈɡɒbl ʌp/","PHR","horluk bilen ýuwdup iýmek","съедать жадно","to eat something very quickly and greedily","The children gobbled up the cake.","Çagalar torty horluk bilen ýuwdup iýdiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["bolt down","/bəʊlt daʊn/","PHR","gaýnadyp ýuwdamak (howlukmaç)","съедать наспех","to swallow food quickly without chewing","Do not bolt down your dinner.","Naharyňy howlukmaç iýmäň.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["tuck into","/tʌk ˈɪntə/","PHR","işdämen iýip başlamak","налегать на еду","to start eating eagerly","They tucked into the roast.","Olar gowrulan eti işdämen iýdiler.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wolf down","/wʊlf daʊn/","PHR","möjek ýaly horluk bilen iýmek","проглатывать как волк","to eat very fast and greedily","He wolfed down his lunch.","Ol günortanlygyny horluk bilen iýdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["peck at","/pek æt/","PHR","iýmek islemän ujy bilen iýmek","ковыряться в еде","to eat only small amounts without interest","She just pecked at her food.","Ol naharyny diňe ujy bilen iýdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["swallow","/ˈswɒləʊ/","V","ýuwdamak","глотать, проглатывать","to make food or drink go down your throat","Swallow the pill with water.","Derminy suw bilen ýuwduň.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8A","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glimpse","/ɡlɪmps/","N","gysga nazar (bir pursat görmek)","мимолётный взгляд","a quick or incomplete look at something","I caught a glimpse of the sea.","Men deňze bir pursat nazar saldym.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glare","/ɡleə/","V","gaharly seretmek","свирепо смотреть","to look at someone angrily","She glared at him.","Ol oňa gaharly seretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["peer","/pɪə/","V","ünsli seretmek (kyn görüp)","вглядываться","to look closely or with difficulty","He peered into the dark room.","Ol garaňky otaga ünsli seretdi.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["squint","/skwɪnt/","V","göz gyýap seretmek","щуриться","to look with your eyes partly closed","She squinted at the bright sun.","Ol ýagty güne göz gyýap seretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["glance","/ɡlɑːns/","V","göz aýlamak (tiz seretmek)","взглянуть мельком","to take a quick short look","He glanced at his watch.","Ol sagadyna göz aýlady.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["gaze","/ɡeɪz/","V","oýlanyp uzak seretmek","пристально глядеть","to look at something steadily for a long time","They gazed at the stars.","Olar ýyldyzlara oýlanyp seretdiler.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["peep","/piːp/","V","ýaşyryn seretmek (deşikden)","подглядывать","to look quickly and secretly through a gap","She peeped through the curtains.","Ol perdeleriň arasyndan ýaşyryn seretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["wink","/wɪŋk/","V","göz gypmak","подмигивать","to close and open one eye quickly as a signal","He winked at his friend.","Ol dostuna göz gypdy.","C1","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["blink","/blɪŋk/","V","göz gyrpym etmek","моргать","to shut and open your eyes quickly","She blinked in surprise.","Ol haýran galyp göz gyrpym etdi.","B2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["ogle","/ˈəʊɡl/","V","arzuwly seretmek (namysyz)","заигрывать взглядом","to look at someone in a way that shows desire","He ogled her rudely.","Ol oňa namysyz seretdi.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["scrutinise","/ˈskruːtənaɪz/","V","üns bilen barlap seretmek","внимательно изучать","to look at something very carefully","She scrutinised the contract.","Ol şertnamany üns bilen barlady.","C2","Oxford 5000","—","—","New",[{"book":"advp","unit":8,"lesson":"8B","section":"vocabulary_bank"}]],["day","/deɪ/","N","gün","день","A period of twenty-four hours, or the part of it when it is light","There are seven days in a week.","Bir hepdede ýedi gün bar.","A1","Oxford 3000","date","every day, the next day, day off","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1}]],["year","/jɪə/","N","ýyl","год","A period of twelve months","She is fifteen years old.","Ol on bäş ýaşynda.","A1","Oxford 3000","twelvemonth","last year, next year, this year","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":1}]],["week","/wiːk/","N","hepde","неделя","A period of seven days","We have an exam next week.","Biziň indiki hepde ekzamenimiz bar.","A1","Oxford 3000","—","last week, this week, at the weekend","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":2}]],["money","/ˈmʌni/","N","pul","деньги","Coins or notes that you use to buy things","I saved money for a new phone.","Men täze telefon üçin pul ýygnadym.","A1","Oxford 3000","cash, funds","save money, earn money, spend money","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":4}]],["food","/fuːd/","N","iýmit","еда","Things that people and animals eat","Turkmen food is very tasty.","Türkmen iýmiti gaty tagamly.","A1","Oxford 3000","sustenance, cuisine","fast food, traditional food, healthy food","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":5}]],["country","/ˈkʌntri/","N","ýurt","страна","An area of land that has its own government and people","Turkmenistan is a Central Asian country.","Türkmenistan Merkezi Aziýadaky ýurt.","A1","Oxford 3000","nation, state","foreign country, your own country","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":7}]],["car","/kɑː/","N","maşyn","автомобиль","A road vehicle with four wheels and an engine","My uncle bought a new car.","Meniň agam täze maşyn satyn aldy.","A1","Oxford 3000","vehicle, automobile","drive a car, by car, car park","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":8}]],["morning","/ˈmɔːnɪŋ/","N","irden","утро","The early part of the day, from night until midday","I do exercise every morning.","Men her irden maşk edýärin.","A1","Oxford 3000","forenoon","in the morning, good morning, early morning","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":9}]],["night","/naɪt/","N","gije","ночь","The time when it is dark and most people sleep","Good night, sleep well.","Haýyrly gije, rahat uky.","A1","Oxford 3000","nighttime","at night, last night, good night","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":9}]],["family","/ˈfæməli/","N","maşgala","семья","A group of people who are related to each other, such as parents and children","My family lives in Mary.","Meniň maşgalam Maryda ýaşaýar.","A1","Oxford 3000","household, relatives","big family, family name, family member","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":10}]],["come","/kʌm/","V","gelmek","приходить","To move towards or arrive at the place where the speaker is","Come here and look at this.","Bu ýere gel we muňa seret.","A1","Oxford 3000","arrive, approach","come in, come from, come back","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":2}]],["sleep","/sliːp/","V","uklamak","спать","To rest your mind and body with your eyes closed, usually at night","Children need to sleep eight hours a night.","Çagalar gijesine sekiz sagat uklap bilmeli.","A1","Oxford 3000","rest, nap","sleep well, go to sleep, sleep late","New",[{"book":"ele","unit":9}]],["important","/ɪmˈpɔːtnt/","ADJ","möhüm","важный","Necessary or of great value, because it affects other things","It is important to learn new words every day.","Her gün täze söz öwrenmek möhümdir.","A2","Oxford 3000","significant, essential, crucial","very important, important for someone, an important decision","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":1}]],["problem","/ˈprɒbləm/","N","mesele","проблема","A situation that is difficult to deal with or understand","We solved the problem together.","Meseläni bilelikde çözdük.","A2","Oxford 3000","difficulty, issue, trouble","big problem, solve a problem, no problem","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":3}]],["example","/ɪɡˈzɑːmpl/","N","mysal","пример","Something that shows what other things of the same kind are like","Can you give me an example, please?","Maňa bir mysal getirip bilersiňizmi?","A1","Oxford 3000","instance, sample, illustration","for example, a good example, set an example","New",[{"book":"pre","unit":3}]],["opportunity","/ˌɒpəˈtjuːnəti/","N","mümkinçilik","возможность","A situation that makes it possible to do something that you want to do","The course gave me an opportunity to speak English.","Kurs maňa iňlis dilinde gürleşmek mümkinçiligini berdi.","B1","Oxford 3000","chance, opening, prospect","a great opportunity, miss an opportunity, take the opportunity","New",[{"book":"int","unit":2}]],["environment","/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/","N","daşky gurşaw","окружающая среда","The natural world of air, water and land, or the conditions around people","We must protect the environment for future generations.","Geljekki nesiller üçin daşky gurşawy goramaly.","B1","Oxford 3000","surroundings, habitat, setting","protect the environment, work environment, natural environment","New",[{"book":"int","unit":4}]],["technology","/tekˈnɒlədʒi/","N","tehnologiýa","технология","The use of science and machines to solve problems and make life easier","New technology helps students learn languages faster.","Täze tehnologiýa talyplara dilleri çalt öwrenmäge kömek edýär.","B1","Oxford 3000","innovation, engineering","modern technology, information technology, new technology","New",[{"book":"int","unit":5}]],["government","/ˈɡʌvənmənt/","N","hökümet","правительство","The group of people who officially govern a country","The government built new schools in the region.","Hökümet sebitde täze mekdepleri gurup berdi.","B1","Oxford 3000","administration, authority, cabinet","local government, government policy, the government announced","New",[{"book":"int","unit":6}]],["education","/ˌedʒuˈkeɪʃn/","N","bilim","образование","The process of teaching or learning, especially in a school or university","Education is free in Turkmenistan.","Türkmenistanda bilim mugt.","B1","Oxford 3000","schooling, training, learning","higher education, education system, receive an education","New",[{"book":"int","unit":7}]],["society","/səˈsaɪəti/","N","jemgyýet","общество","People in general, living together in a community with shared laws and customs","Sport plays an important part in our society.","Sport biziň jemgyýetimizde möhüm orun eýeleýär.","B1","Oxford 3000","community, the public","modern society, society as a whole, civil society","New",[{"book":"int","unit":8}]],["culture","/ˈkʌltʃə/","N","medeniýet","культура","The way of life, beliefs and customs of a particular group of people","Turkmen culture is famous for its carpets.","Türkmen medeniýeti halyçylygy bilen meşhurdyr.","B1","Oxford 3000","civilisation, heritage, tradition","local culture, popular culture, cultural differences","New",[{"book":"int","unit":9}]]]}</script>
