        <div class="qlab" data-i18n="rev_lab">REVIEW · SELECT THE CORRECT TRANSLATION</div>
        <div class="card qcard"><span class="spk2" style="width:42px;height:42px"><svg style="width:20px;height:20px"><use href="#i-head"/></svg></span>
        <b>“Hello, how are you?”</b></div>
